(998336, 118962, 23478, '<td valign="top">Excellent focus..</td>', 'Excellent focus..', '2004-11-08 04:03:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(998337, 118963, 24459, '<td valign="top">I''m tired of this whole US voting thing. <br/>Then again if you took this picture and put it in next year''s calendar that would mean half of US population (and most of the world) would not spend a penny on that issue as I can imagine nicer views of November than a very controversial president of US. In not the best shot either.</td>', 'I''m tired of this whole US voting thing. Then again if you took this picture and put it in next year''s calendar that would mean half of US population (and most of the world) would not spend a penny on that issue as I can imagine nicer views of November than a very controversial president of US. In not the best shot either.', '2004-11-08 04:03:59.000000', NULL, 1),
