(998500, 119013, 27482, '<td valign="top">Somehow this photo doesn´t make me think of December since there is no snow, more like some of the autum months but the photo itself is very nice.</td>', 'Somehow this photo doesn´t make me think of December since there is no snow, more like some of the autum months but the photo itself is very nice.', '2004-11-08 07:22:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(998502, 118614, 27482, '<td valign="top">IMO this would look better in portrait mode, 90 degrees clockwise because I just cant help but strain my neck to look at it from that angle.  Very well done though, nice lighting, no highlights on the watch itself and soft shadows and that´s not easy to pull off.</td>', 'IMO this would look better in portrait mode, 90 degrees clockwise because I just cant help but strain my neck to look at it from that angle.  Very well done though, nice lighting, no highlights on the watch itself and soft shadows and that´s not easy to pull off.', '2004-11-08 07:24:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(998505, 118781, 27482, '<td valign="top">You captured the gloomy miserable feel of an autumn day very well here, the image gave me chills and made me want to crawl under a blanket with a hot cup of cocoa, brrr...  However I don´t think you will score well with this one since aesthetically it´s not great to look at but I gave it an 8 just for the "feel " of this image, hope you do well.</td>', 'You captured the gloomy miserable feel of an autumn day very well here, the image gave me chills and made me want to crawl under a blanket with a hot cup of cocoa, brrr...  However I don´t think you will score well with this one since aesthetically it´s not great to look at but I gave it an 8 just for the "feel " of this image, hope you do well.', '2004-11-08 07:27:37.000000', NULL, 1),
