(998902, 119416, 2337, '<td valign="top">Conceptually i like this (even though I live where leaves never turn)...  But it seems to lack "wow"... Maybe coming in closer on fewer leaves?  Or further back for the whole tree?  This just didn''t stun me... Also, the focus seems a tad soft...  But that''s just me, and what do I know? :)</td>', 'Conceptually i like this (even though I live where leaves never turn)...  But it seems to lack "wow"... Maybe coming in closer on fewer leaves?  Or further back for the whole tree?  This just didn''t stun me... Also, the focus seems a tad soft...  But that''s just me, and what do I know? :)', '2004-11-08 11:54:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(998904, 117829, 2337, '<td valign="top">Very Octoberish colors... shadows work well... The flash burned a couple of spots, but no biggy... It seems a bit crowded in to me, but I''m guessing that''s what you were going for... But that''s just me, and what do I know? :)</td>', 'Very Octoberish colors... shadows work well... The flash burned a couple of spots, but no biggy... It seems a bit crowded in to me, but I''m guessing that''s what you were going for... But that''s just me, and what do I know? :)', '2004-11-08 11:57:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(998915, 118094, 2337, '<td valign="top">Shallow dof worked very well for you in the background... I think the impact might have been more dramatic with a ''slightly'' deeper dof so the shroom near the bottom was sharper... I like the line the drunk draws and the triangle it makes with the blurred tree in the back... nicely done :)</td>', 'Shallow dof worked very well for you in the background... I think the impact might have been more dramatic with a ''slightly'' deeper dof so the shroom near the bottom was sharper... I like the line the drunk draws and the triangle it makes with the blurred tree in the back... nicely done :)', '2004-11-08 12:00:26.000000', NULL, 1),
