(998942, 118043, 6008, '<td valign="top">I like the toning, it adds a timeless quality to the image and could easily have been taken any time in the last century. The foreground tree makes an excellent leading line and frame for the rest of the elements, and clearly shows a sense of wind as indicated by the title. The path also leads the eye nicely through the image. Even the small structure in the far background adds an interesting element. A very engaging image.</td>', 'I like the toning, it adds a timeless quality to the image and could easily have been taken any time in the last century. The foreground tree makes an excellent leading line and frame for the rest of the elements, and clearly shows a sense of wind as indicated by the title. The path also leads the eye nicely through the image. Even the small structure in the far background adds an interesting element. A very engaging image.', '2004-11-08 12:20:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(998943, 119572, 27293, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, but something attention grabbingn is missing in the front. Could be anything...</td>', 'Nice shot, but something attention grabbingn is missing in the front. Could be anything...', '2004-11-08 12:20:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(998944, 118590, 27293, '<td valign="top">Not very sharp and not very creative.</td>', 'Not very sharp and not very creative.', '2004-11-08 12:21:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(998952, 118758, 20115, '<td valign="top">Like I said--I think this is very creative and it is and focused beautifully.  Plus the lighting it good.  Once you get the tools down, you''ll be a star.</td>', 'Like I said--I think this is very creative and it is and focused beautifully.  Plus the lighting it good.  Once you get the tools down, you''ll be a star.', '2004-11-08 12:24:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(998955, 118770, 6008, '<td valign="top">I''m guessing the hazy feel to the image is due to a soft focus effect. The color has a strong blue cast but that goes with the chilly feel of November. The tree makes a good frame but unfortunately it''s only framing an expanse of water. The seagull adds a much needed third element and is positioned good on the branch, although I''m not too sure about the composition of the entire image. Perhaps cropping out the lower part of the tree would put more emphasis on the bird and not so much on the water.</td>', 'I''m guessing the hazy feel to the image is due to a soft focus effect. The color has a strong blue cast but that goes with the chilly feel of November. The tree makes a good frame but unfortunately it''s only framing an expanse of water. The seagull adds a much needed third element and is positioned good on the branch, although I''m not too sure about the composition of the entire image. Perhaps cropping out the lower part of the tree would put more emphasis on the bird and not so much on the water.', '2004-11-08 12:25:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(998959, 118813, 27293, '<td valign="top">northern lights are nice to see... once or twice. seeing them in every challenge gets a little old. Technically, digital noise needs to be cleaned up and i would cut about 100 pix from the bottom.</td>', 'northern lights are nice to see... once or twice. seeing them in every challenge gets a little old. Technically, digital noise needs to be cleaned up and i would cut about 100 pix from the bottom.', '2004-11-08 12:27:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(998961, 118959, 27293, '<td valign="top">A little oversharpened, noisy background and not the best-appealing composition. This had a lot more potential, imo.</td>', 'A little oversharpened, noisy background and not the best-appealing composition. This had a lot more potential, imo.', '2004-11-08 12:28:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(998964, 119520, 27293, '<td valign="top">THe harsh shadows from the light (flash?) are really killing this. Also the flower being dead center is not very appealing composition-wise.</td>', 'THe harsh shadows from the light (flash?) are really killing this. Also the flower being dead center is not very appealing composition-wise.', '2004-11-08 12:31:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(998967, 119026, 6008, '<td valign="top">I like the silkyness of the water and the fluidity of it as well. Composition looks ok and the big tree adds interest. You seem to have a little vignetting in the top left hand corner, and the image seems a little smaller than the 640 pixels you can use.</td>', 'I like the silkyness of the water and the fluidity of it as well. Composition looks ok and the big tree adds interest. You seem to have a little vignetting in the top left hand corner, and the image seems a little smaller than the 640 pixels you can use.', '2004-11-08 12:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(998974, 119396, 27293, '<td valign="top">Yet another symmetrial landscape... boring.</td>', 'Yet another symmetrial landscape... boring.', '2004-11-08 12:33:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(998980, 119338, 27293, '<td valign="top">Nice! What is missing technically is more or less compensated by the originality and impact. 7.</td>', 'Nice! What is missing technically is more or less compensated by the originality and impact. 7.', '2004-11-08 12:35:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(998981, 119541, 6008, '<td valign="top">It seems a tad underexposed and the colors, especially the grass, seems a little dull. A slight boost in saturation and a levels adjustment could make the image ''pop'' more. The composition is good.</td>', 'It seems a tad underexposed and the colors, especially the grass, seems a little dull. A slight boost in saturation and a levels adjustment could make the image ''pop'' more. The composition is good.', '2004-11-08 12:35:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(998985, 118341, 27293, '<td valign="top">Good idea, but the composition doesn''t appeal. The eye passes the baby and gets fixed on the teddy bear. Should be vice versa, don''t you think?</td>', 'Good idea, but the composition doesn''t appeal. The eye passes the baby and gets fixed on the teddy bear. Should be vice versa, don''t you think?', '2004-11-08 12:37:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(998992, 118963, 6008, '<td valign="top">Looks like you have good lighting and I like the warm tones although it might be slightly leaning toward red. The composition, depth of field are also good. The seal really looks like it is glowing.  The subject matter doesnt interest me but I''m sure there are people who would buy a calendar with this in it.</td>', 'Looks like you have good lighting and I like the warm tones although it might be slightly leaning toward red. The composition, depth of field are also good. The seal really looks like it is glowing.  The subject matter doesnt interest me but I''m sure there are people who would buy a calendar with this in it.', '2004-11-08 12:39:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(998995, 119394, 27293, '<td valign="top">I would either make it a little narrower or make it a horizontal shot altogether. Otherwise i love it. This is an example where 640 pix limit really does the picture a disservice :( But it''s not your fault, of course.</td>', 'I would either make it a little narrower or make it a horizontal shot altogether. Otherwise i love it. This is an example where 640 pix limit really does the picture a disservice :( But it''s not your fault, of course.', '2004-11-08 12:40:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(998996, 119393, 27293, '<td valign="top">How cliche... that was the challnge, though, so it''s all good. Not enough sharpness, or too deep DOF, imo.</td>', 'How cliche... that was the challnge, though, so it''s all good. Not enough sharpness, or too deep DOF, imo.', '2004-11-08 12:41:23.000000', NULL, 1),
