(999075, 118770, 20779, '<td valign="top">Beautiful effect you used. One of the best I have seen so far.</td>', 'Beautiful effect you used. One of the best I have seen so far.', '2004-11-08 13:31:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(999076, 118740, 24128, '<td valign="top">beautiful scene, can easily imagine this on a calendar - well done</td>', 'beautiful scene, can easily imagine this on a calendar - well done', '2004-11-08 13:32:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(999077, 119356, 20779, '<td valign="top">Wish I could give 15.</td>', 'Wish I could give 15.', '2004-11-08 13:33:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(999080, 118387, 24128, '<td valign="top">nice image, i think that the border may be a little too heavy, it feels like i''m having to look through the border rather than the border enhancing the image</td>', 'nice image, i think that the border may be a little too heavy, it feels like i''m having to look through the border rather than the border enhancing the image', '2004-11-08 13:33:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(999084, 119487, 6008, '<td valign="top">There seems to be a little too much dark foliage and my eyes seem to wander around looking for a central focus. The main tree with the orange leaves seem to pull my eyes the most, but it doesnt stand out enough to be enough of a focal point. The foliage to the left of that tree seems to be clumped together and fairly dark with not much detail. I would much rather see the tree and more of the water with the color of the sky reflected into it.</td>', 'There seems to be a little too much dark foliage and my eyes seem to wander around looking for a central focus. The main tree with the orange leaves seem to pull my eyes the most, but it doesnt stand out enough to be enough of a focal point. The foliage to the left of that tree seems to be clumped together and fairly dark with not much detail. I would much rather see the tree and more of the water with the color of the sky reflected into it.', '2004-11-08 13:35:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(999092, 119368, 6008, '<td valign="top">I can certainly see the theme of December very clearly in the image but it just doesnt hold much interest for me personally. There also seems to be a color cast in the image as if you look at the what should be white areas of the cards you can see they''re not quite exactly white. Changing the white point in levels would have helped correct it some and also likely brightened up the image too.</td>', 'I can certainly see the theme of December very clearly in the image but it just doesnt hold much interest for me personally. There also seems to be a color cast in the image as if you look at the what should be white areas of the cards you can see they''re not quite exactly white. Changing the white point in levels would have helped correct it some and also likely brightened up the image too.', '2004-11-08 13:38:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(999139, 119434, 5286, '<td valign="top">what a stunner. exceptional clarity. great use of black and white too. 10.</td>', 'what a stunner. exceptional clarity. great use of black and white too. 10.', '2004-11-08 14:24:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(999140, 118479, 26475, '<td valign="top">there''s no real point of focus - everything is slightly blurred.</td>', 'there''s no real point of focus - everything is slightly blurred.', '2004-11-08 14:24:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(999161, 118895, 28820, '<td valign="top">I like your composition, and the bright color of the mug really grabs your attention.  I''d rate this photograph higher if the lighting was better though (less flat from the front flash).</td>', 'I like your composition, and the bright color of the mug really grabs your attention.  I''d rate this photograph higher if the lighting was better though (less flat from the front flash).', '2004-11-08 14:48:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(999188, 119078, 8860, '<td valign="top"><b>Challenge link</b>: Beautifully strong.<br/> <br/><b>Image critique</b>: I absolutely want this to win. I envisage it on a large format calendar looking splendourous with so much space and serenity. It''s brilliantly simple.<br/> <br/><b>Out-of-challenge appeal</b>: maximum - in my faves now.</td>', 'Challenge link: Beautifully strong. Image critique: I absolutely want this to win. I envisage it on a large format calendar looking splendourous with so much space and serenity. It''s brilliantly simple. Out-of-challenge appeal: maximum - in my faves now.', '2004-11-08 15:07:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(999193, 118335, 8860, '<td valign="top"><b>Image critique</b>: simply refreshing and beautifully composed. Very well shot with rich colour and dynamism. You''ll be up at the top with this.<br/> <br/><b>Out-of-challenge appeal</b>: max - in my faves now.</td>', 'Image critique: simply refreshing and beautifully composed. Very well shot with rich colour and dynamism. You''ll be up at the top with this. Out-of-challenge appeal: max - in my faves now.', '2004-11-08 15:09:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(999197, 119155, 8860, '<td valign="top"><b>Challenge link</b>: total. <br/> <br/><b>Image critique</b>: this is just dazzlingly great! I love it the sheer heat from this is tangible with so much detail. Ribbon for sure.<br/> <br/><b>Out-of-challenge appeal</b>: total. Faved already.</td>', 'Challenge link: total.  Image critique: this is just dazzlingly great! I love it the sheer heat from this is tangible with so much detail. Ribbon for sure. Out-of-challenge appeal: total. Faved already.', '2004-11-08 15:11:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(999235, 118958, 6073, '<td valign="top">Good picture, but it needs a little excitement.  An additional interesting element.  Maybe fil flash on the grass in the foreground?  A couple walking the beach hand n hand?</td>', 'Good picture, but it needs a little excitement.  An additional interesting element.  Maybe fil flash on the grass in the foreground?  A couple walking the beach hand n hand?', '2004-11-08 15:34:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(999240, 118370, 10413, '<td valign="top">This is by far the top photo in this challenge.  Good luck!</td>', 'This is by far the top photo in this challenge.  Good luck!', '2004-11-08 15:36:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(999250, 119077, 10413, '<td valign="top">This is wonderful!.  I love how it looks like snow they are on.  This is one of my  top 3 picks.  Good luck!</td>', 'This is wonderful!.  I love how it looks like snow they are on.  This is one of my  top 3 picks.  Good luck!', '2004-11-08 15:39:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(999253, 118094, 6073, '<td valign="top">I think the DOF is a bit too shallow.  I would rate higher if all bark growth was visible.</td>', 'I think the DOF is a bit too shallow.  I would rate higher if all bark growth was visible.', '2004-11-08 15:40:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(999257, 117888, 10413, '<td valign="top">Beautiful scene. Has such a peaceful feel and love the reflection. One of my top picks.  Good luck!</td>', 'Beautiful scene. Has such a peaceful feel and love the reflection. One of my top picks.  Good luck!', '2004-11-08 15:41:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(999259, 118958, 10413, '<td valign="top">Breath taking scene. ONe of the best photos in this challenge.  Good luck on a ribbon.</td>', 'Breath taking scene. ONe of the best photos in this challenge.  Good luck on a ribbon.', '2004-11-08 15:43:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(999263, 118312, 10413, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot and one of my top picks.  There is so much expression in his/her eyes.  Good luck.</td>', 'Excellent shot and one of my top picks.  There is so much expression in his/her eyes.  Good luck.', '2004-11-08 15:44:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(999266, 119569, 2337, '<td valign="top">I know you''ve likely heard this more than a few times, but... "Your photo title should be the month to which your photo belongs."   No idea what month you''re going for... Aside from that it''s a nice image. I love the color... The horizon seems a bit sloped... But that''s just me, and what do I know? :)</td>', 'I know you''ve likely heard this more than a few times, but... "Your photo title should be the month to which your photo belongs."   No idea what month you''re going for... Aside from that it''s a nice image. I love the color... The horizon seems a bit sloped... But that''s just me, and what do I know? :)', '2004-11-08 15:46:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(999267, 119190, 10413, '<td valign="top">The light coming through the clouds is great.  Very nice shot.  Good luck!</td>', 'The light coming through the clouds is great.  Very nice shot.  Good luck!', '2004-11-08 15:46:47.000000', NULL, 1),
