(999279, 119572, 10413, '<td valign="top">Looks like a beautiful July day. Very pretty beach scene.</td>', 'Looks like a beautiful July day. Very pretty beach scene.', '2004-11-08 15:54:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(999280, 119155, 19959, '<td valign="top">Fantastic shot. I just wonder if all the American voters will ''get it'' Good luck, you got my vote!</td>', 'Fantastic shot. I just wonder if all the American voters will ''get it'' Good luck, you got my vote!', '2004-11-08 15:55:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(999283, 118623, 10413, '<td valign="top">Love the fall colors and all the leaves on the ground. Very nice shot.</td>', 'Love the fall colors and all the leaves on the ground. Very nice shot.', '2004-11-08 15:55:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(999284, 118859, 6008, '<td valign="top">A good white color without losing detail in the plate, which is very cute. The red of the sauce blends well with the white and adds a nice color contrast. The depth of field is good, the theme of hearts is good and appropriate for February. Composition is good too. Good image!</td>', 'A good white color without losing detail in the plate, which is very cute. The red of the sauce blends well with the white and adds a nice color contrast. The depth of field is good, the theme of hearts is good and appropriate for February. Composition is good too. Good image!', '2004-11-08 15:56:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(999286, 119399, 10413, '<td valign="top">Breath taking scene.  The colors are so brilliant.  One of the top ones in this challenge.  Good luck.</td>', 'Breath taking scene.  The colors are so brilliant.  One of the top ones in this challenge.  Good luck.', '2004-11-08 15:57:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(999288, 119569, 19959, '<td valign="top">Oops, you should have titled the picture with the Calendar month. This doesn''t meet the challenge but it is an excellent shot. I''ll give you 7 for the shot alone, nice one. (PS you might also like to straighten the horizon..)</td>', 'Oops, you should have titled the picture with the Calendar month. This doesn''t meet the challenge but it is an excellent shot. I''ll give you 7 for the shot alone, nice one. (PS you might also like to straighten the horizon..)', '2004-11-08 15:58:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(999290, 119440, 6008, '<td valign="top">It''s a good shot but feels fairly static. You have some high-flying fast jets seemingly suspended in mid air in the middle of the shot. Dont get me wrong, I''ve seen shots like this a lot and I''m sure a shot like this would appear in a calendar but it''s not very compositionally interesting even though their manoeuver is certainly exciting to watch.</td>', 'It''s a good shot but feels fairly static. You have some high-flying fast jets seemingly suspended in mid air in the middle of the shot. Dont get me wrong, I''ve seen shots like this a lot and I''m sure a shot like this would appear in a calendar but it''s not very compositionally interesting even though their manoeuver is certainly exciting to watch.', '2004-11-08 15:59:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(999292, 118781, 19959, '<td valign="top">LOL. This would have been my entry... too much flippin'' rain to go out and grab a shot. This looks about right for Nov in the UK :-)... Not so sure I''d want this picture on my calendar for 30days though... Good luck!</td>', 'LOL. This would have been my entry... too much flippin'' rain to go out and grab a shot. This looks about right for Nov in the UK :-)... Not so sure I''d want this picture on my calendar for 30days though... Good luck!', '2004-11-08 16:00:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(999293, 119070, 19959, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.</td>', 'Beautiful.', '2004-11-08 16:00:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(999295, 119079, 19959, '<td valign="top">Simple, effective. Good entry.</td>', 'Simple, effective. Good entry.', '2004-11-08 16:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(999296, 118963, 19959, '<td valign="top">Arghhh.... The 2004, 5, 6, 7 Bush Calendar...</td>', 'Arghhh.... The 2004, 5, 6, 7 Bush Calendar...', '2004-11-08 16:01:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(999297, 119304, 19959, '<td valign="top">Very nice.</td>', 'Very nice.', '2004-11-08 16:01:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(999301, 118813, 19959, '<td valign="top">WOW. This is fantastic.</td>', 'WOW. This is fantastic.', '2004-11-08 16:03:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(999303, 119376, 19959, '<td valign="top">Lots of graves in this comp. I wonder if I would want them on my Calendar??!!<br/>Nice shot though.</td>', 'Lots of graves in this comp. I wonder if I would want them on my Calendar??!!Nice shot though.', '2004-11-08 16:04:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(999305, 119336, 6008, '<td valign="top">Wonderful lighting and depth of field! S/he just pops out of the shot. The colors are great and the white dog contrasts nicely with them. The leaf in action and the dog watching carefully is a wonderful interaction. The catchlight in the eye is great too. Only thing I''m not sure about is the composition. The cropped out feet makes it feel a little odd. Having the entire legs/feet in or even the entire dog would be good or else cropping out the legs but I cant decide if that causes it to lose some dynamics or not. Even so, it''s a fun, well-shot image!</td>', 'Wonderful lighting and depth of field! S/he just pops out of the shot. The colors are great and the white dog contrasts nicely with them. The leaf in action and the dog watching carefully is a wonderful interaction. The catchlight in the eye is great too. Only thing I''m not sure about is the composition. The cropped out feet makes it feel a little odd. Having the entire legs/feet in or even the entire dog would be good or else cropping out the legs but I cant decide if that causes it to lose some dynamics or not. Even so, it''s a fun, well-shot image!', '2004-11-08 16:05:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(999306, 119434, 6073, '<td valign="top">If this is a real animal, I would really like to see how you did this.  Awesome job.  I''m guessing this bird is long dead and stiff as a board.  :)</td>', 'If this is a real animal, I would really like to see how you did this.  Awesome job.  I''m guessing this bird is long dead and stiff as a board.  :)', '2004-11-08 16:05:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(999308, 119104, 2337, '<td valign="top">Seeing this, I recalibrated my monitor... I''m now convinced it''s not my monitor... The sky is green...  I like the composition though</td>', 'Seeing this, I recalibrated my monitor... I''m now convinced it''s not my monitor... The sky is green...  I like the composition though', '2004-11-08 16:05:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(999309, 119336, 19959, '<td valign="top">Well captured. I like this a lot.</td>', 'Well captured. I like this a lot.', '2004-11-08 16:05:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(999310, 119576, 19959, '<td valign="top">LOL.</td>', 'LOL.', '2004-11-08 16:06:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(999311, 119380, 2337, '<td valign="top">My eye wanders with no where to really go... It''s a nice scene, but with no clear subject.  But that''s just me, and what do I know? :)</td>', 'My eye wanders with no where to really go... It''s a nice scene, but with no clear subject.  But that''s just me, and what do I know? :)', '2004-11-08 16:07:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(999314, 119356, 6008, '<td valign="top">It''s an interesting shot but I''m not sure what to say about it. I like the light dusting of snow on the sculpture - the white contrasts nicely with the black and it is almost like it is adding accents to the curves and details. The mountain backdrop is stunning and works well to lead the eye down to the horizon, although that appears to be slightly tilted. The muted colors except for the splash of yellow near the horizon line adds to the chilly feel of the shot.</td>', 'It''s an interesting shot but I''m not sure what to say about it. I like the light dusting of snow on the sculpture - the white contrasts nicely with the black and it is almost like it is adding accents to the curves and details. The mountain backdrop is stunning and works well to lead the eye down to the horizon, although that appears to be slightly tilted. The muted colors except for the splash of yellow near the horizon line adds to the chilly feel of the shot.', '2004-11-08 16:08:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(999319, 119219, 2337, '<td valign="top">Interesting use of desat... Clever concept.</td>', 'Interesting use of desat... Clever concept.', '2004-11-08 16:09:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(999326, 119132, 6008, '<td valign="top">The scene itself is wonderful and has near, middle and far elements. The placement of the tree is good and the curve of the land almost mirrors the curve of the mountain. It looks like it was shot under a fairly harsh light so the lighting seems a little flat. The quality doesnt look too good as there is some noise in the blues and either it has been oversharpened, too much contrast, or just the camera''s resolution.</td>', 'The scene itself is wonderful and has near, middle and far elements. The placement of the tree is good and the curve of the land almost mirrors the curve of the mountain. It looks like it was shot under a fairly harsh light so the lighting seems a little flat. The quality doesnt look too good as there is some noise in the blues and either it has been oversharpened, too much contrast, or just the camera''s resolution.', '2004-11-08 16:12:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(999333, 119521, 1827, '<td valign="top">The saturation is pushed too far for me. 5</td>', 'The saturation is pushed too far for me. 5', '2004-11-08 16:15:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(999335, 119079, 6008, '<td valign="top">I like the shape that the leaves make and the blend of colors is also good. The white background is nicely white but the leaves almost feel a little too isolated and just floating there. It certainly conveys the chosen month well.</td>', 'I like the shape that the leaves make and the blend of colors is also good. The white background is nicely white but the leaves almost feel a little too isolated and just floating there. It certainly conveys the chosen month well.', '2004-11-08 16:18:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(999343, 118312, 1827, '<td valign="top">Beware the "eyes" of march. lol.</td>', 'Beware the "eyes" of march. lol.', '2004-11-08 16:24:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(999352, 119582, 1827, '<td valign="top">The skin tones suffer as a result of the boosted saturation.  Her pose is nice, but her feet are not pretty (probably the angle); however cropping them out doesn''t work either.  A good effort. 6</td>', 'The skin tones suffer as a result of the boosted saturation.  Her pose is nice, but her feet are not pretty (probably the angle); however cropping them out doesn''t work either.  A good effort. 6', '2004-11-08 16:29:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(999358, 119077, 27293, '<td valign="top">It''s a calendar picture, alright... Well executed too. So a 10 as part of the clallenge... I would never buy such a calendar though, it''s just too cheesy and cliche.</td>', 'It''s a calendar picture, alright... Well executed too. So a 10 as part of the clallenge... I would never buy such a calendar though, it''s just too cheesy and cliche.', '2004-11-08 16:33:32.000000', NULL, 1),
