(999365, 118954, 6999, '<td valign="top">I do like this, though it''s perhaps a touch ''real'' for my idea of a calendar shot. It has the feel of a Grodon Whyte shot, though that''s a nexk-out-sticking comment, if ever there was one. The dynamic range seems a touch unlikely, but it works visually here.</td>', 'I do like this, though it''s perhaps a touch ''real'' for my idea of a calendar shot. It has the feel of a Grodon Whyte shot, though that''s a nexk-out-sticking comment, if ever there was one. The dynamic range seems a touch unlikely, but it works visually here.', '2004-11-08 16:36:25.000000', NULL, 1),
