(999424, 118525, 24454, '<td valign="top">I really like this picture a lot.  The coloring is great, and even tho most dpc''ers seem to hate frames, I think when they are done right, they really add.   This frame is perfect for this picture.   It doesn''t quite fit what I''d expect to see on a calendar, but I rated it really high anyway because it''s such a nice composition.</td>', 'I really like this picture a lot.  The coloring is great, and even tho most dpc''ers seem to hate frames, I think when they are done right, they really add.   This frame is perfect for this picture.   It doesn''t quite fit what I''d expect to see on a calendar, but I rated it really high anyway because it''s such a nice composition.', '2004-11-08 17:04:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(999426, 118094, 24454, '<td valign="top">Maybe just a tad to shallow of a depth of field.  It seems that at least all the foreground objects should be in focus.   But it''s a nice capture of that autumn October feel.</td>', 'Maybe just a tad to shallow of a depth of field.  It seems that at least all the foreground objects should be in focus.   But it''s a nice capture of that autumn October feel.', '2004-11-08 17:05:21.000000', NULL, 1),
