(999448, 119013, 24454, '<td valign="top">I really love this picture.  It looks to me a liittle more like an Autumn month than December, but that doesn''t matter at all -- it''s definitely one of my favorites in this challenge so far.  I wish the puppy were a little more contrasting against the brownish leaves, but I guess what can you do about that.   Good job!</td>', 'I really love this picture.  It looks to me a liittle more like an Autumn month than December, but that doesn''t matter at all -- it''s definitely one of my favorites in this challenge so far.  I wish the puppy were a little more contrasting against the brownish leaves, but I guess what can you do about that.   Good job!', '2004-11-08 17:14:32.000000', NULL, 1),
