(999712, 118479, 22975, '<td valign="top">This picture''s really sweet... I love the selective desaturation, but I don''t love the border (or at least the opacity of it).  It''s a great shot, though, one you should be proud of!</td>', 'This picture''s really sweet... I love the selective desaturation, but I don''t love the border (or at least the opacity of it).  It''s a great shot, though, one you should be proud of!', '2004-11-08 19:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(999713, 119491, 20941, '<td valign="top">stunning a definate calender shot! beautiful work</td>', 'stunning a definate calender shot! beautiful work', '2004-11-08 19:14:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(999716, 119434, 20941, '<td valign="top">wonderful composition and detail!</td>', 'wonderful composition and detail!', '2004-11-08 19:14:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(999717, 119453, 22975, '<td valign="top">I''d buy this calendar!  What a cutie!</td>', 'I''d buy this calendar!  What a cutie!', '2004-11-08 19:15:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(999719, 119050, 20941, '<td valign="top">Beautiful calender page for December!  Great job!</td>', 'Beautiful calender page for December!  Great job!', '2004-11-08 19:16:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(999727, 119336, 20941, '<td valign="top">Great capture!! I''ld love this on my calender</td>', 'Great capture!! I''ld love this on my calender', '2004-11-08 19:21:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(999783, 119013, 1280, '<td valign="top">I don''t know what this has to do with December.  It also took me a while to figure out that that is a doggie.  Fun family pic.</td>', 'I don''t know what this has to do with December.  It also took me a while to figure out that that is a doggie.  Fun family pic.', '2004-11-08 19:54:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(999790, 118987, 1280, '<td valign="top">Pretty.</td>', 'Pretty.', '2004-11-08 19:58:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(999795, 119190, 1280, '<td valign="top">Very nice! Great light.</td>', 'Very nice! Great light.', '2004-11-08 20:00:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(999824, 119179, 1280, '<td valign="top">It''s a beauty and I love it.  The colour is good.</td>', 'It''s a beauty and I love it.  The colour is good.', '2004-11-08 20:14:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(999829, 118558, 1280, '<td valign="top">Nice composition.  A little grainy.</td>', 'Nice composition.  A little grainy.', '2004-11-08 20:15:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(999834, 119534, 1280, '<td valign="top">The colour could use a mild boost, especially the greens.</td>', 'The colour could use a mild boost, especially the greens.', '2004-11-08 20:16:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(999841, 119029, 22689, '<td valign="top">The roses are maybe a bit dark but good idea !</td>', 'The roses are maybe a bit dark but good idea !', '2004-11-08 20:18:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(999843, 118962, 1280, '<td valign="top">Oh they''d be just perfect in a "cute" calender.  My only nitpick is the blades of grass over the one''s face and beak. Your perspective is perfect, nice and low.  Good!</td>', 'Oh they''d be just perfect in a "cute" calender.  My only nitpick is the blades of grass over the one''s face and beak. Your perspective is perfect, nice and low.  Good!', '2004-11-08 20:18:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(999847, 118945, 1280, '<td valign="top">pretty.</td>', 'pretty.', '2004-11-08 20:19:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(999862, 118963, 19936, '<td valign="top">The faces in the background tell the story here.  Problem is I do not see this on a calendar.</td>', 'The faces in the background tell the story here.  Problem is I do not see this on a calendar.', '2004-11-08 20:26:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(999871, 118631, 1792, '<td valign="top">The bright areas in the background seem to distract from the central subject.  Nice focus on the subject and I like the depth of field.</td>', 'The bright areas in the background seem to distract from the central subject.  Nice focus on the subject and I like the depth of field.', '2004-11-08 20:28:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(999882, 118614, 1792, '<td valign="top">Seems like a little too much shadow.  Hard to avoid, but it sort of distracts.  Focus seems a little off too.  Nice composition.</td>', 'Seems like a little too much shadow.  Hard to avoid, but it sort of distracts.  Focus seems a little off too.  Nice composition.', '2004-11-08 20:31:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(999888, 119578, 1280, '<td valign="top">It''s nice, but doesn''t speak December.</td>', 'It''s nice, but doesn''t speak December.', '2004-11-08 20:33:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(999890, 119219, 13091, '<td valign="top">Good picture but hard to relate it with February... especially here with 2 feet of snow  ;)</td>', 'Good picture but hard to relate it with February... especially here with 2 feet of snow  ;)', '2004-11-08 20:33:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(999894, 119029, 1280, '<td valign="top">Seems overly contrasted.  The dark areas are too dark to see detail, and the highlights are somewhat blown out. I like how it stands out from the bg.</td>', 'Seems overly contrasted.  The dark areas are too dark to see detail, and the highlights are somewhat blown out. I like how it stands out from the bg.', '2004-11-08 20:35:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(999895, 119333, 16148, '<td valign="top">Well done.  Great shot from Union Station.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Well done.  Great shot from Union Station.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2004-11-08 20:35:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(999898, 119387, 1280, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting.</td>', 'Nice lighting.', '2004-11-08 20:36:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(999903, 118623, 1792, '<td valign="top">Nice composition</td>', 'Nice composition', '2004-11-08 20:38:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(999909, 119122, 1280, '<td valign="top">Precious indeed!</td>', 'Precious indeed!', '2004-11-08 20:40:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(999927, 119554, 1792, '<td valign="top">A lower point of view might be good with this scene.</td>', 'A lower point of view might be good with this scene.', '2004-11-08 20:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(999940, 118857, 1792, '<td valign="top">Nice depth of field, however the larger out of focus leaf at the left seems to detract from photo.</td>', 'Nice depth of field, however the larger out of focus leaf at the left seems to detract from photo.', '2004-11-08 20:48:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(999951, 119291, 1280, '<td valign="top">Good!</td>', 'Good!', '2004-11-08 20:54:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(999957, 118859, 11895, '<td valign="top">over exposed</td>', 'over exposed', '2004-11-08 20:59:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(999974, 118691, 1280, '<td valign="top">This is sweet.  They don''t look very real for some reason.  Perhaps you reduced noise and in so doing blurred some detail?  Anyway I do like it. Cedar Waxwings I believe.</td>', 'This is sweet.  They don''t look very real for some reason.  Perhaps you reduced noise and in so doing blurred some detail?  Anyway I do like it. Cedar Waxwings I believe.', '2004-11-08 21:07:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(999976, 119359, 1280, '<td valign="top">Though a somewhat accurate depiction,  for a calendar I''m afraid it wouldn''t work.  The quackers don''t stand out against the bg.</td>', 'Though a somewhat accurate depiction,  for a calendar I''m afraid it wouldn''t work.  The quackers don''t stand out against the bg.', '2004-11-08 21:08:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(999977, 118954, 1280, '<td valign="top">Nice.  Colour seems a bit too intense.</td>', 'Nice.  Colour seems a bit too intense.', '2004-11-08 21:09:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(999978, 118895, 1280, '<td valign="top">Different.  I like it.</td>', 'Different.  I like it.', '2004-11-08 21:12:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(999979, 118778, 1280, '<td valign="top">Striking!</td>', 'Striking!', '2004-11-08 21:13:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(999989, 119300, 1280, '<td valign="top">Focus is a bit soft.  I like it though.</td>', 'Focus is a bit soft.  I like it though.', '2004-11-08 21:16:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(999996, 119050, 1280, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!  Awwwwwww  I miss my mountains.</td>', 'Beautiful!  Awwwwwww  I miss my mountains.', '2004-11-08 21:19:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000003, 119575, 1280, '<td valign="top">Too busy, but great colours.</td>', 'Too busy, but great colours.', '2004-11-08 21:22:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000012, 119336, 1280, '<td valign="top">How wonderful!  The detail on the pooch is vg, the dof is just right, and your timing impeccable.  Love it.  My choice for first place. 10!</td>', 'How wonderful!  The detail on the pooch is vg, the dof is just right, and your timing impeccable.  Love it.  My choice for first place. 10!', '2004-11-08 21:26:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000020, 118312, 1280, '<td valign="top">He is GORGEOUS!!!  Good one for March. In like a lamb out like a lion. The tones are very natural looking, the dof is perfect revealing his texture. I love everything about this. 10</td>', 'He is GORGEOUS!!!  Good one for March. In like a lamb out like a lion. The tones are very natural looking, the dof is perfect revealing his texture. I love everything about this. 10', '2004-11-08 21:30:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000026, 119102, 1280, '<td valign="top">Your colours are superb.  Unfortunately much of the textural detail is not evident. The setting works well.</td>', 'Your colours are superb.  Unfortunately much of the textural detail is not evident. The setting works well.', '2004-11-08 21:38:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000027, 118472, 1280, '<td valign="top">Striking!</td>', 'Striking!', '2004-11-08 21:39:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000044, 118387, 1280, '<td valign="top">I like the colours and the perspective.  Nicely exposed.  I don''t care for the clunky border BUT I don''t rate on the border anyway.  Some people do though, and I suspect there will be others who don''t like it. Framing is a personal thing for folks I think.<br/>The vehicle in the pic bothers me.  My eyes keep getting drawn to it.</td>', 'I like the colours and the perspective.  Nicely exposed.  I don''t care for the clunky border BUT I don''t rate on the border anyway.  Some people do though, and I suspect there will be others who don''t like it. Framing is a personal thing for folks I think.The vehicle in the pic bothers me.  My eyes keep getting drawn to it.', '2004-11-08 21:46:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000052, 118420, 28675, '<td valign="top">Great</td>', 'Great', '2004-11-08 21:54:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000054, 119018, 11895, '<td valign="top">too much frame, not enough pic, I think I would have liked the photo but can''t see much of it</td>', 'too much frame, not enough pic, I think I would have liked the photo but can''t see much of it', '2004-11-08 21:58:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000061, 119286, 11895, '<td valign="top">the border looks gimmicky and the sky looks pretty photoshopped. a good shot that needs to look more natural</td>', 'the border looks gimmicky and the sky looks pretty photoshopped. a good shot that needs to look more natural', '2004-11-08 22:03:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000078, 118954, 7969, '<td valign="top">Really beautiful shot and mood in this image, very well done.  In my top 3</td>', 'Really beautiful shot and mood in this image, very well done.  In my top 3', '2004-11-08 22:20:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000083, 119336, 7969, '<td valign="top">Great capture, I tried for a whole afternoon to get a shot of a leaf falling so I know it is not easy, and with a dog staring intently, impressive indeed, I would like to see what it looks like with a tighter crop just his haed and leaf.  Just curious, well done.</td>', 'Great capture, I tried for a whole afternoon to get a shot of a leaf falling so I know it is not easy, and with a dog staring intently, impressive indeed, I would like to see what it looks like with a tighter crop just his haed and leaf.  Just curious, well done.', '2004-11-08 22:22:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000084, 119453, 7969, '<td valign="top">this is a great dog shot, I love the whiskers and the eyes.  Very cute.</td>', 'this is a great dog shot, I love the whiskers and the eyes.  Very cute.', '2004-11-08 22:23:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000110, 119018, 24065, '<td valign="top">I rarely comment on a person''s borders, but this one just overwhelms what could have been a beautiful photo.  I would have rated it higher without the frame/border.</td>', 'I rarely comment on a person''s borders, but this one just overwhelms what could have been a beautiful photo.  I would have rated it higher without the frame/border.', '2004-11-08 22:47:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000114, 119569, 2764, '<td valign="top">eeps - straighten the horizon -</td>', 'eeps - straighten the horizon -', '2004-11-08 22:55:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000124, 119576, 2337, '<td valign="top">Not much tone range here...</td>', 'Not much tone range here...', '2004-11-08 23:15:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000126, 117977, 2337, '<td valign="top">Nice arrangement!  The lights caused hotspots in several places though.  Might have been a good idea to diffuse the light .. But that''s just me, and what do I know? :)</td>', 'Nice arrangement!  The lights caused hotspots in several places though.  Might have been a good idea to diffuse the light .. But that''s just me, and what do I know? :)', '2004-11-08 23:18:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000127, 119221, 2337, '<td valign="top">Stunning :)</td>', 'Stunning :)', '2004-11-08 23:19:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000128, 117914, 17837, '<td valign="top">good idea, though the image is small and lacks contrast and saturation. It''s very flat as is.</td>', 'good idea, though the image is small and lacks contrast and saturation. It''s very flat as is.', '2004-11-08 23:20:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000133, 119250, 2337, '<td valign="top">The longer I look, the more I like this... It''s crept up to a 10 now, so I better vote now... can''t go to 11 :)</td>', 'The longer I look, the more I like this... It''s crept up to a 10 now, so I better vote now... can''t go to 11 :)', '2004-11-08 23:26:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000135, 119521, 17837, '<td valign="top">too much proccessing.</td>', 'too much proccessing.', '2004-11-08 23:27:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000138, 119078, 2337, '<td valign="top">For the longest time I thought these were cracks in a ceiling... Took a while to figure this one out...</td>', 'For the longest time I thought these were cracks in a ceiling... Took a while to figure this one out...', '2004-11-08 23:31:14.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1000142, 118963, 2337, '<td valign="top">I''m sure you''re getting a polar response based more on your subject than your photo... I''ll try to avoid that... The head to the left of the President looks like it''s attached to him (maybe an ear piece like he wore in the debates?)... A closer crop eliminating the line above his head might have helped too...</td>', 'I''m sure you''re getting a polar response based more on your subject than your photo... I''ll try to avoid that... The head to the left of the President looks like it''s attached to him (maybe an ear piece like he wore in the debates?)... A closer crop eliminating the line above his head might have helped too...', '2004-11-08 23:37:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000144, 118792, 2337, '<td valign="top">No idea what month this is for.  The challenge asked that you use the month for the title...</td>', 'No idea what month this is for.  The challenge asked that you use the month for the title...', '2004-11-08 23:39:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000146, 118472, 2337, '<td valign="top">Very interesting effect on the sky... Surreal...</td>', 'Very interesting effect on the sky... Surreal...', '2004-11-08 23:40:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000148, 119377, 22046, '<td valign="top">Beautifully lighted. Brings out the rich red and green of the fruit and the moss. Well done.</td>', 'Beautifully lighted. Brings out the rich red and green of the fruit and the moss. Well done.', '2004-11-08 23:41:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000149, 118945, 22046, '<td valign="top">Very professional looking image. I can definitely see this as a calendar image. I''d have put April just because that is when the tulips are in bloom here in the Northwest where many are grown. But I''m not taking off any points for that. This is a 10.</td>', 'Very professional looking image. I can definitely see this as a calendar image. I''d have put April just because that is when the tulips are in bloom here in the Northwest where many are grown. But I''m not taking off any points for that. This is a 10.', '2004-11-08 23:42:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000150, 119453, 22046, '<td valign="top">Perfect focus and color. Having the white background really brings out the dog. And having his body back behind just emphasizes his size and shape. Also the lighting is excellent. One of my top picks.</td>', 'Perfect focus and color. Having the white background really brings out the dog. And having his body back behind just emphasizes his size and shape. Also the lighting is excellent. One of my top picks.', '2004-11-08 23:44:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000151, 119526, 22046, '<td valign="top">Wonderful color and shapes and texture. I can certainly see this shot in a calendar. Excellent work.</td>', 'Wonderful color and shapes and texture. I can certainly see this shot in a calendar. Excellent work.', '2004-11-08 23:45:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000153, 118525, 22046, '<td valign="top">I like the quality of this very much. It feels like a pen and ink drawing. I can definitely see this on a calendar. Elegant take on the topic.</td>', 'I like the quality of this very much. It feels like a pen and ink drawing. I can definitely see this on a calendar. Elegant take on the topic.', '2004-11-08 23:47:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000155, 118335, 22046, '<td valign="top">Wonderful graphic feel to this one. One of my top choices.</td>', 'Wonderful graphic feel to this one. One of my top choices.', '2004-11-08 23:48:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000156, 118813, 22046, '<td valign="top">You are lucky to live in a place where these lights exist. The tree on the left really makes this image. Excellent work.</td>', 'You are lucky to live in a place where these lights exist. The tree on the left really makes this image. Excellent work.', '2004-11-08 23:51:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000157, 119581, 22046, '<td valign="top">Clever idea. Works well for me.</td>', 'Clever idea. Works well for me.', '2004-11-08 23:52:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000158, 119155, 28108, '<td valign="top">What a great shot! I keep my 10s for really outstanding picture and that is one of them! The contrasts are beautiful... This really gets your attention and each details makes it so you can''t look away... (I hope I don''t sound like pyro!) Condradulations! This one of my favorites so far!</td>', 'What a great shot! I keep my 10s for really outstanding picture and that is one of them! The contrasts are beautiful... This really gets your attention and each details makes it so you can''t look away... (I hope I don''t sound like pyro!) Condradulations! This one of my favorites so far!', '2004-11-08 23:53:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000160, 119399, 22046, '<td valign="top">Wow! this is awesome. I can surely see looking at this every day for a month.</td>', 'Wow! this is awesome. I can surely see looking at this every day for a month.', '2004-11-08 23:53:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000162, 118370, 22046, '<td valign="top">Sweet portrait. I lke the way you''ve placed her to one side of the image.</td>', 'Sweet portrait. I lke the way you''ve placed her to one side of the image.', '2004-11-08 23:55:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000169, 119190, 2337, '<td valign="top">Solid ~10~</td>', 'Solid ~10~', '2004-11-08 23:58:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000170, 118380, 22046, '<td valign="top">Nice scenic shot. I can certainly see this in a calendar.</td>', 'Nice scenic shot. I can certainly see this in a calendar.', '2004-11-08 23:58:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000175, 118043, 22046, '<td valign="top">Very fine. Love that windswept tree.</td>', 'Very fine. Love that windswept tree.', '2004-11-09 00:03:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000189, 119569, 1792, '<td valign="top">Interesting, but sloping horizon seems distracting.</td>', 'Interesting, but sloping horizon seems distracting.', '2004-11-09 00:14:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000244, 119564, 24976, '<td valign="top">i wish there were a bit more yellow leaves to contrast the reds...</td>', 'i wish there were a bit more yellow leaves to contrast the reds...', '2004-11-09 01:26:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000246, 119359, 24976, '<td valign="top">a bit too busy, the ducks are beginning to blend in rather than stand out of the landscape.</td>', 'a bit too busy, the ducks are beginning to blend in rather than stand out of the landscape.', '2004-11-09 01:27:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000256, 119190, 24128, '<td valign="top">beautiful and interesting image - well done</td>', 'beautiful and interesting image - well done', '2004-11-09 01:39:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000258, 119481, 24128, '<td valign="top">nice pic, this i can see on a calendar, well done</td>', 'nice pic, this i can see on a calendar, well done', '2004-11-09 01:40:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000260, 119519, 24128, '<td valign="top">good stong image, I can see this on the office wall with my holidays clearly marked in yellow highlighter on the dates printed beneath</td>', 'good stong image, I can see this on the office wall with my holidays clearly marked in yellow highlighter on the dates printed beneath', '2004-11-09 01:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000264, 119384, 29168, '<td valign="top">I''m biased - I love sunsets/rises. The reflection is nicely captured. Persaonlly I might have cropped just a little more off the left to draw the tree further from center.</td>', 'I''m biased - I love sunsets/rises. The reflection is nicely captured. Persaonlly I might have cropped just a little more off the left to draw the tree further from center.', '2004-11-09 01:46:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000266, 119577, 29168, '<td valign="top">Stunny shot! Perhaps a little too "contrasty". There''s a wide range of light in this photo but it seems balanced beautifully.</td>', 'Stunny shot! Perhaps a little too "contrasty". There''s a wide range of light in this photo but it seems balanced beautifully.', '2004-11-09 01:47:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000267, 118288, 29168, '<td valign="top">Hmmm. Some perpective might have been nice here to give the shadows more "meaning." It can be hard to capture shells on a beach in sunlight without over-exposing highly reflective shiny surfaces. There is little of that here though - well done.</td>', 'Hmmm. Some perpective might have been nice here to give the shadows more "meaning." It can be hard to capture shells on a beach in sunlight without over-exposing highly reflective shiny surfaces. There is little of that here though - well done.', '2004-11-09 01:51:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000271, 119526, 24128, '<td valign="top">great image - well done</td>', 'great image - well done', '2004-11-09 01:52:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000274, 119302, 29168, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. If other objects to the left would have allowed it, I think I''d prefer the crop to extend more left and a touch higher to balance angles and light somehow.</td>', 'Nice shot. If other objects to the left would have allowed it, I think I''d prefer the crop to extend more left and a touch higher to balance angles and light somehow.', '2004-11-09 01:53:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000275, 119579, 24128, '<td valign="top">nice pic, i dunno if it''s just me but the focus seems a little soft on the rose itself when compared to the leaves</td>', 'nice pic, i dunno if it''s just me but the focus seems a little soft on the rose itself when compared to the leaves', '2004-11-09 01:54:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000277, 118962, 24128, '<td valign="top">cute :)</td>', 'cute :)', '2004-11-09 01:55:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000278, 119018, 29168, '<td valign="top">I like the way the negative space in the over-exposed sky anchors the earth to the water here.</td>', 'I like the way the negative space in the over-exposed sky anchors the earth to the water here.', '2004-11-09 01:55:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000280, 119576, 24128, '<td valign="top">appealing, daring and fitting to the challenge - well done 9</td>', 'appealing, daring and fitting to the challenge - well done 9', '2004-11-09 01:56:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000282, 119300, 29168, '<td valign="top">Crop season well captured. But the crop itself needs to be higher imho. I might have tried to pull the focus on the fields rather than the buildings to highlight the crop fields and give a "work is done" feel to the blured buildings or something. Contrast seems a little unatural in the foreground perhaps. But good idea!</td>', 'Crop season well captured. But the crop itself needs to be higher imho. I might have tried to pull the focus on the fields rather than the buildings to highlight the crop fields and give a "work is done" feel to the blured buildings or something. Contrast seems a little unatural in the foreground perhaps. But good idea!', '2004-11-09 01:57:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000283, 119375, 24128, '<td valign="top">nice pic, the effect is interesting although I can''t say for certain that it works for, but that''s just me</td>', 'nice pic, the effect is interesting although I can''t say for certain that it works for, but that''s just me', '2004-11-09 01:58:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000285, 119078, 29168, '<td valign="top">captures the seasonale theme very well. and draws me to be fascinated by the bird formation shape. Exposure and resulting gradient is nice.</td>', 'captures the seasonale theme very well. and draws me to be fascinated by the bird formation shape. Exposure and resulting gradient is nice.', '2004-11-09 01:59:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000290, 118672, 29168, '<td valign="top">Very nice exposure. This photo clearly took care and attention. The horrizon seems rotated a little clockwise. Might be just the yatch mast causing the illusion. I''m very partial to these colours in nature and you''ve captured them wonderfully. 8.</td>', 'Very nice exposure. This photo clearly took care and attention. The horrizon seems rotated a little clockwise. Might be just the yatch mast causing the illusion. I''m very partial to these colours in nature and you''ve captured them wonderfully. 8.', '2004-11-09 02:02:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000292, 118335, 29168, '<td valign="top">Excellent use of negative space giving the mountains a more "groudned" feel linking htem beautifully with the trees at earth level. Excellent exposure imo, perhaps a little too sharp on the mountains given their distance. Lovely.</td>', 'Excellent use of negative space giving the mountains a more "groudned" feel linking htem beautifully with the trees at earth level. Excellent exposure imo, perhaps a little too sharp on the mountains given their distance. Lovely.', '2004-11-09 02:04:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000294, 119384, 23478, '<td valign="top">Great colors, but the photo seems a little fuzzy.</td>', 'Great colors, but the photo seems a little fuzzy.', '2004-11-09 02:05:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000295, 118043, 24128, '<td valign="top">nice one Ben, makes me homesick! I have to give it a 1 because of the clear move away from pure photography with the inclusion of the border.<br/>j/k - wonderful image (that really does make me homesick) deserves to do very well - 9, would be a 10 if I could shake off the urge to see just a little more of the image on the right</td>', 'nice one Ben, makes me homesick! I have to give it a 1 because of the clear move away from pure photography with the inclusion of the border.j/k - wonderful image (that really does make me homesick) deserves to do very well - 9, would be a 10 if I could shake off the urge to see just a little more of the image on the right', '2004-11-09 02:05:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000296, 119060, 29168, '<td valign="top">Not the easiest of shots to take home! Nice cropping. Great shot!</td>', 'Not the easiest of shots to take home! Nice cropping. Great shot!', '2004-11-09 02:06:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000297, 119387, 23478, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, and great color.  The light from the sunset makes it interesting.</td>', 'Nice photo, and great color.  The light from the sunset makes it interesting.', '2004-11-09 02:07:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000298, 119018, 24128, '<td valign="top">whoa! easy on the border!<br/>nice image, can clearly see it as a calendar, wish that I could look at the image without the border getting distracting so much though</td>', 'whoa! easy on the border!nice image, can clearly see it as a calendar, wish that I could look at the image without the border getting distracting so much though', '2004-11-09 02:08:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000299, 118605, 29168, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot. A little over exposed to theleft. Good idea not over cropping the people in the foreground - since they were there. This is bright and clear - the stuff calendars are made of :)</td>', 'Lovely shot. A little over exposed to theleft. Good idea not over cropping the people in the foreground - since they were there. This is bright and clear - the stuff calendars are made of :)', '2004-11-09 02:09:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000301, 119399, 9906, '<td valign="top">Wow, this is very saturated...<br/>TC</td>', 'Wow, this is very saturated...TC', '2004-11-09 02:09:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000302, 119374, 23478, '<td valign="top">Nicecontrast of green  trees and white snow.</td>', 'Nicecontrast of green  trees and white snow.', '2004-11-09 02:09:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000304, 118855, 9906, '<td valign="top">Excellent.  Love the way you have the nearly silhouetted bridge with enough detail to be able to see it while not having the trees in the background/sky totally blown out.  Nicely done!<br/>TC</td>', 'Excellent.  Love the way you have the nearly silhouetted bridge with enough detail to be able to see it while not having the trees in the background/sky totally blown out.  Nicely done!TC', '2004-11-09 02:10:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000305, 119387, 24128, '<td valign="top">great pic, perfect for a calendar!</td>', 'great pic, perfect for a calendar!', '2004-11-09 02:10:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000306, 119435, 29168, '<td valign="top">Great angle. Great cropping. Beautifully crisp and clear calendar photo. Slightly over-exposed?</td>', 'Great angle. Great cropping. Beautifully crisp and clear calendar photo. Slightly over-exposed?', '2004-11-09 02:10:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000307, 119061, 23478, '<td valign="top">The colors here are very interesting.  It seems slightly over exposed on the left of the photo, but good job.</td>', 'The colors here are very interesting.  It seems slightly over exposed on the left of the photo, but good job.', '2004-11-09 02:11:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000310, 118335, 4805, '<td valign="top">By the scoring so far, I think my shot may medal in this challenge. However, if it loses to this one I won''t be surprised in the least. Beautiful. The only fault I have with it is the uneven sky from the (I''m guessing here) wide-angle lens and polarizer. With my 17-40 and the polarizer I sometimes play with the individual colour saturation in the RAW conversion to minimise this. Nevertheless, awesome. 10.</td>', 'By the scoring so far, I think my shot may medal in this challenge. However, if it loses to this one I won''t be surprised in the least. Beautiful. The only fault I have with it is the uneven sky from the (I''m guessing here) wide-angle lens and polarizer. With my 17-40 and the polarizer I sometimes play with the individual colour saturation in the RAW conversion to minimise this. Nevertheless, awesome. 10.', '2004-11-09 02:13:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000311, 117888, 29168, '<td valign="top">The water here is serene. A lens filter for the sky would have made a huge difference up there I think. Well centered, well balanced spatially. Nice.</td>', 'The water here is serene. A lens filter for the sky would have made a huge difference up there I think. Well centered, well balanced spatially. Nice.', '2004-11-09 02:13:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000313, 119520, 23478, '<td valign="top">Nice colors.</td>', 'Nice colors.', '2004-11-09 02:14:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000315, 119395, 29168, '<td valign="top">A nice depiction of fall (autum where I''m from :) in the lasst of the summer light. In hindsight, perhaps the focus point could have been pulled slightly closer to the camera? The season is wonderfully captured though, and the depth and contrast comes off well for me.</td>', 'A nice depiction of fall (autum where I''m from :) in the lasst of the summer light. In hindsight, perhaps the focus point could have been pulled slightly closer to the camera? The season is wonderfully captured though, and the depth and contrast comes off well for me.', '2004-11-09 02:16:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000316, 118954, 24128, '<td valign="top">classic calendar style shot - well done</td>', 'classic calendar style shot - well done', '2004-11-09 02:16:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000317, 119569, 29168, '<td valign="top">A difficult long-exposure shot by the looks. The horizon angle is a huge distraction unfortunately.</td>', 'A difficult long-exposure shot by the looks. The horizon angle is a huge distraction unfortunately.', '2004-11-09 02:17:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000319, 119491, 23478, '<td valign="top">Nice colors in the sky and good silouette of the bridge.</td>', 'Nice colors in the sky and good silouette of the bridge.', '2004-11-09 02:18:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000320, 118794, 29168, '<td valign="top">Great expression here. "Oh great. Chrismas again! Ho hum." hehe. A little over exposed in the white areas unfortunately, but a nice calendar shot none the less.</td>', 'Great expression here. "Oh great. Chrismas again! Ho hum." hehe. A little over exposed in the white areas unfortunately, but a nice calendar shot none the less.', '2004-11-09 02:18:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000322, 118990, 23478, '<td valign="top">The background really seems pixelated.</td>', 'The background really seems pixelated.', '2004-11-09 02:18:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000325, 118558, 23478, '<td valign="top">This image is just a little too confusing.</td>', 'This image is just a little too confusing.', '2004-11-09 02:19:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000326, 119516, 9906, '<td valign="top">Narrow guage?  Where is this?  Steam I''m assuming.  What could make this better?  This looks like a tourist shot and not a train/calendar shot.  If your model was just enjoying the ride instead of waving at the camera (family members who ain''t there?) this would look less like a snapshot.<br/>God I love trains.<br/>TC</td>', 'Narrow guage?  Where is this?  Steam I''m assuming.  What could make this better?  This looks like a tourist shot and not a train/calendar shot.  If your model was just enjoying the ride instead of waving at the camera (family members who ain''t there?) this would look less like a snapshot.God I love trains.TC', '2004-11-09 02:20:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000328, 118971, 23478, '<td valign="top">I do not understand why you have leaves on the ground?  It distracts a bit from the overall image.  Nice photo of the flowers.</td>', 'I do not understand why you have leaves on the ground?  It distracts a bit from the overall image.  Nice photo of the flowers.', '2004-11-09 02:21:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000329, 119183, 23478, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, just slightly OOF.</td>', 'Nice photo, just slightly OOF.', '2004-11-09 02:21:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000330, 119521, 29168, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot. I like the "confusion of seasons" from the contrasting dead leaves and very much alive greenery.  Given the autum foliage in the background also, I would like to see the half-length top of the fenc just below frame center to balance earth and sky more. Exposure is perfect imo.</td>', 'Interesting shot. I like the "confusion of seasons" from the contrasting dead leaves and very much alive greenery.  Given the autum foliage in the background also, I would like to see the half-length top of the fenc just below frame center to balance earth and sky more. Exposure is perfect imo.', '2004-11-09 02:21:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000333, 119077, 23478, '<td valign="top">Great photo, I could easily imagine this in a calendar.</td>', 'Great photo, I could easily imagine this in a calendar.', '2004-11-09 02:23:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000335, 119520, 29168, '<td valign="top">A beatifully clear photo. nicely cropped and center. Good exposure. I wonder if moving the backdrop further away might have elliminated those distracting shadows? Perhasp some of the white flowers could have been trimmed to keep everything inside the frame?</td>', 'A beatifully clear photo. nicely cropped and center. Good exposure. I wonder if moving the backdrop further away might have elliminated those distracting shadows? Perhasp some of the white flowers could have been trimmed to keep everything inside the frame?', '2004-11-09 02:23:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000336, 119029, 23478, '<td valign="top">The light is too strong, over exposing the photo on the left and leaving it dark on the right.</td>', 'The light is too strong, over exposing the photo on the left and leaving it dark on the right.', '2004-11-09 02:24:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000337, 118324, 23478, '<td valign="top">My dogs would never tolerate that type of outfit.  Nice photo.</td>', 'My dogs would never tolerate that type of outfit.  Nice photo.', '2004-11-09 02:24:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000340, 119541, 29168, '<td valign="top">A great shot for a calendar. What a pity it''s not quite as crisp as the atmosphere must sure have been on the day? Was a tripod used? Imagine this picture with a little more depth, smaller aperture with focus in the distance to blru out the clsoe foreground perhaps?</td>', 'A great shot for a calendar. What a pity it''s not quite as crisp as the atmosphere must sure have been on the day? Was a tripod used? Imagine this picture with a little more depth, smaller aperture with focus in the distance to blru out the clsoe foreground perhaps?', '2004-11-09 02:26:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000341, 119585, 23478, '<td valign="top">This is just a bit too dark.</td>', 'This is just a bit too dark.', '2004-11-09 02:26:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000342, 119576, 4805, '<td valign="top">It seems that Lesbian #1 has fallen asleep. Lesbian #2''s response is undetermined. Follow-up photos needed. Upload more, I''m heading to the cash machine.</td>', 'It seems that Lesbian #1 has fallen asleep. Lesbian #2''s response is undetermined. Follow-up photos needed. Upload more, I''m heading to the cash machine.', '2004-11-09 02:26:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000343, 119397, 23478, '<td valign="top">The contrast is a bit drab for this type of photo, maybe color would have worked better.  It seems a bit grainy also.</td>', 'The contrast is a bit drab for this type of photo, maybe color would have worked better.  It seems a bit grainy also.', '2004-11-09 02:27:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000344, 119525, 29168, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot for a calendar. Difficult to get exposure right on snow... perhaps a polarising lens filter? (Yeah, wish I had one of those too!). I might have set the frame a little higher to include just a few more complete tall trees, but not so much as to detract from the center piece depicting the season so well. 7.</td>', 'Lovely shot for a calendar. Difficult to get exposure right on snow... perhaps a polarising lens filter? (Yeah, wish I had one of those too!). I might have set the frame a little higher to include just a few more complete tall trees, but not so much as to detract from the center piece depicting the season so well. 7.', '2004-11-09 02:28:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000348, 119247, 23478, '<td valign="top">Great eyes.</td>', 'Great eyes.', '2004-11-09 02:30:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000349, 119041, 29168, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot. Maybe just a tad over-exposed. You''ve caught the kitten at a perfect moment. I can see the anticipation and wonder. I sense a leap out of the box is imminent! 8.</td>', 'Lovely shot. Maybe just a tad over-exposed. You''ve caught the kitten at a perfect moment. I can see the anticipation and wonder. I sense a leap out of the box is imminent! 8.', '2004-11-09 02:31:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000350, 119440, 23478, '<td valign="top">Nice stop action.</td>', 'Nice stop action.', '2004-11-09 02:31:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000352, 119453, 23478, '<td valign="top">Great portrait of the dog!</td>', 'Great portrait of the dog!', '2004-11-09 02:32:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000353, 118778, 29168, '<td valign="top">Excellent angle/composition here with the reflections continuing the sky/cloud linea so nicely. Color reminds me how much I want a polarising filter though. Pity the building isn''t quite vertical in the frame given it''s straight lines and what not.</td>', 'Excellent angle/composition here with the reflections continuing the sky/cloud linea so nicely. Color reminds me how much I want a polarising filter though. Pity the building isn''t quite vertical in the frame given it''s straight lines and what not.', '2004-11-09 02:35:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000355, 119579, 29168, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting in terms of shadow elimination. A little over-exposed around the yellow. I think this would have come of better with the focus more on the petals and same moved more toward center frame.</td>', 'Nice lighting in terms of shadow elimination. A little over-exposed around the yellow. I think this would have come of better with the focus more on the petals and same moved more toward center frame.', '2004-11-09 02:36:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000358, 119476, 29168, '<td valign="top">Ideal shot for a calendar. I like the shadows on the clean white building. I might have made the frame larger to the left and right with a considerably more clear sky above the steeple to give it space to "extend heavenward." Perhaps the bright white has over-exposed a little also?</td>', 'Ideal shot for a calendar. I like the shadows on the clean white building. I might have made the frame larger to the left and right with a considerably more clear sky above the steeple to give it space to "extend heavenward." Perhaps the bright white has over-exposed a little also?', '2004-11-09 02:40:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000362, 119285, 29168, '<td valign="top">Nice. Very nice. For me this photo captures the callendar season and also the cool softness accompanying that season. The close-up adds a feeling of "forget me not" one might associate with a fading summer. Exposure is excellent imo. Aperture perfect, colour balance great. Perhaps a little too abstract for the average callendar... but not for mine. &lt;grin&gt;  8.</td>', 'Nice. Very nice. For me this photo captures the callendar season and also the cool softness accompanying that season. The close-up adds a feeling of "forget me not" one might associate with a fading summer. Exposure is excellent imo. Aperture perfect, colour balance great. Perhaps a little too abstract for the average callendar... but not for mine. <grin>  8.', '2004-11-09 02:43:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000368, 118958, 29168, '<td valign="top">Good exposure to depict cool, end of summer, soft breezes. Eloquently cropped to give depth of field. There''s an optical balance/illusion here that makes the perfectly horrizontal water horrizon line look tilted significantly clockwise. I would tend to compensate for the human eye rather than go with the truth for this image as the tilt, if only illusionary, is sadly still very distracting. 7.</td>', 'Good exposure to depict cool, end of summer, soft breezes. Eloquently cropped to give depth of field. There''s an optical balance/illusion here that makes the perfectly horrizontal water horrizon line look tilted significantly clockwise. I would tend to compensate for the human eye rather than go with the truth for this image as the tilt, if only illusionary, is sadly still very distracting. 7.', '2004-11-09 02:50:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000374, 119250, 29168, '<td valign="top">The more I look at this, the more I like it. The grain and softness combined with the blue tones chill me to the bone. Perfect seasonal composition. The cropping just to left of "centered" add to the communication in the warm but sad eyes. Strangely striking photo given it''s softness. I love it. 10 (The first from me thus far as a new member.)</td>', 'The more I look at this, the more I like it. The grain and softness combined with the blue tones chill me to the bone. Perfect seasonal composition. The cropping just to left of "centered" add to the communication in the warm but sad eyes. Strangely striking photo given it''s softness. I love it. 10 (The first from me thus far as a new member.)', '2004-11-09 02:53:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000376, 119061, 24128, '<td valign="top">beautiful image, perfect for a typical calendar - well done!</td>', 'beautiful image, perfect for a typical calendar - well done!', '2004-11-09 02:54:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000378, 118792, 24128, '<td valign="top">nice pic but the sky is overexposed, if you are using an automatic camera you may find it beneficial to point the camera at the tips of the tree an half press the shutter button, then move the camera down to the desired image and complete the press.</td>', 'nice pic but the sky is overexposed, if you are using an automatic camera you may find it beneficial to point the camera at the tips of the tree an half press the shutter button, then move the camera down to the desired image and complete the press.', '2004-11-09 02:56:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000379, 118990, 29168, '<td valign="top">Nice composition. Love the exposure, focus and use of grain here. A wonderfully timed shot and eloquentlycropped. I would have liked to see the wing tips extending just shy of vertical center to keep the "I am bird therefore I fly" feel. Perfect callandar shot. 8.</td>', 'Nice composition. Love the exposure, focus and use of grain here. A wonderfully timed shot and eloquentlycropped. I would have liked to see the wing tips extending just shy of vertical center to keep the "I am bird therefore I fly" feel. Perfect callandar shot. 8.', '2004-11-09 02:57:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000381, 118944, 24128, '<td valign="top">excellent pic - well done :)</td>', 'excellent pic - well done :)', '2004-11-09 02:59:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000382, 119491, 24128, '<td valign="top">great stong pic that certainly would suit a calendar - well done</td>', 'great stong pic that certainly would suit a calendar - well done', '2004-11-09 03:00:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000383, 119013, 29168, '<td valign="top">This is great concept! Humans mixing pleasure and nature despite the autum. I like it. A shame the near face is over exposed just a little, and I feel the subjects are alittle too cramped within the frame. A taller crop perhaps? 7.</td>', 'This is great concept! Humans mixing pleasure and nature despite the autum. I like it. A shame the near face is over exposed just a little, and I feel the subjects are alittle too cramped within the frame. A taller crop perhaps? 7.', '2004-11-09 03:00:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000386, 119393, 24128, '<td valign="top">certainly would work as a calendar pic, good pic</td>', 'certainly would work as a calendar pic, good pic', '2004-11-09 03:03:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000389, 119102, 29168, '<td valign="top">Excellent callendar shot with good seasonal depiciton. I''m curious, did you wait for the sun to be in the perfect position or set up multiple flashes in low light? The cropping is perfect imo. 7.</td>', 'Excellent callendar shot with good seasonal depiciton. I''m curious, did you wait for the sun to be in the perfect position or set up multiple flashes in low light? The cropping is perfect imo. 7.', '2004-11-09 03:04:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000391, 119303, 29168, '<td valign="top">Wonderful capture of aging by weather. I do feel the the upper crop should have been alittle higher so as not to "cramp in" the closer window. An ideal calendar picture. 7.</td>', 'Wonderful capture of aging by weather. I do feel the the upper crop should have been alittle higher so as not to "cramp in" the closer window. An ideal calendar picture. 7.', '2004-11-09 03:06:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000394, 119376, 24128, '<td valign="top">wonderful colours, the sillouette of the tree is very appealing, I''m not sure that I would like to spend a month looking at graves though. i''m from england and to me the graves represent rememberence sunday, and the sombre feeling does work well for this month</td>', 'wonderful colours, the sillouette of the tree is very appealing, I''m not sure that I would like to spend a month looking at graves though. i''m from england and to me the graves represent rememberence sunday, and the sombre feeling does work well for this month', '2004-11-09 03:07:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000399, 119221, 24128, '<td valign="top">i can easily imagine this on a calendar - well done</td>', 'i can easily imagine this on a calendar - well done', '2004-11-09 03:11:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000400, 118963, 29168, '<td valign="top">Hmmm. This is "deep." This November perhaps, but would there be relavence here for next years callendar? I''m not sure politics belongs on a callendar. The colours, however, certainly do depict a waning summer. Were you hoping to communicate something with the distance facial expressions? I daren''t say more. &lt;grin&gt; (I''m not a US citizen btw, and only follow the politics there from a great distance.)</td>', 'Hmmm. This is "deep." This November perhaps, but would there be relavence here for next years callendar? I''m not sure politics belongs on a callendar. The colours, however, certainly do depict a waning summer. Were you hoping to communicate something with the distance facial expressions? I daren''t say more. <grin> (I''m not a US citizen btw, and only follow the politics there from a great distance.)', '2004-11-09 03:12:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000403, 118420, 24128, '<td valign="top">very crisp and well presented image, I don''t really get the meaning of the title but that''s irrelevant - well done :)</td>', 'very crisp and well presented image, I don''t really get the meaning of the title but that''s irrelevant - well done :)', '2004-11-09 03:13:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000404, 119291, 29168, '<td valign="top">Now there is some focus on some focus! This would make a nice callendar photo imo. The cropping is good, though perhaps the bird could be a little lower in the frame. Your aperture setting here has worked very well. 6.</td>', 'Now there is some focus on some focus! This would make a nice callendar photo imo. The cropping is good, though perhaps the bird could be a little lower in the frame. Your aperture setting here has worked very well. 6.', '2004-11-09 03:14:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000406, 119026, 24128, '<td valign="top">nice image and feeling to this pic, you seem to have a little vignetting the in the corners though</td>', 'nice image and feeling to this pic, you seem to have a little vignetting the in the corners though', '2004-11-09 03:14:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000415, 119584, 29168, '<td valign="top">This is a nice composition, ideal for a callendar. The horizon, though sloping, seems perfectly correct. Depth is excellent. Focus within that depth spot on. Was the sky really that bright? Or would some form of lens filter have been useful?  High exposure is a little distracting in the lower/left quadrant. An easy 7.</td>', 'This is a nice composition, ideal for a callendar. The horizon, though sloping, seems perfectly correct. Depth is excellent. Focus within that depth spot on. Was the sky really that bright? Or would some form of lens filter have been useful?  High exposure is a little distracting in the lower/left quadrant. An easy 7.', '2004-11-09 03:19:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000416, 118740, 29168, '<td valign="top">A perfect callendar scene. I might have preferred the trees to be less cropped vertically, but I feel this deserves an easy eight given the challenge scope.</td>', 'A perfect callendar scene. I might have preferred the trees to be less cropped vertically, but I feel this deserves an easy eight given the challenge scope.', '2004-11-09 03:22:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000418, 118525, 29168, '<td valign="top">Perfect callendar picture here! Clean, simple, communicative, dimensionally and spatially brilliant frankly. The frame sets this picture off perefectly. Well done! 10.</td>', 'Perfect callendar picture here! Clean, simple, communicative, dimensionally and spatially brilliant frankly. The frame sets this picture off perefectly. Well done! 10.', '2004-11-09 03:25:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000420, 119577, 24459, '<td valign="top">(edited)<br/>the pic is lovely. seems like tilted but after I did take a bit of time to look at it, it IS clear that''s just the clouds that cause the strange effect.<br/>Well done.</td>', '(edited)the pic is lovely. seems like tilted but after I did take a bit of time to look at it, it IS clear that''s just the clouds that cause the strange effect.Well done.', '2004-11-09 03:31:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000421, 119577, 24128, '<td valign="top">wonderful image that would be well fitting on a calendar, although it does seem to be missing something, perhaps a border would help, or even better why not try a triptych effect ;)<br/>j/k great image Brad, well done (again) - 9</td>', 'wonderful image that would be well fitting on a calendar, although it does seem to be missing something, perhaps a border would help, or even better why not try a triptych effect ;)j/k great image Brad, well done (again) - 9', '2004-11-09 03:32:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000422, 119061, 29168, '<td valign="top">Quite simply breath-taking scenery, perfect for a callendar. The image does seem industrial and flat - a commication perhaps fitting for the middle of winter. The warm sepia skies look rather out of place however. Perhaps blues have a place here after all? This contrast gives the image an abstract feel, perhaps more suitable for an art book I feel.</td>', 'Quite simply breath-taking scenery, perfect for a callendar. The image does seem industrial and flat - a commication perhaps fitting for the middle of winter. The warm sepia skies look rather out of place however. Perhaps blues have a place here after all? This contrast gives the image an abstract feel, perhaps more suitable for an art book I feel.', '2004-11-09 03:34:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000424, 119486, 29168, '<td valign="top">This is very nicely framed, but it somehow lacks clarity and communication of season - despite the melting snow on the hills. The cropping is good, exposure seems right, but there''s a lack of depth and realism somehow. Perhaps some experimentation with aperture and focus if possible? The balance of sky to ground is perfect and I like the mirrored arcs of the tree line to mountain saddle making this a good composition overall. 6.</td>', 'This is very nicely framed, but it somehow lacks clarity and communication of season - despite the melting snow on the hills. The cropping is good, exposure seems right, but there''s a lack of depth and realism somehow. Perhaps some experimentation with aperture and focus if possible? The balance of sky to ground is perfect and I like the mirrored arcs of the tree line to mountain saddle making this a good composition overall. 6.', '2004-11-09 03:40:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000425, 118987, 24128, '<td valign="top">nice image, would suit a calendar - well done</td>', 'nice image, would suit a calendar - well done', '2004-11-09 03:41:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000426, 118370, 24459, '<td valign="top">Simple and gorgous. Beautiful, smiling girl always cheers me up :) I love the cropping and the composition. Just a lovely, nice and mild picture. 10+<br/>Also I''d love to have a calendar with such nice pictures.<br/>Unlike some of others (with graves on them, strange scenes or president of US) this I would really like to hang somewhere in my room.<br/>Good luck on this one</td>', 'Simple and gorgous. Beautiful, smiling girl always cheers me up :) I love the cropping and the composition. Just a lovely, nice and mild picture. 10+Also I''d love to have a calendar with such nice pictures.Unlike some of others (with graves on them, strange scenes or president of US) this I would really like to hang somewhere in my room.Good luck on this one', '2004-11-09 03:42:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000427, 119453, 24459, '<td valign="top">Funny, lovely, cheerful. What else can I say. Fantastic shot. 10+</td>', 'Funny, lovely, cheerful. What else can I say. Fantastic shot. 10+', '2004-11-09 03:43:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000429, 119337, 24128, '<td valign="top">interesting image, the focus make the flower look almost detached with the center representing a bunch of flowers, very compelling pic - you should it into dpcprints - well done!</td>', 'interesting image, the focus make the flower look almost detached with the center representing a bunch of flowers, very compelling pic - you should it into dpcprints - well done!', '2004-11-09 03:44:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000430, 119380, 29168, '<td valign="top">This is a very nice effort imo. The balance of dock to water is just right. The near/left tree and curvature/angle of the far shore communicate depth very well. The time of day was perfect to get the reflective sky colours off the water. But... I feel the trees are screaming to have not had quite so much of their tops cropped off. but for the cropping, I would have given this a 9. I''m happy with an 8.</td>', 'This is a very nice effort imo. The balance of dock to water is just right. The near/left tree and curvature/angle of the far shore communicate depth very well. The time of day was perfect to get the reflective sky colours off the water. But... I feel the trees are screaming to have not had quite so much of their tops cropped off. but for the cropping, I would have given this a 9. I''m happy with an 8.', '2004-11-09 03:44:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000431, 119220, 24459, '<td valign="top">Yes, ideed. I would like to give you 11, like you ask in your title :)<br/>But I can only offer you a 10.<br/>Beautiful picture. Something I''d like to hang on my wall. Peaceful and calm. Great job. Good luck</td>', 'Yes, ideed. I would like to give you 11, like you ask in your title :)But I can only offer you a 10.Beautiful picture. Something I''d like to hang on my wall. Peaceful and calm. Great job. Good luck', '2004-11-09 03:45:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000432, 119572, 24128, '<td valign="top">wonderful calendar image, i feel that the sky may be just a little too dark for the beach scene though, almost gives a feeling that a storm is coming</td>', 'wonderful calendar image, i feel that the sky may be just a little too dark for the beach scene though, almost gives a feeling that a storm is coming', '2004-11-09 03:46:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000433, 118939, 24459, '<td valign="top">They say nice model will get you a better score that a "not nice" model.<br/>Well... obviously the quality, accurance and such of the picture should come first, but I can''t resist scoring high if there is a beautiful girl on one. In my opinion subject comes first, then follows the presentation.<br/>That is why I scored this one 9. This 1 remaining I''d have to take away for the lighting. I think this could be a bit better. <br/>But the model is beatiful, hence 10 (model) - 1 (light) = 9 (final score)<br/>Good luck</td>', 'They say nice model will get you a better score that a "not nice" model.Well... obviously the quality, accurance and such of the picture should come first, but I can''t resist scoring high if there is a beautiful girl on one. In my opinion subject comes first, then follows the presentation.That is why I scored this one 9. This 1 remaining I''d have to take away for the lighting. I think this could be a bit better. But the model is beatiful, hence 10 (model) - 1 (light) = 9 (final score)Good luck', '2004-11-09 03:49:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000434, 119519, 29168, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure the title would suit a United States callendar, but the title combined with the depth of field, stark colours and slightly "over-exposed" firey red do make this picture a powerful statement! Besides that, I think the image alone is striking enough for someone''s callendar. An easy 7. (I''m a Kwi btw)</td>', 'I''m not sure the title would suit a United States callendar, but the title combined with the depth of field, stark colours and slightly "over-exposed" firey red do make this picture a powerful statement! Besides that, I think the image alone is striking enough for someone''s callendar. An easy 7. (I''m a Kwi btw)', '2004-11-09 03:50:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000435, 118980, 24459, '<td valign="top">Simple, calm and very "calendar-ous".<br/>Well done.<br/>I was first going to degrade it for putting more thatn just the month in the title (read the descriptions MAN), but decided against it. Then I thought you made a mistake and should have named this one November. But I changed 1 back to much higher than that.<br/>If I could recomend something, I''d like to see something red in top left corner. I think this would get this one a ribbon. But apparently you''re not going for one. So here''s 8</td>', 'Simple, calm and very "calendar-ous".Well done.I was first going to degrade it for putting more thatn just the month in the title (read the descriptions MAN), but decided against it. Then I thought you made a mistake and should have named this one November. But I changed 1 back to much higher than that.If I could recomend something, I''d like to see something red in top left corner. I think this would get this one a ribbon. But apparently you''re not going for one. So here''s 8', '2004-11-09 03:52:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000436, 119441, 29168, '<td valign="top">This is very good imo. Perfect for a callendar. The natural light is striking at this angle and the image has awesome depth. Yes, I like it a lot. 9.</td>', 'This is very good imo. Perfect for a callendar. The natural light is striking at this angle and the image has awesome depth. Yes, I like it a lot. 9.', '2004-11-09 03:52:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000437, 118974, 29168, '<td valign="top">This train has about as much novemeber as it''s gonna take eh? :) This is very well done. Difficult to say, but I think I''d like the frame set a little higher - maybe to set the vertical center of the front of the train (including chimney) just below frame center? But hey - excellent use of colour filtering makes up for that ten fold. 9.</td>', 'This train has about as much novemeber as it''s gonna take eh? :) This is very well done. Difficult to say, but I think I''d like the frame set a little higher - maybe to set the vertical center of the front of the train (including chimney) just below frame center? But hey - excellent use of colour filtering makes up for that ten fold. 9.', '2004-11-09 03:55:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000438, 119522, 29168, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed, good shadows. A little vague for a general callendar yet meaningful amoung certain groups. I''m scoring this 8 based purely on composition and execution. I feel you deserve it.</td>', 'Nicely composed, good shadows. A little vague for a general callendar yet meaningful amoung certain groups. I''m scoring this 8 based purely on composition and execution. I feel you deserve it.', '2004-11-09 04:02:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000440, 119416, 29168, '<td valign="top">This exposure depicts waning summer light and cooler autum skies beautifully. I might have wanted to see a little more clear sky in the the top-left corner - just for "balance" and to give a more "cool" effect over the warm autum colours of the leaves. An an easy 8. Well done.</td>', 'This exposure depicts waning summer light and cooler autum skies beautifully. I might have wanted to see a little more clear sky in the the top-left corner - just for "balance" and to give a more "cool" effect over the warm autum colours of the leaves. An an easy 8. Well done.', '2004-11-09 04:07:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000442, 119491, 29168, '<td valign="top">Gobsmacked. Absolutely can''t fault this. 10 and good luck!</td>', 'Gobsmacked. Absolutely can''t fault this. 10 and good luck!', '2004-11-09 04:10:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000444, 117466, 29168, '<td valign="top">Still waters, autum leaf reflecting on other to follow, perfect framing. What more more could the month of October ask for? 8.</td>', 'Still waters, autum leaf reflecting on other to follow, perfect framing. What more more could the month of October ask for? 8.', '2004-11-09 04:13:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000445, 118479, 27482, '<td valign="top">You were a bit sloppy in reintroducing the pink colour and the pink colour is a bit flat (I would have used something like the colour replacement tool to introduce a stronger shade of pink) but other than that a good shot, I gave it a 7.</td>', 'You were a bit sloppy in reintroducing the pink colour and the pink colour is a bit flat (I would have used something like the colour replacement tool to introduce a stronger shade of pink) but other than that a good shot, I gave it a 7.', '2004-11-09 04:13:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000446, 119553, 29168, '<td valign="top">A perfect autum arrangement. Good psotioning horizontally but cropped a little low up top I feel. Still, a striking image one would not easily grow bored with imo. 7.</td>', 'A perfect autum arrangement. Good psotioning horizontally but cropped a little low up top I feel. Still, a striking image one would not easily grow bored with imo. 7.', '2004-11-09 04:15:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000449, 119489, 29168, '<td valign="top">Nicely captured wintery and yet comfortable Christmas feel here. Good composition with subtlely blended traditional Christmas colours. The thought that went into this begs for more than a 6, so 7 it is.</td>', 'Nicely captured wintery and yet comfortable Christmas feel here. Good composition with subtlely blended traditional Christmas colours. The thought that went into this begs for more than a 6, so 7 it is.', '2004-11-09 04:18:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000450, 119582, 29168, '<td valign="top">This is a lovely composition and would certainly suit many a workshop callendar. But the colours, for the Northern Hemisphere at least, seem very much late summer to me  not the early the early Spring atmosphere of March. None the less, I am in the southern hemisphere myself, so I''ll afford you a well deserved 7 &lt;grin&gt;</td>', 'This is a lovely composition and would certainly suit many a workshop callendar. But the colours, for the Northern Hemisphere at least, seem very much late summer to me  not the early the early Spring atmosphere of March. None the less, I am in the southern hemisphere myself, so I''ll afford you a well deserved 7 <grin>', '2004-11-09 04:22:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000452, 118855, 29168, '<td valign="top">This would have been perfect had it capture a deepish blue sky. It''s clearly over-exposed to bring out the foreground. This was a mistake in my humble opinion. In fact, the autum colours do not even look natural I''m afraid.</td>', 'This would have been perfect had it capture a deepish blue sky. It''s clearly over-exposed to bring out the foreground. This was a mistake in my humble opinion. In fact, the autum colours do not even look natural I''m afraid.', '2004-11-09 04:25:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000453, 118682, 29168, '<td valign="top">This is nice. But I feel it needs a little more of the scene to the upper left for balance. The opposite corner is perfect however. Meats the challenge very well. 7.</td>', 'This is nice. But I feel it needs a little more of the scene to the upper left for balance. The opposite corner is perfect however. Meats the challenge very well. 7.', '2004-11-09 04:31:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000454, 118312, 27482, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot of a lion, good colours and sharpness, I love it.  However I don´t get how march is connected with a lion.  I would rather have put this under july or august as the constellation mark "leo" is in those two monts.</td>', 'This is a great shot of a lion, good colours and sharpness, I love it.  However I don´t get how march is connected with a lion.  I would rather have put this under july or august as the constellation mark "leo" is in those two monts.', '2004-11-09 04:32:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000455, 118607, 29168, '<td valign="top">This is nice. Well framed. A little over exposed for the amount of grain applied perhaps. Meets the challenge well though I think :) 7.</td>', 'This is nice. Well framed. A little over exposed for the amount of grain applied perhaps. Meets the challenge well though I think :) 7.', '2004-11-09 04:32:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000456, 119250, 27482, '<td valign="top">Too bad about all the iso colour noise, makes the image a bit flat but this is a good image, not great however but above average IMO.</td>', 'Too bad about all the iso colour noise, makes the image a bit flat but this is a good image, not great however but above average IMO.', '2004-11-09 04:33:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000457, 118606, 29168, '<td valign="top">Very cute. Composition and cropping pretty good. The expression seems to match somehow too. I would have liked alittle more colour saturation, though I can see the shadows might have got overdone if so. A framemight be a good idea to break the solid black from a (probably) white callendar page also. Lovely. 6.</td>', 'Very cute. Composition and cropping pretty good. The expression seems to match somehow too. I would have liked alittle more colour saturation, though I can see the shadows might have got overdone if so. A framemight be a good idea to break the solid black from a (probably) white callendar page also. Lovely. 6.', '2004-11-09 04:35:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000458, 119243, 29168, '<td valign="top">Clever :)</td>', 'Clever :)', '2004-11-09 04:36:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000459, 119516, 29168, '<td valign="top">Just a lovely shot really. Perfect callendar photo. Who''s strings did you pull to get the train painted "Autum Orange"? :) 9.</td>', 'Just a lovely shot really. Perfect callendar photo. Who''s strings did you pull to get the train painted "Autum Orange"? :) 9.', '2004-11-09 04:39:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000460, 119337, 27482, '<td valign="top">Normally a big fan of extremely short DOF I think this is a bit too short, but it´s a  strong image and good colours, would be surprised to see it anywhere but in the top 90%.</td>', 'Normally a big fan of extremely short DOF I think this is a bit too short, but it´s a  strong image and good colours, would be surprised to see it anywhere but in the top 90%.', '2004-11-09 04:41:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000462, 119338, 29168, '<td valign="top">Is that "may" of "neigh"? :) This is an ideal callendar shot, though it somehow lacks the clarity one might expect in May. Could be just my silly LCD screen... sp please enjoy your 7.</td>', 'Is that "may" of "neigh"? :) This is an ideal callendar shot, though it somehow lacks the clarity one might expect in May. Could be just my silly LCD screen... sp please enjoy your 7.', '2004-11-09 04:42:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000463, 119446, 29168, '<td valign="top">Lovely. Right on target for the challenge, nicely cropped and composed and the exposure is just right for my tastes. A crisp black border would really set this off on a white page I feel. 8.</td>', 'Lovely. Right on target for the challenge, nicely cropped and composed and the exposure is just right for my tastes. A crisp black border would really set this off on a white page I feel. 8.', '2004-11-09 04:45:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000465, 118895, 29168, '<td valign="top">I can feel both the cold and the warm through this photo. Well done! I think a broadish black border/frame would suit this image for a white page. Perhaps the focus should have been on the mugs contents rather than the gloves? A nice 7.</td>', 'I can feel both the cold and the warm through this photo. Well done! I think a broadish black border/frame would suit this image for a white page. Perhaps the focus should have been on the mugs contents rather than the gloves? A nice 7.', '2004-11-09 04:47:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000467, 118614, 29168, '<td valign="top">Nicely executed. Perhaps my ignorance of such fine things prevents me from seeing the link with December?</td>', 'Nicely executed. Perhaps my ignorance of such fine things prevents me from seeing the link with December?', '2004-11-09 04:50:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000469, 119399, 29168, '<td valign="top">Sometimes one just has to say "10!" even before they''ve given it much thought. In this case, the thought didn''t change my mind. The black frame suits this image well.</td>', 'Sometimes one just has to say "10!" even before they''ve given it much thought. In this case, the thought didn''t change my mind. The black frame suits this image well.', '2004-11-09 04:51:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000470, 118472, 27482, '<td valign="top">What did you do to that sky?  Is it a side effect of using too little quality when using save for web or is it intentional?  Anyway, I do not like the effect and I think it brings down an otherwise good image.  Please feel free to ignore this comment though if you like it, after all that is all that matters and I have a tendency to be a little bit close minded sometimes.</td>', 'What did you do to that sky?  Is it a side effect of using too little quality when using save for web or is it intentional?  Anyway, I do not like the effect and I think it brings down an otherwise good image.  Please feel free to ignore this comment though if you like it, after all that is all that matters and I have a tendency to be a little bit close minded sometimes.', '2004-11-09 04:51:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000471, 119585, 27482, '<td valign="top">"Darkness" is a key word here, and I think you have way too much of it with overblown hightligts to boost and then the single red colour.  I am sorry but as much as I try I just don´t find anything interesting about this shot, my eye just wanders and finds nothing but that overblown lamppost at the top of this image.  Better luck next time and keep shooting.</td>', '"Darkness" is a key word here, and I think you have way too much of it with overblown hightligts to boost and then the single red colour.  I am sorry but as much as I try I just don´t find anything interesting about this shot, my eye just wanders and finds nothing but that overblown lamppost at the top of this image.  Better luck next time and keep shooting.', '2004-11-09 04:52:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000472, 119534, 29168, '<td valign="top">The long exposure evident in the waterfall bares testiment to the dead still air here. Nicely cropped. The birds in flight become a distraction as a result unfortunately. But what a silly detail - this is nicely executed and deserves an 8.</td>', 'The long exposure evident in the waterfall bares testiment to the dead still air here. Nicely cropped. The birds in flight become a distraction as a result unfortunately. But what a silly detail - this is nicely executed and deserves an 8.', '2004-11-09 04:54:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000473, 119295, 29168, '<td valign="top">Yummie! (or not :) I think the focal point should have been lower down (not that I really want to see what''s lower down more in focus... but none the less...) The dark eyes have this one begging for a fairly heavy black frame for a white callendar page I think. 6.</td>', 'Yummie! (or not :) I think the focal point should have been lower down (not that I really want to see what''s lower down more in focus... but none the less...) The dark eyes have this one begging for a fairly heavy black frame for a white callendar page I think. 6.', '2004-11-09 04:56:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000475, 118627, 29168, '<td valign="top">Perfect for June, well lit and nocely executed. I just plain like this. Enjoy your 8.</td>', 'Perfect for June, well lit and nocely executed. I just plain like this. Enjoy your 8.', '2004-11-09 05:02:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000476, 119340, 24128, '<td valign="top">nice serene image - well done</td>', 'nice serene image - well done', '2004-11-09 05:18:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000482, 118672, 27482, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot, I would buy this calendar.</td>', 'Beautiful shot, I would buy this calendar.', '2004-11-09 05:25:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000483, 118714, 27482, '<td valign="top">Not really a fan of your WB here, it´s a bit too blue but that´s just nitpicking I love this shot, gave it an 8.</td>', 'Not really a fan of your WB here, it´s a bit too blue but that´s just nitpicking I love this shot, gave it an 8.', '2004-11-09 05:26:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000485, 119077, 27482, '<td valign="top">Does he look embarrassed or is it just my imagination?  Great lighting, good props and pretty much a good photo.  This would look good in an all dog calendar, I wouldn´t get it because I´m not a big dog fan but if I were, I´d get it in a heartbeat.  9</td>', 'Does he look embarrassed or is it just my imagination?  Great lighting, good props and pretty much a good photo.  This would look good in an all dog calendar, I wouldn´t get it because I´m not a big dog fan but if I were, I´d get it in a heartbeat.  9', '2004-11-09 05:28:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000488, 119399, 27482, '<td valign="top">Very serene scene, great shot, one of my favorites in this challenge.</td>', 'Very serene scene, great shot, one of my favorites in this challenge.', '2004-11-09 05:30:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000490, 119356, 24128, '<td valign="top">i can certianly imagine this on a calendar - well done</td>', 'i can certianly imagine this on a calendar - well done', '2004-11-09 05:33:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000492, 118859, 24128, '<td valign="top">nice interptretation - well done</td>', 'nice interptretation - well done', '2004-11-09 05:34:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000503, 119107, 24128, '<td valign="top">wonderful image an concept, deserves to do very well indeed</td>', 'wonderful image an concept, deserves to do very well indeed', '2004-11-09 06:03:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000504, 118910, 24128, '<td valign="top">it would help if this image was rotated clockwise slightly in order to remove the slant</td>', 'it would help if this image was rotated clockwise slightly in order to remove the slant', '2004-11-09 06:04:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000505, 118857, 24128, '<td valign="top">excellent pic, it does appear to be a little odd to see snow on such a fresh looking apple though (although knowing the weather here I don''t doubt it for a second) - well done :)</td>', 'excellent pic, it does appear to be a little odd to see snow on such a fresh looking apple though (although knowing the weather here I don''t doubt it for a second) - well done :)', '2004-11-09 06:07:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000514, 118740, 27482, '<td valign="top">I like the soft focus in this image, only flaw in this image IMO is the blown out highlights of the reflections in the water.  Great shot, one of the best in the challenge.</td>', 'I like the soft focus in this image, only flaw in this image IMO is the blown out highlights of the reflections in the water.  Great shot, one of the best in the challenge.', '2004-11-09 06:32:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000516, 118043, 27482, '<td valign="top">What an odd looking tree...  Does it grow like this or were you just out in some really crazy weather?  Anyway an interesting shot, not quite as exciting as others in this challenge but I bet you will be in the top 15%.</td>', 'What an odd looking tree...  Does it grow like this or were you just out in some really crazy weather?  Anyway an interesting shot, not quite as exciting as others in this challenge but I bet you will be in the top 15%.', '2004-11-09 06:44:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000528, 119524, 27482, '<td valign="top">Lens flare ruins what could have been a very good shot. (is it possible you put this in with photoshop?, if so WHY?)</td>', 'Lens flare ruins what could have been a very good shot. (is it possible you put this in with photoshop?, if so WHY?)', '2004-11-09 07:05:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000530, 119569, 27482, '<td valign="top">Not at all a bad shot so don´t get me wrong.  The tiltet horizon though spoils it a bit and it´s taken with a slightly too long shutter time, to get the best results try to keep it as short as possible because otherwise it gets very smudgy, like in this shot.  Great setting for an Aurora Borealis shot though, better luck next time.  7</td>', 'Not at all a bad shot so don´t get me wrong.  The tiltet horizon though spoils it a bit and it´s taken with a slightly too long shutter time, to get the best results try to keep it as short as possible because otherwise it gets very smudgy, like in this shot.  Great setting for an Aurora Borealis shot though, better luck next time.  7', '2004-11-09 07:06:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000553, 119155, 27482, '<td valign="top">AWESOME!  How on earth did you do this shot???  This is probably the best image of fire I have ever seen, I can´t wait for this challenge to be over for me to see the details of how you pulled this off.  Easiest 10 I have given so far.</td>', 'AWESOME!  How on earth did you do this shot???  This is probably the best image of fire I have ever seen, I can´t wait for this challenge to be over for me to see the details of how you pulled this off.  Easiest 10 I have given so far.', '2004-11-09 07:26:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000556, 118606, 27482, '<td valign="top">The colours and image itself are a bit flat, a small boost in contrast would improve this shot a lot but other than that I love this image, the expression is priceless.</td>', 'The colours and image itself are a bit flat, a small boost in contrast would improve this shot a lot but other than that I love this image, the expression is priceless.', '2004-11-09 07:27:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000569, 118605, 27482, '<td valign="top">Christmas decorations in November?  Always makes me pretty sad, I don´t think they should be put up before december 1st.  Anyway a good shot and looks like an interesting place to visit.</td>', 'Christmas decorations in November?  Always makes me pretty sad, I don´t think they should be put up before december 1st.  Anyway a good shot and looks like an interesting place to visit.', '2004-11-09 07:49:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000578, 118698, 164, '<td valign="top">One of the few original ideas in this challenge. and a good picture too.</td>', 'One of the few original ideas in this challenge. and a good picture too.', '2004-11-09 08:01:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000593, 118971, 28708, '<td valign="top">I like the picture and the addition of the butterfly on the flower. The two smaller flowers growing up from the ground add to the spring look, and the sharpness/detail of the flowers is good. My one comment would have to be the leaves on the ground.  Maybe not so much if they were green leaves (though I suppose leaves don''t fall even in spring), but the orange and brown leaves envoke an autumn feel, and detract from a spring one.</td>', 'I like the picture and the addition of the butterfly on the flower. The two smaller flowers growing up from the ground add to the spring look, and the sharpness/detail of the flowers is good. My one comment would have to be the leaves on the ground.  Maybe not so much if they were green leaves (though I suppose leaves don''t fall even in spring), but the orange and brown leaves envoke an autumn feel, and detract from a spring one.', '2004-11-09 08:30:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000597, 118963, 28708, '<td valign="top">I happen to like him, so I''d like to give this a 11, but I think it might be too specific to a certain year (or period of four)  to work in a generic calendar. For a 2004 calendar, it would speak loudly, but what would people say about this shot in 2011? Really nice shot of the pres by the way to have in your collection. He came to PA a million times but I never got to see him.</td>', 'I happen to like him, so I''d like to give this a 11, but I think it might be too specific to a certain year (or period of four)  to work in a generic calendar. For a 2004 calendar, it would speak loudly, but what would people say about this shot in 2011? Really nice shot of the pres by the way to have in your collection. He came to PA a million times but I never got to see him.', '2004-11-09 08:36:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000599, 119489, 28708, '<td valign="top">That''s a great title for the picture. I like the country feel with the wheel and wood in the background.</td>', 'That''s a great title for the picture. I like the country feel with the wheel and wood in the background.', '2004-11-09 08:41:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000609, 119521, 11895, '<td valign="top">I like the textures but the colors seem over saturated</td>', 'I like the textures but the colors seem over saturated', '2004-11-09 08:51:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000634, 119481, 17492, '<td valign="top">What a tremendously strong image. First photo to make me stop and think.</td>', 'What a tremendously strong image. First photo to make me stop and think.', '2004-11-09 09:19:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000641, 119375, 19010, '<td valign="top">I just don''t care for the grainy apearance of this one. Seem over sharpened probably happened during resizing. But realy hurt this shots score.</td>', 'I just don''t care for the grainy apearance of this one. Seem over sharpened probably happened during resizing. But realy hurt this shots score.', '2004-11-09 09:21:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000648, 119219, 19010, '<td valign="top">It could be just my monitor but the pink straps on the  girls bathing suit and the boys snorkle seem to bright. other than that it is a very pleasant photo..</td>', 'It could be just my monitor but the pink straps on the  girls bathing suit and the boys snorkle seem to bright. other than that it is a very pleasant photo..', '2004-11-09 09:25:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000662, 117977, 7190, '<td valign="top">For some reason I''m being influenced by color in this challenge and would have loved to see this with more color saturation since it is the rich earth tones that evokes emotion this time of year. Like the compostion the way it flowed on the top of the items but the glass didn''t work in my opinion. I''d play around withis a bit more</td>', 'For some reason I''m being influenced by color in this challenge and would have loved to see this with more color saturation since it is the rich earth tones that evokes emotion this time of year. Like the compostion the way it flowed on the top of the items but the glass didn''t work in my opinion. I''d play around withis a bit more', '2004-11-09 09:31:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000673, 119347, 19010, '<td valign="top">love the shot but I dont feel like it is a september shot. with all of the green and water I would have beleived june.</td>', 'love the shot but I dont feel like it is a september shot. with all of the green and water I would have beleived june.', '2004-11-09 09:37:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000674, 119104, 18194, '<td valign="top">Too me the colors look off, too much green.</td>', 'Too me the colors look off, too much green.', '2004-11-09 09:37:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000680, 117914, 18194, '<td valign="top">The photo should be larger</td>', 'The photo should be larger', '2004-11-09 09:43:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000681, 118794, 18194, '<td valign="top">Good photo but the background is a bit distracting</td>', 'Good photo but the background is a bit distracting', '2004-11-09 09:44:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000683, 118472, 11518, '<td valign="top">Wayyyy to photoshopped, artificial looking sky.</td>', 'Wayyyy to photoshopped, artificial looking sky.', '2004-11-09 09:45:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000684, 119569, 11518, '<td valign="top">your horizon is tilted, nice shot otherwise.</td>', 'your horizon is tilted, nice shot otherwise.', '2004-11-09 09:46:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000687, 118939, 11518, '<td valign="top">Lighting lacks some oomph, a tad flat, but nice setup, nice expression. 8</td>', 'Lighting lacks some oomph, a tad flat, but nice setup, nice expression. 8', '2004-11-09 09:47:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000690, 119183, 18194, '<td valign="top">To me this seems cropped a little close, but that may just be me.</td>', 'To me this seems cropped a little close, but that may just be me.', '2004-11-09 09:50:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000693, 119018, 11518, '<td valign="top">Way to much of a border.  The actual picture gets too small and loses impact. That was potentially an 8 without that overwhelming border.  A split neutral density filter could have helped increase the saturation in the sky while exposing the tress and house properly.</td>', 'Way to much of a border.  The actual picture gets too small and loses impact. That was potentially an 8 without that overwhelming border.  A split neutral density filter could have helped increase the saturation in the sky while exposing the tress and house properly.', '2004-11-09 09:53:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000694, 118910, 18194, '<td valign="top">Seems like it was the wrong time of day for this shot.  I would have liked to <br/>seen more light on the statue''s front.</td>', 'Seems like it was the wrong time of day for this shot.  I would have liked to seen more light on the statue''s front.', '2004-11-09 09:53:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000698, 119576, 11518, '<td valign="top">Wow, very nicely done, I like the soft focus and the B &amp; W tones.  Great composition.  My favourite so far. 10  I hope you do not get voted down for being too risqué.</td>', 'Wow, very nicely done, I like the soft focus and the B & W tones.  Great composition.  My favourite so far. 10  I hope you do not get voted down for being too risqué.', '2004-11-09 09:56:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000699, 118559, 18194, '<td valign="top">This looks overly compressed.  You can use up to 150K for this image, this only<br/>is a bit over 18K.</td>', 'This looks overly compressed.  You can use up to 150K for this image, this onlyis a bit over 18K.', '2004-11-09 09:57:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000702, 118939, 24940, '<td valign="top">Nice!  ;)  <br/> <br/>Backlight could have been a little stronger to kill that shadow, though.</td>', 'Nice!  ;)   Backlight could have been a little stronger to kill that shadow, though.', '2004-11-09 09:59:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000703, 118380, 11518, '<td valign="top">Where is that beautiful place?  A graduated neutral density filter would have helped a lot here, I see you tried burning the sky, but when it''s only white you can''t do much to bring some colour to it.  7</td>', 'Where is that beautiful place?  A graduated neutral density filter would have helped a lot here, I see you tried burning the sky, but when it''s only white you can''t do much to bring some colour to it.  7', '2004-11-09 10:01:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000704, 119582, 11518, '<td valign="top">One of the better done calendar girls! 9</td>', 'One of the better done calendar girls! 9', '2004-11-09 10:01:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000705, 117726, 11518, '<td valign="top">Blurry, out of focus.</td>', 'Blurry, out of focus.', '2004-11-09 10:03:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000706, 118387, 11518, '<td valign="top">Overwhelming border.</td>', 'Overwhelming border.', '2004-11-09 10:03:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000714, 118370, 11518, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot!  The lighting the expression of the model, perfect!  10  My pic for a ribbon.</td>', 'Very nice shot!  The lighting the expression of the model, perfect!  10  My pic for a ribbon.', '2004-11-09 10:10:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000722, 119399, 27496, '<td valign="top">Call me a sucker for sunsets, but I really like the colors and the fog along the rocks.</td>', 'Call me a sucker for sunsets, but I really like the colors and the fog along the rocks.', '2004-11-09 10:17:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000728, 119524, 27496, '<td valign="top">Liked the colors and compisition but the sun/flare distracts me when I look at it.  With the bright spot gone I would probably have given a 7 or 8.</td>', 'Liked the colors and compisition but the sun/flare distracts me when I look at it.  With the bright spot gone I would probably have given a 7 or 8.', '2004-11-09 10:22:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000730, 119489, 27496, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, reminds me of older christmas cards.</td>', 'Nice photo, reminds me of older christmas cards.', '2004-11-09 10:23:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000759, 119374, 24128, '<td valign="top">nice image - i can easily imagine this on a calendar</td>', 'nice image - i can easily imagine this on a calendar', '2004-11-09 10:45:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000762, 118971, 24128, '<td valign="top">very clever - well done :)</td>', 'very clever - well done :)', '2004-11-09 10:46:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000783, 119104, 6388, '<td valign="top">not sure i''d have chosen the high-key approach here, but then again, it''s not my photo :).  granted, you''d lose some detail on the fisherman, but you''d get some back in the skyline, and add some needed contrast in the beautiful sky to really make him the focus of your pic.  Using curves or levels would let you darken the darks without messing too much with the lights...<br/>I''m all for trying new things and getting away from traditional technically oriented shots, but this one to me needs more contrast.  <br/>The graduated border does nothing for me, but is irrelevant to the shot so doesn''t affect the score.<br/> <br/>Good luck<br/> <br/>Pedro</td>', 'not sure i''d have chosen the high-key approach here, but then again, it''s not my photo :).  granted, you''d lose some detail on the fisherman, but you''d get some back in the skyline, and add some needed contrast in the beautiful sky to really make him the focus of your pic.  Using curves or levels would let you darken the darks without messing too much with the lights...I''m all for trying new things and getting away from traditional technically oriented shots, but this one to me needs more contrast.  The graduated border does nothing for me, but is irrelevant to the shot so doesn''t affect the score. Good luck Pedro', '2004-11-09 10:55:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000787, 118971, 14603, '<td valign="top">Nice bit of invention :)</td>', 'Nice bit of invention :)', '2004-11-09 10:57:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000788, 119554, 6388, '<td valign="top">if you''re going to do a lot of burning, use your colour balance or a de-saturation tool when you''re done to lose the blue cast.  Burning on an adjustment layer is the easiest way to control it.<br/>Aside from that, very nice pic.  I''m sure a few will mention the slanter horizon, but i  don''t mind it...together with the posts it leads your eye nicely to the H2O.<br/> <br/>good luck,<br/> <br/>Pedro</td>', 'if you''re going to do a lot of burning, use your colour balance or a de-saturation tool when you''re done to lose the blue cast.  Burning on an adjustment layer is the easiest way to control it.Aside from that, very nice pic.  I''m sure a few will mention the slanter horizon, but i  don''t mind it...together with the posts it leads your eye nicely to the H2O. good luck, Pedro', '2004-11-09 10:58:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000791, 117914, 24128, '<td valign="top">I find this pic hard to imagine on a calendar, it''s worth remembering that the majority of people on dpc are not in the US</td>', 'I find this pic hard to imagine on a calendar, it''s worth remembering that the majority of people on dpc are not in the US', '2004-11-09 10:59:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000793, 118559, 6388, '<td valign="top">now THIS, I like (not too many i like in this challenge so far).  I think you pushed the saturation a bit too far.  It looks great on the leaves, but makes your shadows really noisy on the left.  a little selective desat or burning on the hills would clean that up nicely.  <br/>very well done.<br/> <br/>Pedro</td>', 'now THIS, I like (not too many i like in this challenge so far).  I think you pushed the saturation a bit too far.  It looks great on the leaves, but makes your shadows really noisy on the left.  a little selective desat or burning on the hills would clean that up nicely.  very well done. Pedro', '2004-11-09 11:00:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000795, 118672, 14603, '<td valign="top">Beautiful tones and good composition.<br/>Should do well</td>', 'Beautiful tones and good composition.Should do well', '2004-11-09 11:01:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000798, 119434, 14603, '<td valign="top">Great detail and very effective in B/W<br/>Nice work</td>', 'Great detail and very effective in B/WNice work', '2004-11-09 11:04:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000799, 118606, 6388, '<td valign="top">Either your white balance is off, or you need to get this little punkin some oxygen :)<br/> <br/>ok I''m being a little sarcastic.  but the whole pic has a blue cast to it, which suggests your white balance might be off a little.  I rarely trust the camera to do it automatically.  After the fact you can fix this by using you r colour balance to lessen the cyans a little.<br/> <br/>cute shot tho.  love the catchlights in her eyes.<br/> <br/>Pedro</td>', 'Either your white balance is off, or you need to get this little punkin some oxygen :) ok I''m being a little sarcastic.  but the whole pic has a blue cast to it, which suggests your white balance might be off a little.  I rarely trust the camera to do it automatically.  After the fact you can fix this by using you r colour balance to lessen the cyans a little. cute shot tho.  love the catchlights in her eyes. Pedro', '2004-11-09 11:04:51.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1000804, 119243, 6388, '<td valign="top">Assuming that the Persons headstone is the focus of the pic, it seems like it''s crowding the lower left edge a little.  I like the low perspective and the shallow depth, but my eye still drifts towards other things because the subject os too far off the picture to keep me there.  if *that* makes any sense at all :)<br/> <br/>Pedro</td>', 'Assuming that the Persons headstone is the focus of the pic, it seems like it''s crowding the lower left edge a little.  I like the low perspective and the shallow depth, but my eye still drifts towards other things because the subject os too far off the picture to keep me there.  if *that* makes any sense at all :) Pedro', '2004-11-09 11:07:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000805, 118094, 1792, '<td valign="top">The composition is nice, but the large areas out of focus distract.  I would find it more appealing if the larger mushrooms were in focus with the clarity fading toward the back.</td>', 'The composition is nice, but the large areas out of focus distract.  I would find it more appealing if the larger mushrooms were in focus with the clarity fading toward the back.', '2004-11-09 11:07:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000808, 119061, 28967, '<td valign="top">Amazing!</td>', 'Amazing!', '2004-11-09 11:08:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000813, 118288, 1792, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t really have anything to focus on.  Perhaps two or three larger shells placed in areas to enhance composition elements would provide more interest and some contrast.</td>', 'Doesn''t really have anything to focus on.  Perhaps two or three larger shells placed in areas to enhance composition elements would provide more interest and some contrast.', '2004-11-09 11:09:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000817, 118990, 6388, '<td valign="top">very nice except for the exceptionally noisy background.  usually a result of oversaturation, but the rest doesn''t look that way, so i''m not sure.  the colour in the background is great, and punctuates the month nicely, but the noise is quite distracting.<br/>the rest is great.  nice shallow depth, crisp focus, nice positioning of the gull within the frame.  i can just hear the sounds: "mine! mine! mine!" (sorry - Finding Nemo reference; how can you tell i have a four-year old?)<br/> <br/>:)<br/> <br/>Pedro</td>', 'very nice except for the exceptionally noisy background.  usually a result of oversaturation, but the rest doesn''t look that way, so i''m not sure.  the colour in the background is great, and punctuates the month nicely, but the noise is quite distracting.the rest is great.  nice shallow depth, crisp focus, nice positioning of the gull within the frame.  i can just hear the sounds: "mine! mine! mine!" (sorry - Finding Nemo reference; how can you tell i have a four-year old?) :) Pedro', '2004-11-09 11:10:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000818, 119491, 14603, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and beautiful colours make this one of the best images in the challenge for me.</td>', 'Nice composition and beautiful colours make this one of the best images in the challenge for me.', '2004-11-09 11:10:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000824, 119061, 25017, '<td valign="top">one of the best of this challenge abosolutely wonderful, I love the sepia and b &amp;w seemingly this is so pretty!</td>', 'one of the best of this challenge abosolutely wonderful, I love the sepia and b &w seemingly this is so pretty!', '2004-11-09 11:11:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000825, 118740, 25017, '<td valign="top">lovely capture, perfect calender pic!</td>', 'lovely capture, perfect calender pic!', '2004-11-09 11:12:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000827, 119077, 25017, '<td valign="top">brilliant calender pic fantastic!</td>', 'brilliant calender pic fantastic!', '2004-11-09 11:12:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000828, 119336, 25017, '<td valign="top">oooh so cute! well captured I love this entry.</td>', 'oooh so cute! well captured I love this entry.', '2004-11-09 11:13:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000830, 117977, 25017, '<td valign="top">very nice calender pic well done!</td>', 'very nice calender pic well done!', '2004-11-09 11:13:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000834, 119107, 14603, '<td valign="top">Beautifully composed I especially like the way you`ve used the umbrella as a background. The high contrast look is very effective in my opinion and I could definitely see this as a calendar shot.</td>', 'Beautifully composed I especially like the way you`ve used the umbrella as a background. The high contrast look is very effective in my opinion and I could definitely see this as a calendar shot.', '2004-11-09 11:17:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000842, 118859, 1792, '<td valign="top">Vertical orientation might strengthen this.  For me there''s too much "nothing" on the right.  Also  the lower left corner where the background ends distracts.  Cropping a little differently could help.</td>', 'Vertical orientation might strengthen this.  For me there''s too much "nothing" on the right.  Also  the lower left corner where the background ends distracts.  Cropping a little differently could help.', '2004-11-09 11:21:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000848, 119179, 14603, '<td valign="top">Nice mix of reds and greens with good composition also.</td>', 'Nice mix of reds and greens with good composition also.', '2004-11-09 11:25:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000853, 118813, 14603, '<td valign="top">Wonderful capture...must be a contender.</td>', 'Wonderful capture...must be a contender.', '2004-11-09 11:26:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000860, 119336, 14603, '<td valign="top">Lovely capture ..the concentration on the dog`s face really makes the image for me.</td>', 'Lovely capture ..the concentration on the dog`s face really makes the image for me.', '2004-11-09 11:35:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1000864, 119564, 14603, '<td valign="top">This is definitely my kind of image..I love the detail in the bark, the colours in the foliage and the overall effect.<br/>This would make an excellent calendar shot...9</td>', 'This is definitely my kind of image..I love the detail in the bark, the colours in the foliage and the overall effect.This would make an excellent calendar shot...9', '2004-11-09 11:38:23.000000', NULL, 1),
