(1005969, 119107, 19010, '<td valign="top">I really enjoy the washed out goth feeling of this shot.  It fits the challenge. The only complaint I have with this shot is that it has the gothic feel and yet the clothing on the model does not seem to fit the overall style of the photo. I could be way off on what you were trying for. But I like this shot none the less. great job.</td>', 'I really enjoy the washed out goth feeling of this shot.  It fits the challenge. The only complaint I have with this shot is that it has the gothic feel and yet the clothing on the model does not seem to fit the overall style of the photo. I could be way off on what you were trying for. But I like this shot none the less. great job.', '2004-11-11 11:03:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1005974, 119285, 19010, '<td valign="top">I like the curve of the plants on this one. I also enjoy the slowly dissapearing plants in the background. A very Pleasant shot to look at. Feels a little weak in fitting the challenge. I also vent a little low due to the lack of comlexity it just dosn''t keep me interested for long.  Just trying to help.. just saying why i didn''t feel a 10.. keep up the good work.</td>', 'I like the curve of the plants on this one. I also enjoy the slowly dissapearing plants in the background. A very Pleasant shot to look at. Feels a little weak in fitting the challenge. I also vent a little low due to the lack of comlexity it just dosn''t keep me interested for long.  Just trying to help.. just saying why i didn''t feel a 10.. keep up the good work.', '2004-11-11 11:09:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1006139, 119107, 26311, '<td valign="top">Returning for comment.<br/>I think that the only problem with using your photo for a calendar would be that it would be "April" for the rest of the year.<br/>The composition is perfect, the model is lovely and her pose counterpoints the modesty of the dress with a hint of glamour in the eye and lips. High key tones in the skin balance the dark tones in the parasol. I''d love to balance my comments with some"wise" sounding advice, but I simply cant imagine how this could be improved. I wish you success with this wonderful piece ....10</td>', 'Returning for comment.I think that the only problem with using your photo for a calendar would be that it would be "April" for the rest of the year.The composition is perfect, the model is lovely and her pose counterpoints the modesty of the dress with a hint of glamour in the eye and lips. High key tones in the skin balance the dark tones in the parasol. I''d love to balance my comments with some"wise" sounding advice, but I simply cant imagine how this could be improved. I wish you success with this wonderful piece ....10', '2004-11-11 12:56:26.000000', NULL, 1),
