(1006376, 119395, 5044, '<td valign="top">While I like this image alot, I''m having a hard time seeing your focal point. I think perhaps you should have made the foremost leaf (the red one near the top left side) be in focus with all the others in the background lost in the shallow DOF.</td>', 'While I like this image alot, I''m having a hard time seeing your focal point. I think perhaps you should have made the foremost leaf (the red one near the top left side) be in focus with all the others in the background lost in the shallow DOF.', '2004-11-11 15:15:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1006384, 119107, 5044, '<td valign="top">While I do like this alot, it doesn''t say April or showers to me. Yes she''s holding an umbrella, but it looks to me like like it is quite bright and sunny outside, because of the shadows coming through the umbrella. Nonetheless, a very nice image. I might have cropped it with a little more on the bottom and less on the top, but that''s just me.</td>', 'While I do like this alot, it doesn''t say April or showers to me. Yes she''s holding an umbrella, but it looks to me like like it is quite bright and sunny outside, because of the shadows coming through the umbrella. Nonetheless, a very nice image. I might have cropped it with a little more on the bottom and less on the top, but that''s just me.', '2004-11-11 15:20:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1006391, 119584, 5044, '<td valign="top">I like this, but don''t think the crop is optimal. Perhaps if you had placed yourself so that the main tree didn''t overlap with the far one on the left. Exposure and colours are very good, though.</td>', 'I like this, but don''t think the crop is optimal. Perhaps if you had placed yourself so that the main tree didn''t overlap with the far one on the left. Exposure and colours are very good, though.', '2004-11-11 15:23:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1006399, 119155, 5044, '<td valign="top">UHM! Nothing quite like the smell of burning wooden pallets. LOL! Hope you were wearing a gas mask. Lots of arsenic in those treated wood pallets. <br/> <br/>Very cool image.</td>', 'UHM! Nothing quite like the smell of burning wooden pallets. LOL! Hope you were wearing a gas mask. Lots of arsenic in those treated wood pallets.  Very cool image.', '2004-11-11 15:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1006403, 118472, 5044, '<td valign="top">I like the composition, but not the treatment you did to the sky. Ruins it for me. Sorry.</td>', 'I like the composition, but not the treatment you did to the sky. Ruins it for me. Sorry.', '2004-11-11 15:27:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1006405, 119434, 5044, '<td valign="top">I won''t state the obvious, but very nice image. Well composed and great lighting.</td>', 'I won''t state the obvious, but very nice image. Well composed and great lighting.', '2004-11-11 15:28:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1006413, 119564, 8860, '<td valign="top">Certainly a pretty scene, although I''m getting that NeatImage feeling again! It is a heavily effected photo which draws my attention away from the subject and back to the processing.<br/> <br/>However, as a calendar it would work but in my view it would position the calendar further down-market due to the digital assistance in the shot.</td>', 'Certainly a pretty scene, although I''m getting that NeatImage feeling again! It is a heavily effected photo which draws my attention away from the subject and back to the processing. However, as a calendar it would work but in my view it would position the calendar further down-market due to the digital assistance in the shot.', '2004-11-11 15:34:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1006438, 118954, 5286, '<td valign="top">beautiful! it''s very well composed, and the colors, especially the bare greyness at the top, really make it feel like novermber. is that selective desaturation or was it actually like this?</td>', 'beautiful! it''s very well composed, and the colors, especially the bare greyness at the top, really make it feel like novermber. is that selective desaturation or was it actually like this?', '2004-11-11 15:48:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1006444, 119416, 5286, '<td valign="top">nice colors. however, the image too busy- there''s too many things and no clear focal point. it might have been more effective to concentrate on just one leaf, or branch, that had strong autumn colors, and build the picture around that (there''s a leaf like that in the bottom part of the picture, alittle to the left of the middle).</td>', 'nice colors. however, the image too busy- there''s too many things and no clear focal point. it might have been more effective to concentrate on just one leaf, or branch, that had strong autumn colors, and build the picture around that (there''s a leaf like that in the bottom part of the picture, alittle to the left of the middle).', '2004-11-11 15:50:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1006447, 119288, 5286, '<td valign="top">the eye is nicely captured, but not as effective as it might have been, because it''s really hard to figure out what the thing on the left (and right) are. if the fence was as much a subject as the animal, it would be better to use higher dof and get them both in focus. just my 2 cents.</td>', 'the eye is nicely captured, but not as effective as it might have been, because it''s really hard to figure out what the thing on the left (and right) are. if the fence was as much a subject as the animal, it would be better to use higher dof and get them both in focus. just my 2 cents.', '2004-11-11 15:53:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1006449, 118857, 5286, '<td valign="top">nice find! if the berry came out a little more, and the ice on the front leaf were sharper, it would improve the image, i think.. you could try selecting the berry in PS and using curves on it.</td>', 'nice find! if the berry came out a little more, and the ice on the front leaf were sharper, it would improve the image, i think.. you could try selecting the berry in PS and using curves on it.', '2004-11-11 15:54:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1006452, 119190, 5286, '<td valign="top">it''s an amazing scene! wonder if it would look better if you removed most of the houses, though..</td>', 'it''s an amazing scene! wonder if it would look better if you removed most of the houses, though..', '2004-11-11 15:55:07.000000', NULL, 1),
