(1006668, 119525, 10390, '<td valign="top">This conveys the month, but it just isn''t interesting enough, I can''t find the focal point in this photo very interesting, beeing the creek.  Maybe if you woul have placed your camera all the way down to the ground on the ice, and having the treetops in the frame you should then have a much more interesting photo imo.</td>', 'This conveys the month, but it just isn''t interesting enough, I can''t find the focal point in this photo very interesting, beeing the creek.  Maybe if you woul have placed your camera all the way down to the ground on the ice, and having the treetops in the frame you should then have a much more interesting photo imo.', '2004-11-11 18:57:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1006671, 119577, 10390, '<td valign="top">Great scene you have there.  I couldn''t help putting my hands over the top of the image and over the tree to the left, making the lower tree as the focal point, I really think the image improved with doing that.  It made it simpler with clear focal point in the foreground.</td>', 'Great scene you have there.  I couldn''t help putting my hands over the top of the image and over the tree to the left, making the lower tree as the focal point, I really think the image improved with doing that.  It made it simpler with clear focal point in the foreground.', '2004-11-11 19:00:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1006677, 118740, 10390, '<td valign="top">I think this effect that you used have improved the image, nice colors and good motive, maybe a little higher aiming of the camera would have improved the photo, with a little less of the water in the foreground and little more of the trees.</td>', 'I think this effect that you used have improved the image, nice colors and good motive, maybe a little higher aiming of the camera would have improved the photo, with a little less of the water in the foreground and little more of the trees.', '2004-11-11 19:02:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1006682, 119441, 10390, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, but I think it woul have been better if you would have placed your camera all the way down on the bricks and then more of the trees in the frame.</td>', 'Nice idea, but I think it woul have been better if you would have placed your camera all the way down on the bricks and then more of the trees in the frame.', '2004-11-11 19:04:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1006684, 119486, 10390, '<td valign="top">1/4th of this would have made a better phtotograph imo, then the 1/4 (or 2/3rd) of the frame down to the left corner.</td>', '1/4th of this would have made a better phtotograph imo, then the 1/4 (or 2/3rd) of the frame down to the left corner.', '2004-11-11 19:06:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1006688, 118370, 10390, '<td valign="top">beautiful image of a beautiful model. Good composition, but just a little bit too tight framing at the top and to the left.  Or even a tighter framing would have worked also, not having all of her head in the frame and not her right shoulder and then having the framing vertical with the flower in her hair near to the top left corner.</td>', 'beautiful image of a beautiful model. Good composition, but just a little bit too tight framing at the top and to the left.  Or even a tighter framing would have worked also, not having all of her head in the frame and not her right shoulder and then having the framing vertical with the flower in her hair near to the top left corner.', '2004-11-11 19:09:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1006691, 119569, 10390, '<td valign="top">The leaning of the horizon works badly for this photo, you should have had this a little darker, it''s like too long shutter speed maybe.  Aurora is great to experience and fun to photograph.</td>', 'The leaning of the horizon works badly for this photo, you should have had this a little darker, it''s like too long shutter speed maybe.  Aurora is great to experience and fun to photograph.', '2004-11-11 19:11:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1006695, 119155, 10390, '<td valign="top">Great texture, I would have liked to see some photos taken closer into the burning palettes (wrong word?), not that I don''t like this one, I just find the motive very interesting to play with.</td>', 'Great texture, I would have liked to see some photos taken closer into the burning palettes (wrong word?), not that I don''t like this one, I just find the motive very interesting to play with.', '2004-11-11 19:14:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1006698, 119437, 10390, '<td valign="top">Outstanding having the sheeps so visible, It would have been great to have them sharper, but that would probably be hard to get. Simple and very good photo.</td>', 'Outstanding having the sheeps so visible, It would have been great to have them sharper, but that would probably be hard to get. Simple and very good photo.', '2004-11-11 19:19:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1006702, 119302, 10390, '<td valign="top">A little less of the foreground would improve this photo imo. Great motive you have there.</td>', 'A little less of the foreground would improve this photo imo. Great motive you have there.', '2004-11-11 19:21:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1006706, 118590, 10390, '<td valign="top">Good fall photo. Maybe a little closer to the red leaf, tighter frame then, would work better.  As it is I tried to put my hand over the 1/4 part at the left side, making the framing more square, I think it is a little better like that.</td>', 'Good fall photo. Maybe a little closer to the red leaf, tighter frame then, would work better.  As it is I tried to put my hand over the 1/4 part at the left side, making the framing more square, I think it is a little better like that.', '2004-11-11 19:25:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1006731, 119399, 9668, '<td valign="top">I would love to find this in a calendar. Well done, lovely colors.</td>', 'I would love to find this in a calendar. Well done, lovely colors.', '2004-11-11 20:01:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1006732, 119132, 9668, '<td valign="top">Lighting is a little harsh, seems a bit oversharpened, but beatiful scene!</td>', 'Lighting is a little harsh, seems a bit oversharpened, but beatiful scene!', '2004-11-11 20:03:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1006733, 119190, 3214, '<td valign="top">Love the tones in this shot, nice work.</td>', 'Love the tones in this shot, nice work.', '2004-11-11 20:04:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1006739, 119585, 9668, '<td valign="top">Sorry, can''t imagine really imagine  this in a calendar. If I saw the shot without a title I would not think of November, or any other month for that matter. I can see it in a night shots challenge, or doutone, but not in a calendar. Not trying to be harsh, but just giving my imput.</td>', 'Sorry, can''t imagine really imagine  this in a calendar. If I saw the shot without a title I would not think of November, or any other month for that matter. I can see it in a night shots challenge, or doutone, but not in a calendar. Not trying to be harsh, but just giving my imput.', '2004-11-11 20:08:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1006746, 119336, 3214, '<td valign="top">top dog in my book.  Great color and subject, super capture.</td>', 'top dog in my book.  Great color and subject, super capture.', '2004-11-11 20:18:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1006891, 118426, 3214, '<td valign="top">some post work would have made these colors really pop?</td>', 'some post work would have made these colors really pop?', '2004-11-11 22:55:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1006901, 119575, 18799, '<td valign="top">Certainly a colorful photo, and it does work well for October.   One thing that stands out as a major distraction for me is the wrinkled backdrop on the mid-right side, as well as the texture.   My suggestion would be to pull the elements farther away from the background so it can go out of focus, and pay more attention to the details - ie wrinkles.   It''s the little things that separate middle of the road from top shots.    I''m giving this a 5</td>', 'Certainly a colorful photo, and it does work well for October.   One thing that stands out as a major distraction for me is the wrinkled backdrop on the mid-right side, as well as the texture.   My suggestion would be to pull the elements farther away from the background so it can go out of focus, and pay more attention to the details - ie wrinkles.   It''s the little things that separate middle of the road from top shots.    I''m giving this a 5', '2004-11-11 23:28:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1006906, 119336, 18799, '<td valign="top">What a wonderful catch.  There was something that I was uncomfortable with while viewing so I played around with it a bit.  The result:  To be more impactful to me,  I would have cropped the dog much closer, maybe only the neck up,  so the focus is completely on the leaf and the dog''s face and eyes.   If you did that, I would buy a calendar with this photo as the November selection.   As is, 8</td>', 'What a wonderful catch.  There was something that I was uncomfortable with while viewing so I played around with it a bit.  The result:  To be more impactful to me,  I would have cropped the dog much closer, maybe only the neck up,  so the focus is completely on the leaf and the dog''s face and eyes.   If you did that, I would buy a calendar with this photo as the November selection.   As is, 8', '2004-11-11 23:33:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1006908, 118691, 18799, '<td valign="top">Great catch of the birds,  I''m not keen on the background.  6</td>', 'Great catch of the birds,  I''m not keen on the background.  6', '2004-11-11 23:34:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1006909, 118335, 18799, '<td valign="top">The colors are absolutely wonderful.  Too much negative space for my tastes, however.   6</td>', 'The colors are absolutely wonderful.  Too much negative space for my tastes, however.   6', '2004-11-11 23:35:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1006910, 118945, 18799, '<td valign="top">Nice High Key shot.  I think the border works well with it too!   7</td>', 'Nice High Key shot.  I think the border works well with it too!   7', '2004-11-11 23:36:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1006913, 119453, 18799, '<td valign="top">Nice doggie shot.  Great sharpness and white background works.  7</td>', 'Nice doggie shot.  Great sharpness and white background works.  7', '2004-11-11 23:37:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1006915, 118981, 18799, '<td valign="top">The compostiton is a bit busy for my, it''s hard to pick out a focal point.  5</td>', 'The compostiton is a bit busy for my, it''s hard to pick out a focal point.  5', '2004-11-11 23:38:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1006918, 119376, 18799, '<td valign="top">This is a nice photo.  I don''t think I would buy a calendar with a photo of a cemetery, however.   There is something that doesn''t quite work for me with the composition, but I can''t put my finger on it.  Could be the "clutter" of the tombstones contrasted with the serenity of the tree silhouette and  sunset.  I think the cropping of the ones in the foreground is a little awkward.   Still, 6 from me.</td>', 'This is a nice photo.  I don''t think I would buy a calendar with a photo of a cemetery, however.   There is something that doesn''t quite work for me with the composition, but I can''t put my finger on it.  Could be the "clutter" of the tombstones contrasted with the serenity of the tree silhouette and  sunset.  I think the cropping of the ones in the foreground is a little awkward.   Still, 6 from me.', '2004-11-11 23:43:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1006919, 119041, 18799, '<td valign="top">The black background is a little abrupt for me.   5</td>', 'The black background is a little abrupt for me.   5', '2004-11-11 23:43:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1006922, 119440, 18799, '<td valign="top">Nice photo - doesn''t really say any month in particular to me, but that''s ok, if you say July, then I''ll accept that.   6</td>', 'Nice photo - doesn''t really say any month in particular to me, but that''s ok, if you say July, then I''ll accept that.   6', '2004-11-11 23:45:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1006924, 118312, 18799, '<td valign="top">Why March?  I ask because I don''t "see" any particular month in this photo.   6 for the nice photo.</td>', 'Why March?  I ask because I don''t "see" any particular month in this photo.   6 for the nice photo.', '2004-11-11 23:46:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1006925, 118813, 18799, '<td valign="top">Wow!  Say''s Novemeber to me.  8</td>', 'Wow!  Say''s Novemeber to me.  8', '2004-11-11 23:47:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1006929, 118288, 18799, '<td valign="top">Very busy to me - lacks focal point and sharpness. 5</td>', 'Very busy to me - lacks focal point and sharpness. 5', '2004-11-11 23:48:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1006931, 119576, 23394, '<td valign="top">amazed</td>', 'amazed', '2004-11-11 23:50:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1006932, 118963, 18799, '<td valign="top">The closed eyes and the bar across this photo detract for an otherwise excellent image for me.  I would not buy this image on a calendar (but I did for a candidate ;)  5</td>', 'The closed eyes and the bar across this photo detract for an otherwise excellent image for me.  I would not buy this image on a calendar (but I did for a candidate ;)  5', '2004-11-11 23:50:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1006934, 119524, 18799, '<td valign="top">The bright  light ruins this shot for me.   5</td>', 'The bright  light ruins this shot for me.   5', '2004-11-11 23:51:02.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1006937, 118794, 18799, '<td valign="top">The background is distracting and the flash is a little overpowering.  If you would have cropped much closer on the dog, the photo would have been more effective for me.   5</td>', 'The background is distracting and the flash is a little overpowering.  If you would have cropped much closer on the dog, the photo would have been more effective for me.   5', '2004-11-11 23:52:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1006938, 118781, 18799, '<td valign="top">The water drops on the window don''t work for me.  4</td>', 'The water drops on the window don''t work for me.  4', '2004-11-11 23:53:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1006939, 118987, 18799, '<td valign="top">A nice peaceful scene.  Where I live, all the leaves are gone by this time, but I''m not grading you on that ;)   I like the overall look of the stream, and the angle that you''ve chosen, but personally, I don''t care for the silky looking water that is so much in vogue these days.  Still, a 7 from me.</td>', 'A nice peaceful scene.  Where I live, all the leaves are gone by this time, but I''m not grading you on that ;)   I like the overall look of the stream, and the angle that you''ve chosen, but personally, I don''t care for the silky looking water that is so much in vogue these days.  Still, a 7 from me.', '2004-11-11 23:55:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1006946, 117977, 18799, '<td valign="top">A little busy and contrived for me.  The colors are a little flat too.  Maybe a different background?   5</td>', 'A little busy and contrived for me.  The colors are a little flat too.  Maybe a different background?   5', '2004-11-11 23:58:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1006949, 119077, 18799, '<td valign="top">Nice High-key look to this entry.  7</td>', 'Nice High-key look to this entry.  7', '2004-11-11 23:59:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1006950, 119359, 18799, '<td valign="top">The ducks blend in to the background which makes this photo hard to look at for too long.</td>', 'The ducks blend in to the background which makes this photo hard to look at for too long.', '2004-11-12 00:00:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1006951, 118556, 18799, '<td valign="top">Nice leading line!  It makes me want to walk deeper into the photo to see what''s around the corner.   Good Job!  8</td>', 'Nice leading line!  It makes me want to walk deeper into the photo to see what''s around the corner.   Good Job!  8', '2004-11-12 00:01:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1006954, 119070, 18799, '<td valign="top">Great colors!   I think I might have cropped more of the sky out of the picture.   6</td>', 'Great colors!   I think I might have cropped more of the sky out of the picture.   6', '2004-11-12 00:02:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1006955, 118607, 23394, '<td valign="top">you''re lucky you weren''t arrested for taking this picture...</td>', 'you''re lucky you weren''t arrested for taking this picture...', '2004-11-12 00:02:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1006956, 119303, 18799, '<td valign="top">Great composition and colors here.  I don''t know about the month, but if you say so, I''m ok with that.   9</td>', 'Great composition and colors here.  I don''t know about the month, but if you say so, I''m ok with that.   9', '2004-11-12 00:03:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1006958, 118758, 18799, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t really make sense to me, sorry</td>', 'Doesn''t really make sense to me, sorry', '2004-11-12 00:03:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1006959, 118770, 18799, '<td valign="top">Interesting photo.  There is a kind of halo around the bird that probably comes from some post-processing that you''ve done that I''m not terribly keen on.   6</td>', 'Interesting photo.  There is a kind of halo around the bird that probably comes from some post-processing that you''ve done that I''m not terribly keen on.   6', '2004-11-12 00:05:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1006961, 119516, 18799, '<td valign="top">A nice photo but is a lttle "snap-shot" looking for a calendar  5</td>', 'A nice photo but is a lttle "snap-shot" looking for a calendar  5', '2004-11-12 00:06:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1006963, 119578, 18799, '<td valign="top">I love the backlight on the flag.  The branches are very distracting in front of the cupola or whatever that archetectural element is in the background.   5</td>', 'I love the backlight on the flag.  The branches are very distracting in front of the cupola or whatever that archetectural element is in the background.   5', '2004-11-12 00:07:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1006964, 118607, 18799, '<td valign="top">I love the diagonal bird images here.  8</td>', 'I love the diagonal bird images here.  8', '2004-11-12 00:09:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1006966, 119437, 18799, '<td valign="top">Great choice!  The fact that you chose to include the sheep in this photo is what really makes if for me.  10</td>', 'Great choice!  The fact that you chose to include the sheep in this photo is what really makes if for me.  10', '2004-11-12 00:09:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1006969, 118872, 18799, '<td valign="top">For me, the stripes conflict and distract from the colors of the squash.  5</td>', 'For me, the stripes conflict and distract from the colors of the squash.  5', '2004-11-12 00:10:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1006972, 118479, 18799, '<td valign="top">I''m not real keen on the desat in this photo.  5</td>', 'I''m not real keen on the desat in this photo.  5', '2004-11-12 00:11:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1006975, 118714, 18799, '<td valign="top">The "Ice" look works for a January calendar for me.  Great job of lighting this to get the right highlights without blowing them.  9</td>', 'The "Ice" look works for a January calendar for me.  Great job of lighting this to get the right highlights without blowing them.  9', '2004-11-12 00:13:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1006976, 119179, 18799, '<td valign="top">Neat looking place.  I can almost smell the fallen leaves and musty forest smells.  8</td>', 'Neat looking place.  I can almost smell the fallen leaves and musty forest smells.  8', '2004-11-12 00:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1006978, 118857, 18799, '<td valign="top">Great use of DOF and colors.   9</td>', 'Great use of DOF and colors.   9', '2004-11-12 00:14:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1006981, 118731, 18799, '<td valign="top">I don''t care for the branches coming if from the top.  The road leads me into the picture, but then abruptly stops at the hill, leaving my eyes nowhere to go.  Very close to being a really good photo, but as is, average.  5</td>', 'I don''t care for the branches coming if from the top.  The road leads me into the picture, but then abruptly stops at the hill, leaving my eyes nowhere to go.  Very close to being a really good photo, but as is, average.  5', '2004-11-12 00:16:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1006983, 118675, 18799, '<td valign="top">A little contrasty for my tastes, but good subject matter.  5</td>', 'A little contrasty for my tastes, but good subject matter.  5', '2004-11-12 00:16:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1006984, 118910, 18799, '<td valign="top">I would have liked to have seen more detail in the shadows on the statue.  The color of the leaves doesn''t really say July to me, but that''s a minor nit.  5</td>', 'I would have liked to have seen more detail in the shadows on the statue.  The color of the leaves doesn''t really say July to me, but that''s a minor nit.  5', '2004-11-12 00:18:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1006985, 119190, 18799, '<td valign="top">The sky has a little bit of an over-processed look to me.</td>', 'The sky has a little bit of an over-processed look to me.', '2004-11-12 00:19:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1006986, 119519, 18799, '<td valign="top">Nice photo!  As for the month - if you say so ;)   6</td>', 'Nice photo!  As for the month - if you say so ;)   6', '2004-11-12 00:19:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1006988, 118472, 18799, '<td valign="top">Not keen on the posterized look here.</td>', 'Not keen on the posterized look here.', '2004-11-12 00:20:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1006989, 119356, 18799, '<td valign="top">Good interest from foreground leading to background.  I would have liked to have seen more details in the shadows though   6</td>', 'Good interest from foreground leading to background.  I would have liked to have seen more details in the shadows though   6', '2004-11-12 00:21:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1006990, 119486, 18799, '<td valign="top">Too much sky and a little flat.  Recrop and saturate would brobably be better  5</td>', 'Too much sky and a little flat.  Recrop and saturate would brobably be better  5', '2004-11-12 00:22:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1006991, 118631, 18799, '<td valign="top">The composition is too much in the center and the busy background is distracting.  As for the month, well I September doesn''t jump out a me.   5</td>', 'The composition is too much in the center and the busy background is distracting.  As for the month, well I September doesn''t jump out a me.   5', '2004-11-12 00:23:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1006992, 118962, 18799, '<td valign="top">Awwww... nice "cute" shot.  8</td>', 'Awwww... nice "cute" shot.  8', '2004-11-12 00:24:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1006994, 117726, 18799, '<td valign="top">A little weak in focus, I''m afraid.  5</td>', 'A little weak in focus, I''m afraid.  5', '2004-11-12 00:24:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1006995, 119380, 18799, '<td valign="top">The elements don''t really entice me to spend much time looking at this photo.  No offense.  5</td>', 'The elements don''t really entice me to spend much time looking at this photo.  No offense.  5', '2004-11-12 00:25:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1006996, 118990, 18799, '<td valign="top">This has kind of a November feel to it.   It needs something to make it "pop".  I don''t know if it''s saturation, contract, or a combination.  5</td>', 'This has kind of a November feel to it.   It needs something to make it "pop".  I don''t know if it''s saturation, contract, or a combination.  5', '2004-11-12 00:26:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1006997, 118698, 18799, '<td valign="top">Good concept.  the brights are somewhat overexposed though</td>', 'Good concept.  the brights are somewhat overexposed though', '2004-11-12 00:27:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1006998, 119387, 18799, '<td valign="top">Great photo.  Has kind of an oil paint look to it.   10</td>', 'Great photo.  Has kind of an oil paint look to it.   10', '2004-11-12 00:28:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1006999, 118626, 18799, '<td valign="top">Very "snapshot" looking.  5</td>', 'Very "snapshot" looking.  5', '2004-11-12 00:28:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007002, 118946, 18799, '<td valign="top">Nice shot!  As I''m looking at it, I''m finding myself wondering what it woud have looked like if you were a few steps to the left where we could have seen more of the pier.   7</td>', 'Nice shot!  As I''m looking at it, I''m finding myself wondering what it woud have looked like if you were a few steps to the left where we could have seen more of the pier.   7', '2004-11-12 00:30:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007003, 118939, 18799, '<td valign="top">The colors are a little flat for my tastes</td>', 'The colors are a little flat for my tastes', '2004-11-12 00:31:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007006, 118958, 18799, '<td valign="top">Nice silhouette against the sunset.</td>', 'Nice silhouette against the sunset.', '2004-11-12 00:32:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007007, 119340, 18799, '<td valign="top">Nice, relaxing photo.  Crop works  very well for me.  I think it could have been a little sharper.  6</td>', 'Nice, relaxing photo.  Crop works  very well for me.  I think it could have been a little sharper.  6', '2004-11-12 00:33:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007008, 119050, 18799, '<td valign="top">Lovely little house.  I can smell a wood fire and feel the snap in the air just looking at it.  8</td>', 'Lovely little house.  I can smell a wood fire and feel the snap in the air just looking at it.  8', '2004-11-12 00:34:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007009, 119582, 18799, '<td valign="top">Nice photo - doesn''t really say March to me - but that''s subjective  7</td>', 'Nice photo - doesn''t really say March to me - but that''s subjective  7', '2004-11-12 00:35:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007010, 119328, 18799, '<td valign="top">Nice shot of the inside of a conservatory.  The light colors are a little blown out however   5</td>', 'Nice shot of the inside of a conservatory.  The light colors are a little blown out however   5', '2004-11-12 00:36:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007011, 119484, 18799, '<td valign="top">Great Octber colors.  The brighter leaves in the mid right ae almost demanding my attention, and that''s a distraction   5</td>', 'Great Octber colors.  The brighter leaves in the mid right ae almost demanding my attention, and that''s a distraction   5', '2004-11-12 00:38:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007012, 119446, 18799, '<td valign="top">I think this would have been better with less sky.   5</td>', 'I think this would have been better with less sky.   5', '2004-11-12 00:38:22.000000', NULL, 1),
