(1007018, 118387, 18799, '<td valign="top">I try to look down the street, but keep getting pulled back to the border.  I guess that means the border is too powerful.   Still, a good depiction of the challenge and of November  7</td>', 'I try to look down the street, but keep getting pulled back to the border.  I guess that means the border is too powerful.   Still, a good depiction of the challenge and of November  7', '2004-11-12 00:44:19.000000', NULL, 1),
