(1007022, 119572, 18799, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  I think it would have been even better if the shore line was at more of an angle - Maybe stepping out into the surf a little would have done it.   6</td>', 'Nice shot.  I think it would have been even better if the shore line was at more of an angle - Maybe stepping out into the surf a little would have done it.   6', '2004-11-12 00:47:30.000000', NULL, 1),
