(1007058, 118971, 18799, '<td valign="top">LOL</td>', 'LOL', '2004-11-12 01:09:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007059, 119181, 22384, '<td valign="top">I like the angle of the light and the "realness" of the subjects, by that I mean,  the choice of a couple who are not "young lovers" nor a cliche "cute elderly couple." The photographer has captured a feeling of comfort and ease between these two people. The conflicting energy of him looking ahead and her turning back evokes in me the promise of the future and the security of a shared past. It works very well.</td>', 'I like the angle of the light and the "realness" of the subjects, by that I mean,  the choice of a couple who are not "young lovers" nor a cliche "cute elderly couple." The photographer has captured a feeling of comfort and ease between these two people. The conflicting energy of him looking ahead and her turning back evokes in me the promise of the future and the security of a shared past. It works very well.', '2004-11-12 01:09:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007060, 118740, 18799, '<td valign="top">Nicely done, good eye and good execution.</td>', 'Nicely done, good eye and good execution.', '2004-11-12 01:10:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007062, 119374, 18799, '<td valign="top">Great shot.</td>', 'Great shot.', '2004-11-12 01:11:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007063, 118682, 18799, '<td valign="top">I love the mist in this shot.  Good job!  7</td>', 'I love the mist in this shot.  Good job!  7', '2004-11-12 01:12:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007065, 118525, 22384, '<td valign="top">Simple elegance. An entire calendar using this style would be amazing.</td>', 'Simple elegance. An entire calendar using this style would be amazing.', '2004-11-12 01:14:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007067, 119050, 22384, '<td valign="top">I like the sky and the snow; however,  the angle reminds me of a realty ad. A more creative angle could have made this shot much more powerful. The placement of the house toward the right also creates an unwelcome tension.</td>', 'I like the sky and the snow; however,  the angle reminds me of a realty ad. A more creative angle could have made this shot much more powerful. The placement of the house toward the right also creates an unwelcome tension.', '2004-11-12 01:23:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007071, 118813, 22384, '<td valign="top">This is stunning. The fact that the stars are visible, the movement of the lights up and out of the frame, and the angle of the shot give the feeling of being transported up and beyond the frame of the image. Nice job.</td>', 'This is stunning. The fact that the stars are visible, the movement of the lights up and out of the frame, and the angle of the shot give the feeling of being transported up and beyond the frame of the image. Nice job.', '2004-11-12 01:29:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007072, 119579, 22384, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting. The red and green overpower the yellow of the rose. I focus on the leaves rather than the actual flower, but perhaps that is what the artist was intending. I would need to see an entire calendar of these images to see if the idea works.</td>', 'I like the lighting. The red and green overpower the yellow of the rose. I focus on the leaves rather than the actual flower, but perhaps that is what the artist was intending. I would need to see an entire calendar of these images to see if the idea works.', '2004-11-12 01:31:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007077, 117829, 22384, '<td valign="top">Nice use of light and shadow; it certainly helps create the mood of the odd and grotesque. The placement of the subject within the frame is interesting and evokes a tension that parallels the mood of the lighting and subject.</td>', 'Nice use of light and shadow; it certainly helps create the mood of the odd and grotesque. The placement of the subject within the frame is interesting and evokes a tension that parallels the mood of the lighting and subject.', '2004-11-12 01:34:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007078, 119380, 22384, '<td valign="top">This photograph leaves me unsure of what to focus on. I would like to see more of the dock down at the level of the water, or more of the far shore. One or the other. This framing makes the body of water seem insignificant to me.</td>', 'This photograph leaves me unsure of what to focus on. I would like to see more of the dock down at the level of the water, or more of the far shore. One or the other. This framing makes the body of water seem insignificant to me.', '2004-11-12 01:37:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007082, 118794, 22384, '<td valign="top">Personal opinion here: I am not big on animals in costumes. We have a golden retriever, and they are such beautiful dogs. The dog''s expression seems sad and disengaged. I do like how crisp all the textures in this photograph are. The wide variety of those textures is interesting.</td>', 'Personal opinion here: I am not big on animals in costumes. We have a golden retriever, and they are such beautiful dogs. The dog''s expression seems sad and disengaged. I do like how crisp all the textures in this photograph are. The wide variety of those textures is interesting.', '2004-11-12 01:40:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007083, 119516, 22384, '<td valign="top">Great color and the white steam/exhaust is a perfect foil for those colors. I would have thought the trolley/trian was much larger if there weren''t a person in the photo to give me a sense of scale. I like the composition.</td>', 'Great color and the white steam/exhaust is a perfect foil for those colors. I would have thought the trolley/trian was much larger if there weren''t a person in the photo to give me a sense of scale. I like the composition.', '2004-11-12 01:44:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007085, 118772, 22384, '<td valign="top">I love the idea of this. I would have put it on an orange or black background because the shadows take away from the interesting edges and outline of the popcorn.</td>', 'I love the idea of this. I would have put it on an orange or black background because the shadows take away from the interesting edges and outline of the popcorn.', '2004-11-12 01:45:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007090, 118472, 22384, '<td valign="top">Nice surreal feeling evoked by the filter used on the sky. I also like the muted colors and the crowded feeling of the images. The motif of the crosses move interestingly out of the frame reminding me of the William Cullen Bryant peom "Thanatopsis" and the innumerable caravan of souls that move from the earth constantly. I also like the angle. Interesting photo.</td>', 'Nice surreal feeling evoked by the filter used on the sky. I also like the muted colors and the crowded feeling of the images. The motif of the crosses move interestingly out of the frame reminding me of the William Cullen Bryant peom "Thanatopsis" and the innumerable caravan of souls that move from the earth constantly. I also like the angle. Interesting photo.', '2004-11-12 01:50:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007091, 119387, 22384, '<td valign="top">The lighting looks like a Kinkaide painting. Brilliant and moody. Nice composition.</td>', 'The lighting looks like a Kinkaide painting. Brilliant and moody. Nice composition.', '2004-11-12 01:51:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007096, 119396, 22384, '<td valign="top">The sky, lightening around the trees with darker blue at the edges of the frame,  and the reflection make this a classically composed photo. The trees look sort of mushy, though. I feel the need for something more to make this photo rise above the mundane.</td>', 'The sky, lightening around the trees with darker blue at the edges of the frame,  and the reflection make this a classically composed photo. The trees look sort of mushy, though. I feel the need for something more to make this photo rise above the mundane.', '2004-11-12 01:54:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007098, 118872, 22384, '<td valign="top">The orange and green stripes remind me of some bad decorating fads of the seventies. The fake leaves do parallel that "plastic" feel, too. The stripes and framing make me want to reach out and catch the gourds as they roll off the table. Whether intentionally or unintentionally, the artist has created a sense of movement.</td>', 'The orange and green stripes remind me of some bad decorating fads of the seventies. The fake leaves do parallel that "plastic" feel, too. The stripes and framing make me want to reach out and catch the gourds as they roll off the table. Whether intentionally or unintentionally, the artist has created a sense of movement.', '2004-11-12 01:58:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007101, 119221, 22384, '<td valign="top">I don''t know why this is April, but I like this picture. The metallic buildings march orderly across the frame giving a sense of technology and progress. The bowl shape at the right of the frame adds just enough contrast to create interest.</td>', 'I don''t know why this is April, but I like this picture. The metallic buildings march orderly across the frame giving a sense of technology and progress. The bowl shape at the right of the frame adds just enough contrast to create interest.', '2004-11-12 02:02:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007103, 117915, 22384, '<td valign="top">Again, I am not a fan of animals in costumes. This cat looks ready to claw out the eyes of the person who dressed it up. Perhaps, that was the intent. I am never quite sure what to make of these types of photos. The image is crisp and the textures are interesting.</td>', 'Again, I am not a fan of animals in costumes. This cat looks ready to claw out the eyes of the person who dressed it up. Perhaps, that was the intent. I am never quite sure what to make of these types of photos. The image is crisp and the textures are interesting.', '2004-11-12 02:05:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007105, 118426, 22384, '<td valign="top">It is hard to go wrong with falling leaves, dappled light, and a trail that leads to infinity. I like the framing and the fence. Nice picture.</td>', 'It is hard to go wrong with falling leaves, dappled light, and a trail that leads to infinity. I like the framing and the fence. Nice picture.', '2004-11-12 02:07:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007107, 118698, 22384, '<td valign="top">Great warm colors and lighting. The earthy textures and the worn look of the pan all go well together. I want the table or counter top to be nicked up a bit. The eggs or one egg alone using this same lighting and color would be stunning.</td>', 'Great warm colors and lighting. The earthy textures and the worn look of the pan all go well together. I want the table or counter top to be nicked up a bit. The eggs or one egg alone using this same lighting and color would be stunning.', '2004-11-12 02:10:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007109, 119021, 22384, '<td valign="top">I like everything about this photo. It looks like Christmas to me, sparkly and bright, holding off the darkness of night.</td>', 'I like everything about this photo. It looks like Christmas to me, sparkly and bright, holding off the darkness of night.', '2004-11-12 02:16:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007110, 119435, 22384, '<td valign="top">Nice crisp image, but there is no tension, nothing very interesting in the photo for me. I like the angle.</td>', 'Nice crisp image, but there is no tension, nothing very interesting in the photo for me. I like the angle.', '2004-11-12 02:18:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007112, 119299, 22384, '<td valign="top">I like the framing of this photo. It speaks to the possibilities beyond the fence, and no horizon makes it seem as if the rest of the world beyond that fence is made of water.  I want to sun to be bright, though. How unfair is that? Sorry.</td>', 'I like the framing of this photo. It speaks to the possibilities beyond the fence, and no horizon makes it seem as if the rest of the world beyond that fence is made of water.  I want to sun to be bright, though. How unfair is that? Sorry.', '2004-11-12 02:21:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007113, 119577, 22384, '<td valign="top">Stunning. I live in northern Nevada and I love it when the light is like this. I think it is the finest lighting in the world. The framing and the forboding clouds on the horizon make this an image of conflicts, truly capturing nature and her moodiness.</td>', 'Stunning. I live in northern Nevada and I love it when the light is like this. I think it is the finest lighting in the world. The framing and the forboding clouds on the horizon make this an image of conflicts, truly capturing nature and her moodiness.', '2004-11-12 02:24:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007115, 118857, 22384, '<td valign="top">I am a sucker for braches with leaves and red fruit. The snow only makes it more amazing. I love the framing, the colors and the water drops. Excellent photo.</td>', 'I am a sucker for braches with leaves and red fruit. The snow only makes it more amazing. I love the framing, the colors and the water drops. Excellent photo.', '2004-11-12 02:26:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007118, 119220, 22384, '<td valign="top">I love the serenity of this photo. Simple and well framed.</td>', 'I love the serenity of this photo. Simple and well framed.', '2004-11-12 02:28:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007120, 119155, 22384, '<td valign="top">Powerful image. A bit too powerful for me. I would crop closer or move back for a point of reference. It seems that whatever is burning (pallets?) looks like a building. I would not have guessed that this was a bonfire without the title. Great colors, but it reminds me of Halloween gone wrong.</td>', 'Powerful image. A bit too powerful for me. I would crop closer or move back for a point of reference. It seems that whatever is burning (pallets?) looks like a building. I would not have guessed that this was a bonfire without the title. Great colors, but it reminds me of Halloween gone wrong.', '2004-11-12 02:30:58.000000', NULL, 1),
