(1007291, 119286, 18799, '<td valign="top">I love these rolling hills.  I think using the rule of thirds on your horizon would have helped this photo.  I think there is too much sky.  Just one opinion.</td>', 'I love these rolling hills.  I think using the rule of thirds on your horizon would have helped this photo.  I think there is too much sky.  Just one opinion.', '2004-11-12 07:33:58.000000', NULL, 1),
