(1007503, 119336, 28084, '<td valign="top">Great pic.</td>', 'Great pic.', '2004-11-12 10:25:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007860, 119190, 25486, '<td valign="top">Stunning is the word that comes to mind.  The hole in the clouds is very burnt but is balanced by the reflection on the water, very dark in the distance, a very dramatic effect.  The row of houses is almost surreal in contrast to the background.  The subdued colours helps the mind fit them into the image.<br/> <br/>There''s a graininess to the image, I don''t know if its intentional or just as a result of the settings of the camera but it works quite well.  The houses seem to dip down ever so slightly to the right, I find it distracting once I''ve noticed it.<br/> <br/>Never the less a dramatic image and the winner in my opinion, a 9 from me.<br/></td>', 'Stunning is the word that comes to mind.  The hole in the clouds is very burnt but is balanced by the reflection on the water, very dark in the distance, a very dramatic effect.  The row of houses is almost surreal in contrast to the background.  The subdued colours helps the mind fit them into the image. There''s a graininess to the image, I don''t know if its intentional or just as a result of the settings of the camera but it works quite well.  The houses seem to dip down ever so slightly to the right, I find it distracting once I''ve noticed it. Never the less a dramatic image and the winner in my opinion, a 9 from me.', '2004-11-12 13:17:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007866, 119434, 25486, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot.  Its sharp, well composed, the light is good, the black background is used to good effect.  Not quite as good as a few other images I''ve seen in the challenge but something to be proud of, I would be.  Well done a 7 from me.</td>', 'Excellent shot.  Its sharp, well composed, the light is good, the black background is used to good effect.  Not quite as good as a few other images I''ve seen in the challenge but something to be proud of, I would be.  Well done a 7 from me.', '2004-11-12 13:20:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007873, 118720, 25486, '<td valign="top">A nicely composed shot, a couple of points that didn''t let me score it higher.  The tricky lighting conditions here with the dark foreground and the bright light reflected from the water means just that, the foreground is dark, ist not that bad though.  The bright sky is washed out, almost all white.  A graduated filter may have helped darken the sky and allowed a brighter foreground.  Its also a bit hazy in the distance, maybe the direction of the light or the time of day.  Well done though a nice image. A six from me.</td>', 'A nicely composed shot, a couple of points that didn''t let me score it higher.  The tricky lighting conditions here with the dark foreground and the bright light reflected from the water means just that, the foreground is dark, ist not that bad though.  The bright sky is washed out, almost all white.  A graduated filter may have helped darken the sky and allowed a brighter foreground.  Its also a bit hazy in the distance, maybe the direction of the light or the time of day.  Well done though a nice image. A six from me.', '2004-11-12 13:25:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007881, 119397, 25486, '<td valign="top">Let me start with the score, get it out of the way, a six from me.  Now as to why, I like this kind of image and have tried to make them myself.  The graininess and poster like edges give it an interest thats hard to define.  I feel that the cropping is a bit out, I think less sky and more of the interesting looking foreground fence would be better.  Also changing position so that the windmill is not hidden behine the tree cound have given interest in the distance.  Well done though, a good shot.</td>', 'Let me start with the score, get it out of the way, a six from me.  Now as to why, I like this kind of image and have tried to make them myself.  The graininess and poster like edges give it an interest thats hard to define.  I feel that the cropping is a bit out, I think less sky and more of the interesting looking foreground fence would be better.  Also changing position so that the windmill is not hidden behine the tree cound have given interest in the distance.  Well done though, a good shot.', '2004-11-12 13:29:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007882, 119285, 25486, '<td valign="top">A very light and delicate shot.  The colours are very good and compliment each other well.  The repeating curling plants take the eye into the picture and give it depth.  The use of DOF is good and I think just right.  Well done a six from me.</td>', 'A very light and delicate shot.  The colours are very good and compliment each other well.  The repeating curling plants take the eye into the picture and give it depth.  The use of DOF is good and I think just right.  Well done a six from me.', '2004-11-12 13:32:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007884, 119285, 19936, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful shot.  I can see it on a farm type calendar.  I love the shallow DOP, the rich golden color with  blue background and the gentle curving lines make this very appealing.  Great job.  One of my highest rated shots.</td>', 'This is a beautiful shot.  I can see it on a farm type calendar.  I love the shallow DOP, the rich golden color with  blue background and the gentle curving lines make this very appealing.  Great job.  One of my highest rated shots.', '2004-11-12 13:33:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007885, 119079, 19936, '<td valign="top">A calendar for the season!  Great idea and use of primary colors.  Simple subject arranged with symmetry.  Good job.</td>', 'A calendar for the season!  Great idea and use of primary colors.  Simple subject arranged with symmetry.  Good job.', '2004-11-12 13:36:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007886, 119434, 19936, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!  What detail and the curving lines add a comfortable look.  Good choice of b/w.  Great nature calendar entry.</td>', 'Beautiful!  What detail and the curving lines add a comfortable look.  Good choice of b/w.  Great nature calendar entry.', '2004-11-12 13:38:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007889, 119577, 25486, '<td valign="top">A wonderful scene.  The light and shade created by the clouds gives great depth to what could have been a bland looking shot.  Good detail in the sky, nice cloud formations.  The only thing is the tree in the middle distance.  It seems like neither one thing or the other.  Its not the main feature and its not a framing feature, it just seems to get in the way.  The fact that its top branches stop right on the horizon doesn''t help, that sort of thing should be avoided as a general rule.  I think this image could have been a lot better if.....(assuming this was possible?)  you had framed the picture using the tree in the middle rather than the tree to left, by going down the bankside a little, giving an unobnstructed view of the valley at the same time.  Well done anyway, a six from me.</td>', 'A wonderful scene.  The light and shade created by the clouds gives great depth to what could have been a bland looking shot.  Good detail in the sky, nice cloud formations.  The only thing is the tree in the middle distance.  It seems like neither one thing or the other.  Its not the main feature and its not a framing feature, it just seems to get in the way.  The fact that its top branches stop right on the horizon doesn''t help, that sort of thing should be avoided as a general rule.  I think this image could have been a lot better if.....(assuming this was possible?)  you had framed the picture using the tree in the middle rather than the tree to left, by going down the bankside a little, giving an unobnstructed view of the valley at the same time.  Well done anyway, a six from me.', '2004-11-12 13:39:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007894, 118341, 19936, '<td valign="top">Ah Jeez, using a cute baby and a teddy bear!  No fair.  This is a beautiful shot, well composed, good choice of all white with pink baby (who is showing a little attitude).  Good job.</td>', 'Ah Jeez, using a cute baby and a teddy bear!  No fair.  This is a beautiful shot, well composed, good choice of all white with pink baby (who is showing a little attitude).  Good job.', '2004-11-12 13:41:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007898, 118949, 25486, '<td valign="top">This was the very first image that came up when I started voting, I score them then come back to add comments.  The colours are what make this shot for me and the light.  The composition is rather strange, I assume there''s something below the crop that you didn''t what to include?  Its strange how the red and gold trees in the background seen overlaid on the rest?  Nice image, a six from me.</td>', 'This was the very first image that came up when I started voting, I score them then come back to add comments.  The colours are what make this shot for me and the light.  The composition is rather strange, I assume there''s something below the crop that you didn''t what to include?  Its strange how the red and gold trees in the background seen overlaid on the rest?  Nice image, a six from me.', '2004-11-12 13:44:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007899, 119393, 19936, '<td valign="top">Great composition.  I find the colors appealing and appropriate for the subject.  Focus (DOP) is good but seems a little out on the edges on my monitor.  But overall very good shot.</td>', 'Great composition.  I find the colors appealing and appropriate for the subject.  Focus (DOP) is good but seems a little out on the edges on my monitor.  But overall very good shot.', '2004-11-12 13:45:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007901, 119179, 25486, '<td valign="top">I like trees and I like photo''s of trees, its difficult to take a photo of trees and convey the feeling of the forest though.  I think this shot comes very close.  The colours are nice, not over saturated I don''t think, slightly over sharpend perhaps?  Nicely lit, good depth to the shot, well done a six from me.</td>', 'I like trees and I like photo''s of trees, its difficult to take a photo of trees and convey the feeling of the forest though.  I think this shot comes very close.  The colours are nice, not over saturated I don''t think, slightly over sharpend perhaps?  Nicely lit, good depth to the shot, well done a six from me.', '2004-11-12 13:46:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007908, 118691, 19936, '<td valign="top">Great shot for a bird calendar!  Bohemian Waxwings are so colorful and make a great subject.  Good focus and capture of some movement.  For me the siding in the background is a little distracting but I''m usre you had little choice here.  Good job.</td>', 'Great shot for a bird calendar!  Bohemian Waxwings are so colorful and make a great subject.  Good focus and capture of some movement.  For me the siding in the background is a little distracting but I''m usre you had little choice here.  Good job.', '2004-11-12 13:50:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007914, 118312, 19936, '<td valign="top">Nice long lens or your one brave photographer!  Great focus and DOP.  I like the close crop and it would fit wonderful on a wildlife calendar.  Good job.</td>', 'Nice long lens or your one brave photographer!  Great focus and DOP.  I like the close crop and it would fit wonderful on a wildlife calendar.  Good job.', '2004-11-12 13:52:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007917, 119576, 19936, '<td valign="top">Not sure what calendar this would go on but I want one.  Great use of B/W and slight soft focus.  Very gentle look to it.  Good job.</td>', 'Not sure what calendar this would go on but I want one.  Great use of B/W and slight soft focus.  Very gentle look to it.  Good job.', '2004-11-12 13:55:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007920, 119579, 19936, '<td valign="top">Great color and I love the use of the red background.  Good framing.  Slight loss of focus on back edges of rose is only issue here.  Great overall shot.</td>', 'Great color and I love the use of the red background.  Good framing.  Slight loss of focus on back edges of rose is only issue here.  Great overall shot.', '2004-11-12 13:57:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007928, 119356, 4517, '<td valign="top">My eye is more drawn towards the background as it looks more interesting.</td>', 'My eye is more drawn towards the background as it looks more interesting.', '2004-11-12 13:59:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007933, 119375, 25486, '<td valign="top">Flower shots are not normally my thing but, I like the effect you have created and the angle at which it is shot.  It adds interest to what would have been a rather dull shot.  A six from me for being different and producing a worthwhile image, well done.</td>', 'Flower shots are not normally my thing but, I like the effect you have created and the angle at which it is shot.  It adds interest to what would have been a rather dull shot.  A six from me for being different and producing a worthwhile image, well done.', '2004-11-12 14:05:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007937, 118525, 25486, '<td valign="top">Very simple, very elegant.  The duotone is excellent.  The shadow is good, it gives it a 3D effect.  The grain adds interest and gives atmosphere AND I think the border is wonderful, very nice touch.  Well done a six from me.</td>', 'Very simple, very elegant.  The duotone is excellent.  The shadow is good, it gives it a 3D effect.  The grain adds interest and gives atmosphere AND I think the border is wonderful, very nice touch.  Well done a six from me.', '2004-11-12 14:07:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007939, 118778, 4517, '<td valign="top">Well spotted. Great reflection. Has a bit of a yellow cast to it, i think.</td>', 'Well spotted. Great reflection. Has a bit of a yellow cast to it, i think.', '2004-11-12 14:08:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007941, 119387, 25486, '<td valign="top">Nice moody shot.  A bit of colour in the distant sky, more would have been nice but unless you have a weather machine...  The colours are very nice, not overdone I don''t think, same for the sharpening, not too much.  Very nice scene with a touch of atmosphere.  With the tree, the plants and the rocks leading you out that way.  Very well done, a six from me.  Oh and I LOVE the border, sets it off very nicely.</td>', 'Nice moody shot.  A bit of colour in the distant sky, more would have been nice but unless you have a weather machine...  The colours are very nice, not overdone I don''t think, same for the sharpening, not too much.  Very nice scene with a touch of atmosphere.  With the tree, the plants and the rocks leading you out that way.  Very well done, a six from me.  Oh and I LOVE the border, sets it off very nicely.', '2004-11-12 14:11:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007943, 119104, 25486, '<td valign="top">Nice shot but, the blue colour cast seems to detract from it for me.  Also I think having the horizon right across the middle of the shot here doesn''t work to well.  I think more of the sea, (where there''s some movement) and less of the bland sky would have worked better.  For the record I think the border is great, well done a six from me.</td>', 'Nice shot but, the blue colour cast seems to detract from it for me.  Also I think having the horizon right across the middle of the shot here doesn''t work to well.  I think more of the sea, (where there''s some movement) and less of the bland sky would have worked better.  For the record I think the border is great, well done a six from me.', '2004-11-12 14:14:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007948, 119491, 25486, '<td valign="top">Very nice sunset with some middle ground interest.  I bit of a very nice silky feel to it.  Couldn''t go any higher because that''s all there is, nothing wrong with that, don''t get me wrong, I''d be very proud of this shot.  Just needs something else in there in my opinion, like birds or a boat or something.  It just seems a bitn two dimensional.  Well done all the same and a six from me.<br/> <br/>PS. I like the border as wel.</td>', 'Very nice sunset with some middle ground interest.  I bit of a very nice silky feel to it.  Couldn''t go any higher because that''s all there is, nothing wrong with that, don''t get me wrong, I''d be very proud of this shot.  Just needs something else in there in my opinion, like birds or a boat or something.  It just seems a bitn two dimensional.  Well done all the same and a six from me. PS. I like the border as wel.', '2004-11-12 14:18:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007949, 118720, 4517, '<td valign="top">Good composition and pleasant scene. This is a 6 to me but could easily be a 9-10 if shot with better light/sky and if you had cloned out the very distracting sticks at front center.</td>', 'Good composition and pleasant scene. This is a 6 to me but could easily be a 9-10 if shot with better light/sky and if you had cloned out the very distracting sticks at front center.', '2004-11-12 14:19:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007950, 118335, 4517, '<td valign="top">Good use of negative space. I think it works. 8</td>', 'Good use of negative space. I think it works. 8', '2004-11-12 14:22:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007953, 119572, 25486, '<td valign="top">A very nice shot.  Good sky, looks like a graduated filter? or similar effect?  Nice lead in''s from the seashore, the trees etc.  However I find the people in the shot a distraction, I know its not your private beach, (is it? If it is then the best photo I''ve ever seen, can I come and take some,please), They are too far away to add anything to the shot.  If they had been closer and walking into the shot that would have been about ideal.  As it is the shot lacks some interest in the middle, without those figures the interest would have been the vast empty beach, in my opinion anyway.  Well done though, a six from me.</td>', 'A very nice shot.  Good sky, looks like a graduated filter? or similar effect?  Nice lead in''s from the seashore, the trees etc.  However I find the people in the shot a distraction, I know its not your private beach, (is it? If it is then the best photo I''ve ever seen, can I come and take some,please), They are too far away to add anything to the shot.  If they had been closer and walking into the shot that would have been about ideal.  As it is the shot lacks some interest in the middle, without those figures the interest would have been the vast empty beach, in my opinion anyway.  Well done though, a six from me.', '2004-11-12 14:23:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007976, 118987, 28708, '<td valign="top">Nice example of the soft water effect. The patch of orange and the yellow in the back bring out the shot and go well with the flow of the stream.</td>', 'Nice example of the soft water effect. The patch of orange and the yellow in the back bring out the shot and go well with the flow of the stream.', '2004-11-12 14:39:36.000000', NULL, 1),
