(1007990, 118672, 24962, '<td valign="top">Love this photo, lighting and reflections on the water are stunning. The only down point for me is the mudflat, would have preferred it tighter cropped to eliminate some of the mud. A great shot, well done!</td>', 'Love this photo, lighting and reflections on the water are stunning. The only down point for me is the mudflat, would have preferred it tighter cropped to eliminate some of the mud. A great shot, well done!', '2004-11-12 14:48:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007993, 119437, 24962, '<td valign="top">What a lovely photo, the eyes are drawn around and round the whole scene, at first you don''t notice the sheep, then you start to see the lower stars, then upper stars. Simply stunning, well done. 10</td>', 'What a lovely photo, the eyes are drawn around and round the whole scene, at first you don''t notice the sheep, then you start to see the lower stars, then upper stars. Simply stunning, well done. 10', '2004-11-12 14:50:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007998, 118813, 24962, '<td valign="top">This is great! The way the trees dominate the lower ground and the stars the upper part of the picture. Would love to see it in larger form to identify the constellations. Well done 10</td>', 'This is great! The way the trees dominate the lower ground and the stars the upper part of the picture. Would love to see it in larger form to identify the constellations. Well done 10', '2004-11-12 14:52:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008003, 118691, 24962, '<td valign="top">A charming photo of, if I am not mistaken, Waxwings. Well done and Good luck!</td>', 'A charming photo of, if I am not mistaken, Waxwings. Well done and Good luck!', '2004-11-12 14:54:02.000000', NULL, 1),
