(1008054, 119243, 21714, '<td valign="top">it makes me wonder why anyone would want to print a calendar to include this image.  I do agree that calendars cover a lot of things, but when you have to look at this image for a month, don''t you think that it''s going to affect someone in a rather negative way? <br/>For the technical matters, the structure on the top right takes away the flow of the image. It takes away the vastness and the distance.</td>', 'it makes me wonder why anyone would want to print a calendar to include this image.  I do agree that calendars cover a lot of things, but when you have to look at this image for a month, don''t you think that it''s going to affect someone in a rather negative way? For the technical matters, the structure on the top right takes away the flow of the image. It takes away the vastness and the distance.', '2004-11-12 15:26:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008057, 118958, 21714, '<td valign="top">You have used something in the foreground to add to the image, but in this case it has become something that distracts your from a beautiful scene. I do believe that this image would be stronger without the foreground which acts like a fork in your eye.</td>', 'You have used something in the foreground to add to the image, but in this case it has become something that distracts your from a beautiful scene. I do believe that this image would be stronger without the foreground which acts like a fork in your eye.', '2004-11-12 15:28:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008068, 119399, 21714, '<td valign="top">I like the way you have shot and the colours you have been able to produce. But, I do think that you have gone a little bit over with it. I think I would have really liked it without so much processing on it. It''s way too sharp that halos are around the rocks and the digital noise are sticking out from the water.  Too harsh a treatment for a rather soothing scene. You have done a great job with composition and exposure, it''s just the processing that I am rather unhappy about.<br/></td>', 'I like the way you have shot and the colours you have been able to produce. But, I do think that you have gone a little bit over with it. I think I would have really liked it without so much processing on it. It''s way too sharp that halos are around the rocks and the digital noise are sticking out from the water.  Too harsh a treatment for a rather soothing scene. You have done a great job with composition and exposure, it''s just the processing that I am rather unhappy about.', '2004-11-12 15:33:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008079, 119104, 21714, '<td valign="top">The image is interesting but the treatment given to it is not. It looks all smudged. Doesn''t look like a photograph (this could be bit of a stretch). But, my point is, this looks like the result of a badly exposed photograph forced to look nice with processing, or a really good photograph with too much messing about. <br/>I like the compostion and the subject matter.</td>', 'The image is interesting but the treatment given to it is not. It looks all smudged. Doesn''t look like a photograph (this could be bit of a stretch). But, my point is, this looks like the result of a badly exposed photograph forced to look nice with processing, or a really good photograph with too much messing about. I like the compostion and the subject matter.', '2004-11-12 15:36:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008091, 119576, 21714, '<td valign="top">:)<br/>Now you''re talkin'' <br/>Kudos to you for coming up with it and submitting.  <br/>Like the softness and treatment of the image, conveying the gentle touch.</td>', ':)Now you''re talkin'' Kudos to you for coming up with it and submitting.  Like the softness and treatment of the image, conveying the gentle touch.', '2004-11-12 15:42:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008096, 118939, 21714, '<td valign="top">Is she? :)<br/>I think the light balance in this is a bit off for a pleasent image. Her shadow in the background and the bright patch at bottom left takes away a lot. I think moving her a bit away from the backdrop would have made it better (I have a feeling you would have done it if you had the space).  <br/>I like her expression, how you have captured it. I am sure you will be a bit unhappy with a few things in the image as well, and would surely be trying to get it right. <br/>Best of luck.</td>', 'Is she? :)I think the light balance in this is a bit off for a pleasent image. Her shadow in the background and the bright patch at bottom left takes away a lot. I think moving her a bit away from the backdrop would have made it better (I have a feeling you would have done it if you had the space).  I like her expression, how you have captured it. I am sure you will be a bit unhappy with a few things in the image as well, and would surely be trying to get it right. Best of luck.', '2004-11-12 15:47:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008099, 119434, 21714, '<td valign="top">IT IS BEAUTIFUL!!!!<br/>Just sitting here and starring at it. Great Great capture. I love how the neck forms the curve and how you have cropped to balance it all. The detail is brilliant and the B&amp;W conversion is excellent. I love this image. It''s a beauty!</td>', 'IT IS BEAUTIFUL!!!!Just sitting here and starring at it. Great Great capture. I love how the neck forms the curve and how you have cropped to balance it all. The detail is brilliant and the B&W conversion is excellent. I love this image. It''s a beauty!', '2004-11-12 15:52:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008104, 119078, 21714, '<td valign="top">I really like this image, but I would have preffered it without the bright patch at bottom right. Also, I don''t think that a website is the place this one should be on. It needs to printed large and displayed on a wall.</td>', 'I really like this image, but I would have preffered it without the bright patch at bottom right. Also, I don''t think that a website is the place this one should be on. It needs to printed large and displayed on a wall.', '2004-11-12 15:54:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008110, 119018, 21714, '<td valign="top">Looks like you have treated it like a gallery challenge. :) <br/>I like the image, but the framing is taking away the detail because the  image itself is small. I would like to see a bigger version of it.</td>', 'Looks like you have treated it like a gallery challenge. :) I like the image, but the framing is taking away the detail because the  image itself is small. I would like to see a bigger version of it.', '2004-11-12 15:59:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008112, 118895, 21714, '<td valign="top">EH! what the f*** is that!!! <br/>Looks like someone has been busy hunting humans. I really don''t think I want to see that on a Calendar. Whatever is in there, it''s not something I want to see for a whole month.</td>', 'EH! what the f*** is that!!! Looks like someone has been busy hunting humans. I really don''t think I want to see that on a Calendar. Whatever is in there, it''s not something I want to see for a whole month.', '2004-11-12 16:02:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008156, 118691, 21714, '<td valign="top">I like the 2 birds on the top left and the one on top right. But combined with the rest of the stuff going in the image,  it does look a bit cluttered. Also, I think the processing has made them look a bit unreal, like rubber. There''s no detail on the birds. It''s way too smudged. I don''t know what you used to do it, but it doesn''t look good.</td>', 'I like the 2 birds on the top left and the one on top right. But combined with the rest of the stuff going in the image,  it does look a bit cluttered. Also, I think the processing has made them look a bit unreal, like rubber. There''s no detail on the birds. It''s way too smudged. I don''t know what you used to do it, but it doesn''t look good.', '2004-11-12 16:36:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008166, 119336, 21714, '<td valign="top">That''s a great capture. I really like it. But I do feel that there''s too much or less of the dog. It''s a bit ''not right''. I have a feeling that something like a 6x4 crop starting from the top would work better. I don''t the bottom half of the image, but the toip half is brilliant. I think just the dog''s head and the leaves would have made a better image. I feel that everything else in not really needed here. I have to bow to you for this capture. Well done.</td>', 'That''s a great capture. I really like it. But I do feel that there''s too much or less of the dog. It''s a bit ''not right''. I have a feeling that something like a 6x4 crop starting from the top would work better. I don''t the bottom half of the image, but the toip half is brilliant. I think just the dog''s head and the leaves would have made a better image. I feel that everything else in not really needed here. I have to bow to you for this capture. Well done.', '2004-11-12 16:41:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008173, 119359, 21714, '<td valign="top">I don''t find the image very interesting, not because of the subject matter. In fact I believe that anything in this world can be photographed beautifully. <br/>The photograph looks like a mess. Birds are every where and your eyes are moving arr around. There''s nothing that really grabs your attention. I think if you had waited or were able to capture maybe just one bird sharp in focus (in an interesting way) and forget about the rest, it would have made the image much stronger. The way it is now, I actually don''t know what I should be looking at or what the image is about. <br/>Hope take more shots and experiment with different settings. Best of luck.</td>', 'I don''t find the image very interesting, not because of the subject matter. In fact I believe that anything in this world can be photographed beautifully. The photograph looks like a mess. Birds are every where and your eyes are moving arr around. There''s nothing that really grabs your attention. I think if you had waited or were able to capture maybe just one bird sharp in focus (in an interesting way) and forget about the rest, it would have made the image much stronger. The way it is now, I actually don''t know what I should be looking at or what the image is about. Hope take more shots and experiment with different settings. Best of luck.', '2004-11-12 16:44:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008178, 119107, 21714, '<td valign="top">You have made a nice compositon. I even like the compostion. But. I have also read the title. It''s this word ''showers'' and the lighting in it that''s bothering me. I can associate the image with showers at all. It actually looks to me more like it was taken on a really sunny and beautiful day. That''s the idea I get from the patches on the umbrella and the lighting on her. Also, it doesn''t at all look like it was taken at a natural surrounding. Correct me if I am wrong, but the word STUDIO is screaming at my face. <br/>As am image, I like it. But what you wanted to represent with the image is what I am not sure about.</td>', 'You have made a nice compositon. I even like the compostion. But. I have also read the title. It''s this word ''showers'' and the lighting in it that''s bothering me. I can associate the image with showers at all. It actually looks to me more like it was taken on a really sunny and beautiful day. That''s the idea I get from the patches on the umbrella and the lighting on her. Also, it doesn''t at all look like it was taken at a natural surrounding. Correct me if I am wrong, but the word STUDIO is screaming at my face. As am image, I like it. But what you wanted to represent with the image is what I am not sure about.', '2004-11-12 16:49:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008183, 117829, 21714, '<td valign="top">Good question. Why me? Salute the person who created the sculpture. <br/>Well done is presenting it like this.  I really like this image.  But when I really think about it it''s because I love this sculpture. But you have to have a good eye to spot it and them compose it like this.  So all the the credit to you too. Well done.</td>', 'Good question. Why me? Salute the person who created the sculpture. Well done is presenting it like this.  I really like this image.  But when I really think about it it''s because I love this sculpture. But you have to have a good eye to spot it and them compose it like this.  So all the the credit to you too. Well done.', '2004-11-12 16:52:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008184, 118971, 10390, '<td valign="top">The leafs remind me of the fall... funny idea, made me smile</td>', 'The leafs remind me of the fall... funny idea, made me smile', '2004-11-12 16:52:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008187, 119541, 10268, '<td valign="top">I had a Joshua tree in mine too!  Mine''s not doing so well, though.<br/> <br/>I like this one, just looks a tad underexposed.</td>', 'I had a Joshua tree in mine too!  Mine''s not doing so well, though. I like this one, just looks a tad underexposed.', '2004-11-12 16:54:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008188, 119434, 10390, '<td valign="top">The svan is maybe a little bit too dark, but otherwise this is a great shot.</td>', 'The svan is maybe a little bit too dark, but otherwise this is a great shot.', '2004-11-12 16:54:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008190, 119524, 10268, '<td valign="top">I''m not too keen on the lens flare in this.  When done well, I think it can add so much to the photo, but I don''t see a need for it here.</td>', 'I''m not too keen on the lens flare in this.  When done well, I think it can add so much to the photo, but I don''t see a need for it here.', '2004-11-12 16:55:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008191, 119489, 10390, '<td valign="top">Nice, moody image.</td>', 'Nice, moody image.', '2004-11-12 16:55:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008194, 119526, 10390, '<td valign="top">take off about half of the foreground and crop it more panorama and you''ll improve this otherwise a nice shot.</td>', 'take off about half of the foreground and crop it more panorama and you''ll improve this otherwise a nice shot.', '2004-11-12 16:56:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008196, 119569, 10268, '<td valign="top">The green is nice, but the tilted  horizon is really distracting.  Other than that, it''s good.  Maybe the colors are a little flat too.  I know it''s night photography, and I''m not very experienced in it, but I think that the is too much gray.  Maybe?  I don''t know.  Something isn''t sitting right with me about it, though.</td>', 'The green is nice, but the tilted  horizon is really distracting.  Other than that, it''s good.  Maybe the colors are a little flat too.  I know it''s night photography, and I''m not very experienced in it, but I think that the is too much gray.  Maybe?  I don''t know.  Something isn''t sitting right with me about it, though.', '2004-11-12 16:57:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008200, 119077, 10268, '<td valign="top">This is like the perfect calendar photo!  10.  Good luck, I hope you ribbon.</td>', 'This is like the perfect calendar photo!  10.  Good luck, I hope you ribbon.', '2004-11-12 17:00:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008202, 118335, 10390, '<td valign="top">Very good use of negative space, I like this photo.  It could be useful for many printed materials like business cards.</td>', 'Very good use of negative space, I like this photo.  It could be useful for many printed materials like business cards.', '2004-11-12 17:02:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008205, 119060, 10390, '<td valign="top">Nice catch.</td>', 'Nice catch.', '2004-11-12 17:02:50.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1008208, 118740, 21714, '<td valign="top">I don''t like the treatment on this at all! (I know some people like it a lot). But this is my opinion.<br/>The details are lost and the point where the boats are meeing the wate all all smudged except for the one that''s the closest. I think I would have likes it bettter without this sort of treatment. I think it would have looked better with a more subtle treatment.</td>', 'I don''t like the treatment on this at all! (I know some people like it a lot). But this is my opinion.The details are lost and the point where the boats are meeing the wate all all smudged except for the one that''s the closest. I think I would have likes it bettter without this sort of treatment. I think it would have looked better with a more subtle treatment.', '2004-11-12 17:04:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008211, 119179, 10390, '<td valign="top">Great image, one of the best I''ve seen so far in the challenge.  Very good composition, I like the placement of the green roots and how the balance the photo with the leafs at the top in the frame.</td>', 'Great image, one of the best I''ve seen so far in the challenge.  Very good composition, I like the placement of the green roots and how the balance the photo with the leafs at the top in the frame.', '2004-11-12 17:05:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008218, 118813, 10390, '<td valign="top">Nice aurora shot, the "open" tree at the bottom to the left helps a lot and the placement of it is very good.</td>', 'Nice aurora shot, the "open" tree at the bottom to the left helps a lot and the placement of it is very good.', '2004-11-12 17:07:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008219, 119519, 21714, '<td valign="top">I love the colours in this. Just wish that more of the scene was seen. I know that you have focussed on just one part of the scene. But the image cries out for more. That''s me wanting to experience what you experienced there. It does look like there''s some defects in the processing or the capture. The sky looks like it''s got  this blotches. <br/>I like it, but just poitning out what I would have liked to see. Well done.</td>', 'I love the colours in this. Just wish that more of the scene was seen. I know that you have focussed on just one part of the scene. But the image cries out for more. That''s me wanting to experience what you experienced there. It does look like there''s some defects in the processing or the capture. The sky looks like it''s got  this blotches. I like it, but just poitning out what I would have liked to see. Well done.', '2004-11-12 17:07:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008234, 119303, 10390, '<td valign="top">Great motive you have there to work with. I could spend the day there at this spot, there''s a lot of motives just in this frame.</td>', 'Great motive you have there to work with. I could spend the day there at this spot, there''s a lot of motives just in this frame.', '2004-11-12 17:11:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008236, 119041, 10390, '<td valign="top">Great for cat lovers, well done.</td>', 'Great for cat lovers, well done.', '2004-11-12 17:11:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008246, 118980, 10390, '<td valign="top">good composition and a typical calendar photo.</td>', 'good composition and a typical calendar photo.', '2004-11-12 17:13:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008259, 118420, 10390, '<td valign="top">the space above the flower should be similar to the spaces at the sides, you should then crop off the "ring" at the bottom, otherwise an ok photo.</td>', 'the space above the flower should be similar to the spaces at the sides, you should then crop off the "ring" at the bottom, otherwise an ok photo.', '2004-11-12 17:15:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008268, 119328, 10390, '<td valign="top">You should have focused on a closer and tighter shot so it wouldn''t be seen that this is an inside shot.</td>', 'You should have focused on a closer and tighter shot so it wouldn''t be seen that this is an inside shot.', '2004-11-12 17:17:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008291, 119520, 10390, '<td valign="top">The light in this shot is too hard, it should be softer.</td>', 'The light in this shot is too hard, it should be softer.', '2004-11-12 17:21:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008296, 118895, 10390, '<td valign="top">I can really feel this photo, reminds me of nights in cabins when travelling in the highlands of Iceland  at winter.</td>', 'I can really feel this photo, reminds me of nights in cabins when travelling in the highlands of Iceland  at winter.', '2004-11-12 17:23:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008326, 119434, 9821, '<td valign="top">This is a stunning shot ... great job ... 10</td>', 'This is a stunning shot ... great job ... 10', '2004-11-12 17:35:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008327, 119332, 9821, '<td valign="top">10</td>', '10', '2004-11-12 17:35:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008329, 118958, 9821, '<td valign="top">silky smooth ... 10</td>', 'silky smooth ... 10', '2004-11-12 17:36:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008412, 119576, 2741, '<td valign="top">Wow.  LOL.  Does Chocolates Come with That???  Great Shot. 10.</td>', 'Wow.  LOL.  Does Chocolates Come with That???  Great Shot. 10.', '2004-11-12 18:22:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008415, 118939, 2741, '<td valign="top">Ho Ho Ho....  ;)   20.... oh... I cant give a 20.....   Nevermind... 10.</td>', 'Ho Ho Ho....  ;)   20.... oh... I cant give a 20.....   Nevermind... 10.', '2004-11-12 18:24:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008421, 119190, 2741, '<td valign="top">Simply Amazing. 10</td>', 'Simply Amazing. 10', '2004-11-12 18:27:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008429, 119491, 25742, '<td valign="top">for some reason I don''t like the white border. I have not suggestion as to what you should do instead. I''m braindead at the moment</td>', 'for some reason I don''t like the white border. I have not suggestion as to what you should do instead. I''m braindead at the moment', '2004-11-12 18:36:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008431, 119302, 25742, '<td valign="top">I don''t know if I could look at this for a whole month. Bit too depressing. Very nice photo tho</td>', 'I don''t know if I could look at this for a whole month. Bit too depressing. Very nice photo tho', '2004-11-12 18:38:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008436, 119576, 145, '<td valign="top">Maybe April &amp; May would be better months. ;)</td>', 'Maybe April & May would be better months. ;)', '2004-11-12 18:42:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008438, 118962, 25742, '<td valign="top">I''d be more optimistiic and title it 05 :)</td>', 'I''d be more optimistiic and title it 05 :)', '2004-11-12 18:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008441, 118971, 25742, '<td valign="top">you have a wicked sense of homour. :)<br/>There are springs and there is Spring.<br/>You could also have added twigs to the stems.</td>', 'you have a wicked sense of homour. :)There are springs and there is Spring.You could also have added twigs to the stems.', '2004-11-12 18:44:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008448, 118387, 20779, '<td valign="top">This a beautiful scene captured; I love the covered sidewalks and all that this time of year. I think the cars and man in the scene will keep this from scoring extremely high simply because it is a more spontaneous capture. I have no opinion of borders in general, but I would have to say that this one is too "much" in my opinion - and as a whole, DPC tends to vote borders down for some reason.</td>', 'This a beautiful scene captured; I love the covered sidewalks and all that this time of year. I think the cars and man in the scene will keep this from scoring extremely high simply because it is a more spontaneous capture. I have no opinion of borders in general, but I would have to say that this one is too "much" in my opinion - and as a whole, DPC tends to vote borders down for some reason.', '2004-11-12 18:49:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008450, 118675, 20779, '<td valign="top">I honestly don''t ususally care for any photo of a "statue", but this one has a great range of tones and textures, and you composed the shot extremely well. The tree and the head echo each other and it becomes an engaging picture suitable for a calendar.</td>', 'I honestly don''t ususally care for any photo of a "statue", but this one has a great range of tones and textures, and you composed the shot extremely well. The tree and the head echo each other and it becomes an engaging picture suitable for a calendar.', '2004-11-12 18:51:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008453, 118312, 20779, '<td valign="top">I swear I can feel and practically touch this lion; well done!!! Beautiful, perfect wild animal portrait.</td>', 'I swear I can feel and practically touch this lion; well done!!! Beautiful, perfect wild animal portrait.', '2004-11-12 18:52:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008454, 119434, 3087, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image. I love the detail in the feathers and the catchlight in the eye is perfect. Your choice of black background and desaturation really does make this feel quite seasonal though I don''t know why that should be so when they are white all year round. In any case, work it does. 8</td>', 'Beautiful image. I love the detail in the feathers and the catchlight in the eye is perfect. Your choice of black background and desaturation really does make this feel quite seasonal though I don''t know why that should be so when they are white all year round. In any case, work it does. 8', '2004-11-12 18:53:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008455, 119018, 6999, '<td valign="top">Despite that frame, which is actually only distracting for me when one remembers to consider it, i rather like this image. You''ve captured that high white sky feeling of autumn without resorting to the usual medley of burnt orange colours, yet indisputably this is an autumnal image. it has that sense of peace, of the beginnings of rest after the rush and hurry of the glory of summer. Very good work.</td>', 'Despite that frame, which is actually only distracting for me when one remembers to consider it, i rather like this image. You''ve captured that high white sky feeling of autumn without resorting to the usual medley of burnt orange colours, yet indisputably this is an autumnal image. it has that sense of peace, of the beginnings of rest after the rush and hurry of the glory of summer. Very good work.', '2004-11-12 18:54:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008456, 119395, 20779, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting and DOF used here. I also believe the border really adds to it by echoing the highlights in the picture.</td>', 'I like the lighting and DOF used here. I also believe the border really adds to it by echoing the highlights in the picture.', '2004-11-12 18:55:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008461, 118614, 20779, '<td valign="top">This is perfectly executed, but I don''t feel I would want to look at this continually. This looks more to me like a clean ad photo than an image designed just for enjoying. Just an opinion.</td>', 'This is perfectly executed, but I don''t feel I would want to look at this continually. This looks more to me like a clean ad photo than an image designed just for enjoying. Just an opinion.', '2004-11-12 18:57:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008463, 118420, 6999, '<td valign="top">The very irreality of this makes it a strong shot - the unlikeliness. I''m not a huge fan of it, Iwould have changed a number of things, mostly the dirtiness and graininess of the background, but I can see absolutely where you''re coming from and what you have achieved. I''m certain you''ll be knocked by the unthinking for that vase/shadow, although it is essential to my eye, and for the non-blatant calendar reference. I hope it finds it''s audience, it deserves to have fans, this shot. 7</td>', 'The very irreality of this makes it a strong shot - the unlikeliness. I''m not a huge fan of it, Iwould have changed a number of things, mostly the dirtiness and graininess of the background, but I can see absolutely where you''re coming from and what you have achieved. I''m certain you''ll be knocked by the unthinking for that vase/shadow, although it is essential to my eye, and for the non-blatant calendar reference. I hope it finds it''s audience, it deserves to have fans, this shot. 7', '2004-11-12 18:58:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008464, 119484, 20779, '<td valign="top">Terrific Fall colors. It appears to be more of a snapshot, though, than a landscape you would feature in a calendar. As a suggestion, perhaps if it were cropped to highlight more of the vibrant colors to the left? The large, dark tree on the right is a bit overbearing in my opinion.</td>', 'Terrific Fall colors. It appears to be more of a snapshot, though, than a landscape you would feature in a calendar. As a suggestion, perhaps if it were cropped to highlight more of the vibrant colors to the left? The large, dark tree on the right is a bit overbearing in my opinion.', '2004-11-12 19:00:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008469, 119341, 3087, '<td valign="top">Wonderful colours here. Is it lichen covering that mountain? I love the sense of scale and vibrancy of colour as well as the cloudy sky. That said the sky is a touch too white for my preferences. Still one of my favourite entries. 8</td>', 'Wonderful colours here. Is it lichen covering that mountain? I love the sense of scale and vibrancy of colour as well as the cloudy sky. That said the sky is a touch too white for my preferences. Still one of my favourite entries. 8', '2004-11-12 19:02:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008470, 119250, 20779, '<td valign="top">Excellent wildlife photo! For a literal calendar shot, not sure that this is what I would want for a month due to the overall gray tones, but that is just a personal taste and not part of my scoring on this.</td>', 'Excellent wildlife photo! For a literal calendar shot, not sure that this is what I would want for a month due to the overall gray tones, but that is just a personal taste and not part of my scoring on this.', '2004-11-12 19:03:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008472, 118525, 3087, '<td valign="top">Far and away my favourite entry in this challenge. I love the lighting, the grainy texture, the toning and the clean background. Only thing I''m not keen on is choice of border. Beautiful, elegant, simple image.</td>', 'Far and away my favourite entry in this challenge. I love the lighting, the grainy texture, the toning and the clean background. Only thing I''m not keen on is choice of border. Beautiful, elegant, simple image.', '2004-11-12 19:03:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008473, 119337, 3087, '<td valign="top">I LOVE shallow DOF when used for a reason and I love it in this shot. Beautiful composition, wonderful colours. One of my favourite entries! 9</td>', 'I LOVE shallow DOF when used for a reason and I love it in this shot. Beautiful composition, wonderful colours. One of my favourite entries! 9', '2004-11-12 19:04:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008475, 119304, 20779, '<td valign="top">Very effective holiday still; you got the ribbons so perfect! I think for my own personal taste, I would prefer a different background color to let the reds in the balls stand out on their own - but only an opinion.</td>', 'Very effective holiday still; you got the ribbons so perfect! I think for my own personal taste, I would prefer a different background color to let the reds in the balls stand out on their own - but only an opinion.', '2004-11-12 19:04:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008476, 118895, 6999, '<td valign="top">To me, this seems like the photographic equivalent of a sketched idea for a shot - ''how about we set this thing up, you know, gloved hands, bowl of soup'' kind of thing. Your execution leaves an awful lot to be desired, I''m afriad. The questions it throws up for me: the colour structure of it - black gloves, muted purple fleece, red cup? Was there no more coherent structure you could have found? The lighting - simple on-board flash is soblunt, so head-on, leaves those strong and ugly shadows, and doesn''t have the angle or the softness to add grace to the scene. The composition and the set-up: was it really better to have gloved hands anyway? Was a completely symmetrical composition so very effective - would it perhaps not have been more effective to show more of the person? Did the contents of the bowl have to be quite so ugly-looking - and certainly not warming in appearnace? wouldn''t captureing the steam coming off that bowl have given a greater sensation of coldness in the air than is implied simply by gloved hands? <br/> <br/>I appreciate that this is a ''real'' scene - but photography of the ''real'' is not necessarily a matter of simply finding a moment that is so blatantly representative and shooting it any old how.</td>', 'To me, this seems like the photographic equivalent of a sketched idea for a shot - ''how about we set this thing up, you know, gloved hands, bowl of soup'' kind of thing. Your execution leaves an awful lot to be desired, I''m afriad. The questions it throws up for me: the colour structure of it - black gloves, muted purple fleece, red cup? Was there no more coherent structure you could have found? The lighting - simple on-board flash is soblunt, so head-on, leaves those strong and ugly shadows, and doesn''t have the angle or the softness to add grace to the scene. The composition and the set-up: was it really better to have gloved hands anyway? Was a completely symmetrical composition so very effective - would it perhaps not have been more effective to show more of the person? Did the contents of the bowl have to be quite so ugly-looking - and certainly not warming in appearnace? wouldn''t captureing the steam coming off that bowl have given a greater sensation of coldness in the air than is implied simply by gloved hands?  I appreciate that this is a ''real'' scene - but photography of the ''real'' is not necessarily a matter of simply finding a moment that is so blatantly representative and shooting it any old how.', '2004-11-12 19:05:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008477, 118380, 3087, '<td valign="top">Beautifully chosen viewpoint - I like the sense of scale between the house and the cathedral behind it. The autumn foliage and the golden light work well to show season. The diagonal line of the weir creates a great lead in to the rest of the image. 8</td>', 'Beautifully chosen viewpoint - I like the sense of scale between the house and the cathedral behind it. The autumn foliage and the golden light work well to show season. The diagonal line of the weir creates a great lead in to the rest of the image. 8', '2004-11-12 19:05:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008479, 119436, 20779, '<td valign="top">Wonderful, nostalgic take for August vacation season!! One of my favorites and very unique. I see some "grain" which I think you kept/added intentionally and really makes the shot. If you didn''t, then I''d say it was good that you didn''t "remove" it.</td>', 'Wonderful, nostalgic take for August vacation season!! One of my favorites and very unique. I see some "grain" which I think you kept/added intentionally and really makes the shot. If you didn''t, then I''d say it was good that you didn''t "remove" it.', '2004-11-12 19:06:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008480, 119304, 3087, '<td valign="top">Lovely use of colour. The bold background works surprisingly well with the bold stripes of the baubles. The gold ribbon adds a nice element of randomness to the overall shape. 8</td>', 'Lovely use of colour. The bold background works surprisingly well with the bold stripes of the baubles. The gold ribbon adds a nice element of randomness to the overall shape. 8', '2004-11-12 19:07:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008481, 119377, 3087, '<td valign="top">Colours of the leaves and berries really work well to suggest a season. Nice choice of black background and pleasing composition. Not keen on border. 8</td>', 'Colours of the leaves and berries really work well to suggest a season. Nice choice of black background and pleasing composition. Not keen on border. 8', '2004-11-12 19:08:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008482, 119285, 3087, '<td valign="top">What lovely texture and light. Nice use of curves to create fluidity in the composition. 8</td>', 'What lovely texture and light. Nice use of curves to create fluidity in the composition. 8', '2004-11-12 19:09:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008484, 119437, 3087, '<td valign="top">Absolutely love the inclusion of the animals in this image - it grounds it yet in a very quirky way, 8</td>', 'Absolutely love the inclusion of the animals in this image - it grounds it yet in a very quirky way, 8', '2004-11-12 19:11:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008486, 118974, 20779, '<td valign="top">I love the leaves all gathered around the train - terrific find. The red tones seem to have grabbed some areas too strongly or in splotches that I personally find distracting and really hurting the photgraph.  Just an opinion.</td>', 'I love the leaves all gathered around the train - terrific find. The red tones seem to have grabbed some areas too strongly or in splotches that I personally find distracting and really hurting the photgraph.  Just an opinion.', '2004-11-12 19:12:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008487, 118859, 20779, '<td valign="top">Very cute and original idea! It appears just a tad out of focus, but otherwise wouldn''t change a thing.</td>', 'Very cute and original idea! It appears just a tad out of focus, but otherwise wouldn''t change a thing.', '2004-11-12 19:13:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008488, 119336, 3087, '<td valign="top">Perfect! The way that the most obvious falling leaf is highlighted against the black area of the background (and hence stands out clearly) is excellent. The dog is beautifully captured - nice eye detail and catchlight, nice pose. Overall composition works very well. Colours of leaves against almost monotone dog also works well. An absolute gem of an image! 9</td>', 'Perfect! The way that the most obvious falling leaf is highlighted against the black area of the background (and hence stands out clearly) is excellent. The dog is beautifully captured - nice eye detail and catchlight, nice pose. Overall composition works very well. Colours of leaves against almost monotone dog also works well. An absolute gem of an image! 9', '2004-11-12 19:13:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008490, 118691, 20779, '<td valign="top">What a great capture!! In a perfect world, I wish the background fence could be a different color or shade to do the birds justice. The image is either a bit out of focus or a little too much NeatImage for my personal taste, but I can''t say obviously. I am just trying to describe how it is appearing to me.</td>', 'What a great capture!! In a perfect world, I wish the background fence could be a different color or shade to do the birds justice. The image is either a bit out of focus or a little too much NeatImage for my personal taste, but I can''t say obviously. I am just trying to describe how it is appearing to me.', '2004-11-12 19:15:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008493, 119190, 24494, '<td valign="top">very powerful image here i''ve seen this before but never had my camera with me 9</td>', 'very powerful image here i''ve seen this before but never had my camera with me 9', '2004-11-12 19:17:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008495, 118472, 24494, '<td valign="top">this looks like a cartoon what did you do to the sky i like this alot but this could be DQed 8</td>', 'this looks like a cartoon what did you do to the sky i like this alot but this could be DQed 8', '2004-11-12 19:19:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008497, 119569, 24494, '<td valign="top">how are there so many pictures or this and i have never seen one? 8</td>', 'how are there so many pictures or this and i have never seen one? 8', '2004-11-12 19:20:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008503, 119107, 20779, '<td valign="top">You have a done a wonderful job in editing this; the tones and the glow are beautiful. I personally don''t feel this looks like a calendar - the woman''s portrait appears more personal to me.</td>', 'You have a done a wonderful job in editing this; the tones and the glow are beautiful. I personally don''t feel this looks like a calendar - the woman''s portrait appears more personal to me.', '2004-11-12 19:24:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008506, 119368, 20779, '<td valign="top">There is just not enough of a focal point of interest in the composition in my opinion. I think if you took this idea, though, and worked on the arrangement a bit, you may really get a great collage piece. The white balance also appears a little off on my monitor, giving it a blue cast througout.</td>', 'There is just not enough of a focal point of interest in the composition in my opinion. I think if you took this idea, though, and worked on the arrangement a bit, you may really get a great collage piece. The white balance also appears a little off on my monitor, giving it a blue cast througout.', '2004-11-12 19:27:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008507, 119060, 20779, '<td valign="top">I tried for an hour to get some good pelican shots in Huntington Beach last month - congrats on doing it! As a calendar shot, I don''t think it entirely works for me - but just an opinion. The colors, while perfectly true, are not very interesting or pleasing and the birds were caught at a somewhat awkward moment for that purpose.</td>', 'I tried for an hour to get some good pelican shots in Huntington Beach last month - congrats on doing it! As a calendar shot, I don''t think it entirely works for me - but just an opinion. The colors, while perfectly true, are not very interesting or pleasing and the birds were caught at a somewhat awkward moment for that purpose.', '2004-11-12 19:30:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008508, 119219, 20779, '<td valign="top">The de-sat and the colors remaining are too harsh for my taste. I think de-sat works best on just one or two main focal points in an image. It is a great reminder of summer days, but appears a bit like a snapshot or too busy to be in a calendar. All this simply an opinion.</td>', 'The de-sat and the colors remaining are too harsh for my taste. I think de-sat works best on just one or two main focal points in an image. It is a great reminder of summer days, but appears a bit like a snapshot or too busy to be in a calendar. All this simply an opinion.', '2004-11-12 19:32:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008509, 119440, 20779, '<td valign="top">Perfect clarity and alignment. For my tastes, the crop is a bit tight and centered. On a completely personal level, the subject matter is "boring", but certainly wouldn''t be to a jet enthusiast and their calendars!</td>', 'Perfect clarity and alignment. For my tastes, the crop is a bit tight and centered. On a completely personal level, the subject matter is "boring", but certainly wouldn''t be to a jet enthusiast and their calendars!', '2004-11-12 19:34:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008514, 118939, 20779, '<td valign="top">Terrific shot and lighting. You captured the model looking very relaxed and happy. As just a personal opinion, I think it would look more engaging to have just her upper back and face. The long perspective on the torso is almost distracting to me.</td>', 'Terrific shot and lighting. You captured the model looking very relaxed and happy. As just a personal opinion, I think it would look more engaging to have just her upper back and face. The long perspective on the torso is almost distracting to me.', '2004-11-12 19:36:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008517, 118720, 20779, '<td valign="top">Beautiful landscape. It seems to lack a real focal point for me, while the twigs in the center front are a bit of a distraction.</td>', 'Beautiful landscape. It seems to lack a real focal point for me, while the twigs in the center front are a bit of a distraction.', '2004-11-12 19:38:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008525, 119397, 20779, '<td valign="top">I think the image would be near perfect except two nit-piks: the constrast is just one tad too much in my opinion, making it appear over-sharpened,  and the windmill looks like it is growing out of the tree.</td>', 'I think the image would be near perfect except two nit-piks: the constrast is just one tad too much in my opinion, making it appear over-sharpened,  and the windmill looks like it is growing out of the tree.', '2004-11-12 19:46:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008526, 119341, 20779, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous. I am not a border hater, but this one is out of place in my opinion.</td>', 'Gorgeous. I am not a border hater, but this one is out of place in my opinion.', '2004-11-12 19:47:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008527, 119018, 20779, '<td valign="top">I have no feelings about borders in general, but in this case, I think the border is ruining a perfect image in all other ways.</td>', 'I have no feelings about borders in general, but in this case, I think the border is ruining a perfect image in all other ways.', '2004-11-12 19:48:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008528, 118094, 20779, '<td valign="top">DOF and focus are too far in this I feel. The background nosie is a bit distracting also.</td>', 'DOF and focus are too far in this I feel. The background nosie is a bit distracting also.', '2004-11-12 19:50:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008531, 119337, 20779, '<td valign="top">I am really torn on this shot. The huge difference in focus is unsettling to me one moment, and a bit intriguing the next. I am quite familair with shallow DOF for this type of shot, but in this case it just really jumps out with no gradual inbetween.</td>', 'I am really torn on this shot. The huge difference in focus is unsettling to me one moment, and a bit intriguing the next. I am quite familair with shallow DOF for this type of shot, but in this case it just really jumps out with no gradual inbetween.', '2004-11-12 19:53:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008537, 119299, 20779, '<td valign="top">I really enjoy this type of scene and think it is perfect calendar material. The only thing bothering me in this shot is a lack of a focal point to rest on. It should be the boat, but it is too light and small in comparison to anchor itself and almost appears floating from my perspective. Focus is a tad soft and the lighting has a bit of a gray cast on my monitor.</td>', 'I really enjoy this type of scene and think it is perfect calendar material. The only thing bothering me in this shot is a lack of a focal point to rest on. It should be the boat, but it is too light and small in comparison to anchor itself and almost appears floating from my perspective. Focus is a tad soft and the lighting has a bit of a gray cast on my monitor.', '2004-11-12 19:56:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008539, 118605, 20779, '<td valign="top">What beautiful lighting in a night shot!! The lights strung overhead and the motion blur of the walkers are distracting for me.</td>', 'What beautiful lighting in a night shot!! The lights strung overhead and the motion blur of the walkers are distracting for me.', '2004-11-12 19:58:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008541, 119396, 20779, '<td valign="top">Just beatiful to look at, but not of lasting interest in my opinion. If there were a bird or something on the water to add a focal point of some sort, I think it would be a terrific calendar piece. I know you can''t control the environment; just giving my opinion on the overall resulting image.</td>', 'Just beatiful to look at, but not of lasting interest in my opinion. If there were a bird or something on the water to add a focal point of some sort, I think it would be a terrific calendar piece. I know you can''t control the environment; just giving my opinion on the overall resulting image.', '2004-11-12 20:00:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008542, 118698, 20779, '<td valign="top">The eggs and compostion are just perfect; the purple artifacts and noise ruin an otherwise wonderful take.</td>', 'The eggs and compostion are just perfect; the purple artifacts and noise ruin an otherwise wonderful take.', '2004-11-12 20:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008543, 118959, 20779, '<td valign="top">Great focus on the flowers. The compostion is a bit static in my opinion and the gray background just too flat to bring out the flowers.</td>', 'Great focus on the flowers. The compostion is a bit static in my opinion and the gray background just too flat to bring out the flowers.', '2004-11-12 20:03:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008546, 118341, 20779, '<td valign="top">Wonderful job in lighting and set up. I think I would have preferred just the baby and cropped off the right side with the stuffed animal, or brought the animal closer into the frame with the baby. They appear too disconnected to me. Great touch with the cotton!!</td>', 'Wonderful job in lighting and set up. I think I would have preferred just the baby and cropped off the right side with the stuffed animal, or brought the animal closer into the frame with the baby. They appear too disconnected to me. Great touch with the cotton!!', '2004-11-12 20:05:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008549, 117726, 20779, '<td valign="top">Too blurry, but not obvious speed blur, to be effective in my opinion. Also has a snapshot feel to it that I don''t think would be as suitable to a calendar. I think I might have tried to get back a little further and get more of a feel of the "race". All just an opinion.</td>', 'Too blurry, but not obvious speed blur, to be effective in my opinion. Also has a snapshot feel to it that I don''t think would be as suitable to a calendar. I think I might have tried to get back a little further and get more of a feel of the "race". All just an opinion.', '2004-11-12 20:07:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008553, 119287, 20779, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, simple, classic. The only nit-piks on my part:  the noise/blotches and perhaps a more festive background color.</td>', 'Beautiful, simple, classic. The only nit-piks on my part:  the noise/blotches and perhaps a more festive background color.', '2004-11-12 20:09:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008557, 118626, 20779, '<td valign="top">Very nice photo, but overall has a snapshot feel to me. The two nit-piks are the men walking up and the heavy cloud that appears to be sitting on top of the highest tower point. Color, focus and compositon are all excellent.</td>', 'Very nice photo, but overall has a snapshot feel to me. The two nit-piks are the men walking up and the heavy cloud that appears to be sitting on top of the highest tower point. Color, focus and compositon are all excellent.', '2004-11-12 20:18:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008560, 118324, 20779, '<td valign="top">This appears to me as more of a family snapshot of a very cute dog, but just an opinion. I think the dog might stand out more crisply with a different, more festively colored background. I think that for this type of portrait, foucs needs to be sharp.</td>', 'This appears to me as more of a family snapshot of a very cute dog, but just an opinion. I think the dog might stand out more crisply with a different, more festively colored background. I think that for this type of portrait, foucs needs to be sharp.', '2004-11-12 20:20:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008563, 117914, 20779, '<td valign="top">Clever idea. I think your socre will suffer from the small resizing, soft focus and grayed colors, though.</td>', 'Clever idea. I think your socre will suffer from the small resizing, soft focus and grayed colors, though.', '2004-11-12 20:22:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008565, 119330, 20779, '<td valign="top">Cute prop and you got the lighting very well. I think that your score will suffer from it being a shot of a decoration and the background seams being readily apparent. I think if you used a colorful background a lot of this might be overcome.</td>', 'Cute prop and you got the lighting very well. I think that your score will suffer from it being a shot of a decoration and the background seams being readily apparent. I think if you used a colorful background a lot of this might be overcome.', '2004-11-12 20:23:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008598, 118043, 8860, '<td valign="top">Very good shot and excellent impression of that kind of weather, but I doubt you''ll find one in Blighty (unless Global Warming really kicks in sooner than later). Excellent tones and compo, but I feel that just ducking to the left and a touch lower would have left the bandstand clear of the tree.</td>', 'Very good shot and excellent impression of that kind of weather, but I doubt you''ll find one in Blighty (unless Global Warming really kicks in sooner than later). Excellent tones and compo, but I feel that just ducking to the left and a touch lower would have left the bandstand clear of the tree.', '2004-11-12 20:52:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008600, 117726, 8860, '<td valign="top">Great focus on the picket fence in the background. : )<br/> <br/>Nice subject but this really needs perfection to carry it off and the key subjkect is not in focus. Background is too busy and shot seems to be too much of a snapshot than a carefully composed photo for a calendar.</td>', 'Great focus on the picket fence in the background. : ) Nice subject but this really needs perfection to carry it off and the key subjkect is not in focus. Background is too busy and shot seems to be too much of a snapshot than a carefully composed photo for a calendar.', '2004-11-12 20:54:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008608, 119155, 19952, '<td valign="top">This is one of the best fire shots I''ve ever seen. The color and contraast are perfect. Really great job.</td>', 'This is one of the best fire shots I''ve ever seen. The color and contraast are perfect. Really great job.', '2004-11-12 21:04:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008609, 119304, 19952, '<td valign="top">I love the color and simplicity in this shot. I think a slightly tighter crop might improve the composition a bit, but that''s being picky - this is a really outstanding photo that works perfectly for this challenge. Great job.</td>', 'I love the color and simplicity in this shot. I think a slightly tighter crop might improve the composition a bit, but that''s being picky - this is a really outstanding photo that works perfectly for this challenge. Great job.', '2004-11-12 21:05:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008610, 119179, 19952, '<td valign="top">The color and composition in this shot are just outstanding. This photo really does belong in a calendar. Great job.</td>', 'The color and composition in this shot are just outstanding. This photo really does belong in a calendar. Great job.', '2004-11-12 21:07:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008611, 119519, 19952, '<td valign="top">Really amazing color and perfect composition. Beautiful shot.</td>', 'Really amazing color and perfect composition. Beautiful shot.', '2004-11-12 21:09:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008613, 119220, 29009, '<td valign="top">I recently saw a photograph on display at an art fair selling for $65 (too steep for me) that wasn''t nearly as well done.  I especially like the way the overall shape leads the eye from left to right.  I gave you a 10 and never wavered on it.</td>', 'I recently saw a photograph on display at an art fair selling for $65 (too steep for me) that wasn''t nearly as well done.  I especially like the way the overall shape leads the eye from left to right.  I gave you a 10 and never wavered on it.', '2004-11-12 21:11:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008616, 119519, 29009, '<td valign="top">Very powerful - the colors are excellent, the focus is superb.  I gave you a 10!</td>', 'Very powerful - the colors are excellent, the focus is superb.  I gave you a 10!', '2004-11-12 21:12:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008617, 119453, 19952, '<td valign="top">You came up with a creative take on the challenge and the shot came out beautifully. Really outstanding job.</td>', 'You came up with a creative take on the challenge and the shot came out beautifully. Really outstanding job.', '2004-11-12 21:14:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008618, 118857, 29009, '<td valign="top">I found myself returning to this image again and again.  I love the deep color of the subject, and the shallow DOF really made the focal point pop.  I gave you a 10!</td>', 'I found myself returning to this image again and again.  I love the deep color of the subject, and the shallow DOF really made the focal point pop.  I gave you a 10!', '2004-11-12 21:15:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008619, 119434, 29009, '<td valign="top">Great shot!  I especially like the graceful curve of the neck.  I gave you a 10.</td>', 'Great shot!  I especially like the graceful curve of the neck.  I gave you a 10.', '2004-11-12 21:16:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008620, 118370, 19952, '<td valign="top">This is an outstanding portrait and the composition is absolutely beautiful. Her dress might be a bit too bright, but other than that the lighting works well. Really nice job.</td>', 'This is an outstanding portrait and the composition is absolutely beautiful. Her dress might be a bit too bright, but other than that the lighting works well. Really nice job.', '2004-11-12 21:17:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008621, 119332, 29009, '<td valign="top">I love this shot!  Very creative and patient to wait for just the right pose.  Colors are awesome.  I''d definitely look at this all month and smile every time.  I gave you a 10.</td>', 'I love this shot!  Very creative and patient to wait for just the right pose.  Colors are awesome.  I''d definitely look at this all month and smile every time.  I gave you a 10.', '2004-11-12 21:17:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008623, 119399, 29009, '<td valign="top">Excellent use of foreground - awesome color - I gave you a 10!  Nice work.</td>', 'Excellent use of foreground - awesome color - I gave you a 10!  Nice work.', '2004-11-12 21:17:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008626, 118778, 29009, '<td valign="top">What I liked best about this shot is the use of the building for reflection. The composition really works well for you, as it looks like the architecture is incidental and barely interrupts the sky.  I gave this a 10!</td>', 'What I liked best about this shot is the use of the building for reflection. The composition really works well for you, as it looks like the architecture is incidental and barely interrupts the sky.  I gave this a 10!', '2004-11-12 21:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008627, 118813, 19952, '<td valign="top">This is one of the best aurora shots I''ve ever seen. The colors turned out great and your composition works very nicely. Really great job.</td>', 'This is one of the best aurora shots I''ve ever seen. The colors turned out great and your composition works very nicely. Really great job.', '2004-11-12 21:19:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008630, 119356, 29009, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition!  This one just grabbed me....</td>', 'Excellent composition!  This one just grabbed me....', '2004-11-12 21:20:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008634, 118335, 29009, '<td valign="top">I loved the color in this shot.  The huge expanse of sky makes even the mountains look surmountable - gives an overall feeling of hope and tranquility.  Nice job!</td>', 'I loved the color in this shot.  The huge expanse of sky makes even the mountains look surmountable - gives an overall feeling of hope and tranquility.  Nice job!', '2004-11-12 21:21:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008636, 119582, 19952, '<td valign="top">This is an outstanding portrait and the subdued lighting works really well. There''s something kind of odd about here head - it looks almost flat like a poster flush against a wall. Maybe it''s the angle and perspective of the shot, so I guess tilting her head down a bit might help with that effect. But overall, this is a really beautiful shot - great job.</td>', 'This is an outstanding portrait and the subdued lighting works really well. There''s something kind of odd about here head - it looks almost flat like a poster flush against a wall. Maybe it''s the angle and perspective of the shot, so I guess tilting her head down a bit might help with that effect. But overall, this is a really beautiful shot - great job.', '2004-11-12 21:22:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008637, 119526, 29009, '<td valign="top">I loved the colors in this shot, and the dichotomy of sand vs. snow.  Excellent composition.  My one small suggestion might have been to include an element in the foreground.  Overall, this is wonderful.</td>', 'I loved the colors in this shot, and the dichotomy of sand vs. snow.  Excellent composition.  My one small suggestion might have been to include an element in the foreground.  Overall, this is wonderful.', '2004-11-12 21:23:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008642, 119080, 29009, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition, good subject matter fitting with the month you chose.  Lighting is good - giving depth to the glove. (9)</td>', 'Excellent composition, good subject matter fitting with the month you chose.  Lighting is good - giving depth to the glove. (9)', '2004-11-12 21:26:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008643, 119520, 29009, '<td valign="top">Simple and effective.  Clean idea, well executed.  (9)</td>', 'Simple and effective.  Clean idea, well executed.  (9)', '2004-11-12 21:27:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008644, 118043, 19952, '<td valign="top">It''s so cool that you were able to find an excellent subject like this that fits the challenge so perfectly. And your shot came out great. The B&amp;W works really well to accentuate the shape of the tree. Great job.</td>', 'It''s so cool that you were able to find an excellent subject like this that fits the challenge so perfectly. And your shot came out great. The B&W works really well to accentuate the shape of the tree. Great job.', '2004-11-12 21:27:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008645, 119336, 29009, '<td valign="top">I thought this was great!  You''ve really captured the fascination of the dog with the leaf, while not cluttering the shot with the background.  (9)</td>', 'I thought this was great!  You''ve really captured the fascination of the dog with the leaf, while not cluttering the shot with the background.  (9)', '2004-11-12 21:28:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008646, 119387, 19952, '<td valign="top">This is a really beautiful shot and I love that it looks so natural, like it came straight out of the camera. Great job.</td>', 'This is a really beautiful shot and I love that it looks so natural, like it came straight out of the camera. Great job.', '2004-11-12 21:28:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008648, 117977, 29009, '<td valign="top">Composition was excellent, color and lighting done well.  I can tell you spent time planning - well executed.  (9)</td>', 'Composition was excellent, color and lighting done well.  I can tell you spent time planning - well executed.  (9)', '2004-11-12 21:29:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008650, 119060, 29009, '<td valign="top">Wow!  You''ve captured motion without blur...shot has visual interest and leaves me wondering if they got the fish.  Well done!  (9)</td>', 'Wow!  You''ve captured motion without blur...shot has visual interest and leaves me wondering if they got the fish.  Well done!  (9)', '2004-11-12 21:30:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008651, 119286, 29009, '<td valign="top">Creative use of border - feels like a painting.  I like the sense of light you''ve shown here.  Good use of foreground elements. (9)</td>', 'Creative use of border - feels like a painting.  I like the sense of light you''ve shown here.  Good use of foreground elements. (9)', '2004-11-12 21:31:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008652, 119079, 29009, '<td valign="top">Clean, simple, elegant.  Great composition.... (9)</td>', 'Clean, simple, elegant.  Great composition.... (9)', '2004-11-12 21:32:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008653, 119577, 29009, '<td valign="top">I like the way you have used foreground elements and lighting to draw the eye to the majesty of your location.  Nice work!  (9)</td>', 'I like the way you have used foreground elements and lighting to draw the eye to the majesty of your location.  Nice work!  (9)', '2004-11-12 21:33:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008655, 118682, 29009, '<td valign="top">I liked the way you used light and composition to suggest a mood and time of day.  Nice job!  (9)</td>', 'I liked the way you used light and composition to suggest a mood and time of day.  Nice job!  (9)', '2004-11-12 21:34:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008656, 118698, 29009, '<td valign="top">Nice use of curves, clean lines, simple yet effective.  Lighting was excellent, as was composition.  (9)</td>', 'Nice use of curves, clean lines, simple yet effective.  Lighting was excellent, as was composition.  (9)', '2004-11-12 21:35:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008657, 117888, 29009, '<td valign="top">Well done!  A starburst lens/filter might have made this shot even more powerful.  I really liked this a lot, especially the rays coming down from the clouds.</td>', 'Well done!  A starburst lens/filter might have made this shot even more powerful.  I really liked this a lot, especially the rays coming down from the clouds.', '2004-11-12 21:36:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008660, 119333, 29009, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition!  I love the curves and use of foreground elements. (9)</td>', 'Excellent composition!  I love the curves and use of foreground elements. (9)', '2004-11-12 21:37:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008662, 118691, 29009, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition!  What I liked best was the one bird squawking at the other one - it made me smile.  I really enjoyed this entry.  (9)</td>', 'Excellent composition!  What I liked best was the one bird squawking at the other one - it made me smile.  I really enjoyed this entry.  (9)', '2004-11-12 21:38:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008666, 119181, 29009, '<td valign="top">There is so much about this shot that is "just fight."  The lighting, the fact that it doesn''t look posed, the feeling of intimacy.  Well done!</td>', 'There is so much about this shot that is "just fight."  The lighting, the fact that it doesn''t look posed, the feeling of intimacy.  Well done!', '2004-11-12 21:42:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008669, 119521, 29009, '<td valign="top">I really liked the way you used curves here.  Colors really pop!  Well done.</td>', 'I really liked the way you used curves here.  Colors really pop!  Well done.', '2004-11-12 21:44:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008672, 119397, 29009, '<td valign="top">I liked the way you used the fence as a foreground element.  Another option for composition might have been to change the angle a bit to separate the windmill from the tree, and eliminate the tall pole that is currently just left of center.  Black and white was a good choice.</td>', 'I liked the way you used the fence as a foreground element.  Another option for composition might have been to change the angle a bit to separate the windmill from the tree, and eliminate the tall pole that is currently just left of center.  Black and white was a good choice.', '2004-11-12 21:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008675, 118944, 29009, '<td valign="top">You''ve done a very nice job capturing the fluffiness of the clouds.  Another option for composition might have been to zoom in a bit and use the lighthouse for framing, or instead to eliminate the lighthouse and choose a different foreground element.  The colors were good, and the line of the horizon is also good.</td>', 'You''ve done a very nice job capturing the fluffiness of the clouds.  Another option for composition might have been to zoom in a bit and use the lighthouse for framing, or instead to eliminate the lighthouse and choose a different foreground element.  The colors were good, and the line of the horizon is also good.', '2004-11-12 21:50:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008677, 118990, 17890, '<td valign="top">IMO this is the best of the best, i could look at this photo 12 months of the year! (10)</td>', 'IMO this is the best of the best, i could look at this photo 12 months of the year! (10)', '2004-11-12 21:53:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008679, 119572, 29009, '<td valign="top">It''s clear you were thinking about composition with the way the surf line comes into the frame and follows a straight  line.  If you had attempted to triangulate the tree line and the surf line to point to the sky you might also have been pleased.  Including the people for scale was a good idea.</td>', 'It''s clear you were thinking about composition with the way the surf line comes into the frame and follows a straight  line.  If you had attempted to triangulate the tree line and the surf line to point to the sky you might also have been pleased.  Including the people for scale was a good idea.', '2004-11-12 21:55:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008696, 119524, 29009, '<td valign="top">Good color, good composition.  A minor matter is the flash of light in the upper left-hand corner and the spot of blue on the fern in the lower right-hand side.  Overall, this is a strong photograph that represents your month well.  I enjoyed your entry.</td>', 'Good color, good composition.  A minor matter is the flash of light in the upper left-hand corner and the spot of blue on the fern in the lower right-hand side.  Overall, this is a strong photograph that represents your month well.  I enjoyed your entry.', '2004-11-12 22:08:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008700, 118556, 29009, '<td valign="top">Well composed - I like the way you set up the shot so that the overhanging branches lead the eye to the bend in road.</td>', 'Well composed - I like the way you set up the shot so that the overhanging branches lead the eye to the bend in road.', '2004-11-12 22:10:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008706, 118772, 29009, '<td valign="top">Mmmm - yummy.  I had to go make some of my own after seeing this!  Perhaps if you had used a different background (or different lighting) the popcorn would have stood out more and you would have been even more pleased with the result.  Clever title.</td>', 'Mmmm - yummy.  I had to go make some of my own after seeing this!  Perhaps if you had used a different background (or different lighting) the popcorn would have stood out more and you would have been even more pleased with the result.  Clever title.', '2004-11-12 22:14:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008711, 119541, 29009, '<td valign="top">Very drawn to this shot...nice isolation of the tree as a foreground element to balance the horizon line.</td>', 'Very drawn to this shot...nice isolation of the tree as a foreground element to balance the horizon line.', '2004-11-12 22:17:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008712, 119582, 29009, '<td valign="top">I can just see this hanging on my brother''s wall.  This is a great shot with nice color balance and overall feel.</td>', 'I can just see this hanging on my brother''s wall.  This is a great shot with nice color balance and overall feel.', '2004-11-12 22:18:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008778, 119453, 21621, '<td valign="top">This is a winner in my book, absolutely fantastic.</td>', 'This is a winner in my book, absolutely fantastic.', '2004-11-12 23:23:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008781, 119336, 21621, '<td valign="top">Great capture, nice work.</td>', 'Great capture, nice work.', '2004-11-12 23:25:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008784, 119333, 21621, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, a little dark, good work.</td>', 'Nice composition, a little dark, good work.', '2004-11-12 23:29:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008787, 118981, 12253, '<td valign="top">Nice scene, a bit painterly, and that''s good.  Some more foreground light would have been good though--especially on the building to the right, which looks to have a great roof.<br/> <br/>I struggled with this myself, but it seems to me calendar shots are always landscape (though I guess they could have borders left and right).  Not taking off though, just pointing out.  (Actually, I am going to try and go through and comment without actually voting...I am getting tired of "Scoring" images.)</td>', 'Nice scene, a bit painterly, and that''s good.  Some more foreground light would have been good though--especially on the building to the right, which looks to have a great roof. I struggled with this myself, but it seems to me calendar shots are always landscape (though I guess they could have borders left and right).  Not taking off though, just pointing out.  (Actually, I am going to try and go through and comment without actually voting...I am getting tired of "Scoring" images.)', '2004-11-12 23:30:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008788, 118675, 12253, '<td valign="top">Was trying to get the connection to October--then it hit, Halloween.  Wondering what this is.  Nice image.  For a calendar shot this works, but this might have more impact even closer, and with some perspective shift.</td>', 'Was trying to get the connection to October--then it hit, Halloween.  Wondering what this is.  Nice image.  For a calendar shot this works, but this might have more impact even closer, and with some perspective shift.', '2004-11-12 23:30:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008790, 118949, 12253, '<td valign="top">Nice shot--trees are very painterly here.  I hope you also grabbed a nice panoramic of those trees with that light.</td>', 'Nice shot--trees are very painterly here.  I hope you also grabbed a nice panoramic of those trees with that light.', '2004-11-12 23:31:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008791, 119572, 27847, '<td valign="top">Wow, very nice picture. I''d buy that calender! Nice 8 from me, however, it would have been higher, if you had removed the people. Great work.</td>', 'Wow, very nice picture. I''d buy that calender! Nice 8 from me, however, it would have been higher, if you had removed the people. Great work.', '2004-11-12 23:32:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008792, 119304, 21621, '<td valign="top">Good idea, very nice.</td>', 'Good idea, very nice.', '2004-11-12 23:32:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008795, 118335, 21621, '<td valign="top">Composition is great, foreground is a little dark, very nice work.</td>', 'Composition is great, foreground is a little dark, very nice work.', '2004-11-12 23:34:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008796, 119519, 21621, '<td valign="top">Fantastic color, might benefit from a tighter crop on the bottom, great work.</td>', 'Fantastic color, might benefit from a tighter crop on the bottom, great work.', '2004-11-12 23:37:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008797, 118781, 29009, '<td valign="top">I can tell you put a lot of thought into this.  Right now, the sheer number of drops is distracting overall.  I can see where you are going, but am not sure this particular shot is the best expression of your vision.</td>', 'I can tell you put a lot of thought into this.  Right now, the sheer number of drops is distracting overall.  I can see where you are going, but am not sure this particular shot is the best expression of your vision.', '2004-11-12 23:41:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008799, 119375, 12253, '<td valign="top">Very painterly.   I am not sure whether a filter was applied here or whether these are jpeg artifacts--but it works for you.  But what really makes the effect is the bright white flowers in the background.  I would have liked to see them a little bit more involved in the photo though.  One other small suggestion: I think it might have been nice to crop the bottom a little and go a bit more panoramic.  <br/> <br/>All in all, very nice calendar shot!</td>', 'Very painterly.   I am not sure whether a filter was applied here or whether these are jpeg artifacts--but it works for you.  But what really makes the effect is the bright white flowers in the background.  I would have liked to see them a little bit more involved in the photo though.  One other small suggestion: I think it might have been nice to crop the bottom a little and go a bit more panoramic.   All in all, very nice calendar shot!', '2004-11-12 23:45:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008802, 118479, 29009, '<td valign="top">Your idea to use selective saturation was a good one.   With the current contrast, the first thing my eye saw was the umbrella.  The little girl was much more interesting -- perhaps a softer shade of pink in the umbrella might have produced even more pleasing results.  DOF is great!</td>', 'Your idea to use selective saturation was a good one.   With the current contrast, the first thing my eye saw was the umbrella.  The little girl was much more interesting -- perhaps a softer shade of pink in the umbrella might have produced even more pleasing results.  DOF is great!', '2004-11-12 23:46:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008803, 119576, 27293, '<td valign="top">wow. I am extremely curious to see whether the ratings of this photo are going to form a proper bell curve =) My bet is - no, but i love it.</td>', 'wow. I am extremely curious to see whether the ratings of this photo are going to form a proper bell curve =) My bet is - no, but i love it.', '2004-11-12 23:47:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008804, 118312, 25464, '<td valign="top">I think I would have chosen August (Leo).  Great shot.  The only distraction I see is the crop.  The crop seems a little tight on the top.  Since the lion is known for the mane, I would have liked to see enough to frame the face.</td>', 'I think I would have chosen August (Leo).  Great shot.  The only distraction I see is the crop.  The crop seems a little tight on the top.  Since the lion is known for the mane, I would have liked to see enough to frame the face.', '2004-11-12 23:49:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008805, 119476, 25464, '<td valign="top">The shrub directly in front of the door from this angle is the only problem I see.  Otherwise, a very calendar- like shot.</td>', 'The shrub directly in front of the door from this angle is the only problem I see.  Otherwise, a very calendar- like shot.', '2004-11-12 23:50:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008806, 119219, 29009, '<td valign="top">I think that your idea to use selective saturation was a good one.  You''ve really managed to capture the emotion and excitement of the children wanting to go in the pool.  Perhaps if you had chosen to selectively saturate the water in the pool instead of (or in addition to) the bathing suits you might have been even more pleased with the results.</td>', 'I think that your idea to use selective saturation was a good one.  You''ve really managed to capture the emotion and excitement of the children wanting to go in the pool.  Perhaps if you had chosen to selectively saturate the water in the pool instead of (or in addition to) the bathing suits you might have been even more pleased with the results.', '2004-11-12 23:52:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008807, 119070, 25464, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors and interesting building.  I think a change in angle, if possible, would have pushed this one to the top for me.  The building seems a bit overwhelmed by the tree, and the tree a bit too centered.  When I look at this I wonder what a zoom on the clock tower with the edges of the fall tree in the frame might have looked like.</td>', 'Beautiful colors and interesting building.  I think a change in angle, if possible, would have pushed this one to the top for me.  The building seems a bit overwhelmed by the tree, and the tree a bit too centered.  When I look at this I wonder what a zoom on the clock tower with the edges of the fall tree in the frame might have looked like.', '2004-11-12 23:52:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008808, 118043, 21621, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, this is very well composed, although I would like to see the whole tree.</td>', 'Nice shot, this is very well composed, although I would like to see the whole tree.', '2004-11-12 23:52:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008812, 119050, 25464, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot, but I think it would have been even better if it had excluded the small rear portion of the house and power lines.  It might have looked a bit funny chopped off however.  Still good shot, great illustration of December.</td>', 'I really like this shot, but I think it would have been even better if it had excluded the small rear portion of the house and power lines.  It might have looked a bit funny chopped off however.  Still good shot, great illustration of December.', '2004-11-12 23:55:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008813, 119368, 29009, '<td valign="top">This would make a colorful calendar page!  My eye tends to wander around and enjoy all the separate images.  I''m wondering if you had chosen one to be a focal point if this would have been a stronger image overall.</td>', 'This would make a colorful calendar page!  My eye tends to wander around and enjoy all the separate images.  I''m wondering if you had chosen one to be a focal point if this would have been a stronger image overall.', '2004-11-12 23:55:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008814, 119374, 25464, '<td valign="top">Very calendarish.  Good job.</td>', 'Very calendarish.  Good job.', '2004-11-12 23:56:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008818, 118288, 21621, '<td valign="top">Nice shot for a jigsaw puzzle.</td>', 'Nice shot for a jigsaw puzzle.', '2004-11-12 23:57:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008819, 118607, 25464, '<td valign="top">The color seems a bit flat, but then that fits the month nicely considering the cloudy day. Bumping up to my top 10. 10.</td>', 'The color seems a bit flat, but then that fits the month nicely considering the cloudy day. Bumping up to my top 10. 10.', '2004-11-12 23:57:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008821, 119384, 21621, '<td valign="top">Nice sunset, focus could be better.</td>', 'Nice sunset, focus could be better.', '2004-11-13 00:01:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008824, 118472, 21621, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, but the editing has ruined the sky in my opinion, would like to see the original.</td>', 'Nice shot, but the editing has ruined the sky in my opinion, would like to see the original.', '2004-11-13 00:04:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008830, 119286, 21621, '<td valign="top">Great view, would lose the border, also a couple of the trees seem to have a "fake" look to them, compared to the rest of the image.  Good work.</td>', 'Great view, would lose the border, also a couple of the trees seem to have a "fake" look to them, compared to the rest of the image.  Good work.', '2004-11-13 00:11:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008832, 119104, 21621, '<td valign="top">Very nice, this image seems to have a "watercolor" look to it, which the border accentuates.  This style may not appeal to most, but your shot is among the top for me, good luck.</td>', 'Very nice, this image seems to have a "watercolor" look to it, which the border accentuates.  This style may not appeal to most, but your shot is among the top for me, good luck.', '2004-11-13 00:17:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008840, 119399, 21621, '<td valign="top">Super shot, great color, slightly noisy.</td>', 'Super shot, great color, slightly noisy.', '2004-11-13 00:25:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008887, 118792, 22384, '<td valign="top">I find the trees filling the frame with little else to create or evoke a mood lacking. The hint if the red car offers some possibilities.</td>', 'I find the trees filling the frame with little else to create or evoke a mood lacking. The hint if the red car offers some possibilities.', '2004-11-13 00:59:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008890, 119436, 22384, '<td valign="top">Nice variety of textures, but I am unsure of the theme or composition. The value range is also interesting.</td>', 'Nice variety of textures, but I am unsure of the theme or composition. The value range is also interesting.', '2004-11-13 01:00:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008892, 119333, 22384, '<td valign="top">Interesting study of contrast - color, light, and artistic/architecture styles. I feel that this picture works well. Nice job.</td>', 'Interesting study of contrast - color, light, and artistic/architecture styles. I feel that this picture works well. Nice job.', '2004-11-13 01:02:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008896, 119575, 22384, '<td valign="top">The composition of this picture creates  a negative tension. It reminds me of a child''s messy room. I am unsure of the intent of Donald lying down - too much candy, perhaps? The framing makes me uncomfortable. I am unsure of the intended focal point or what movement the artist is trying to create.</td>', 'The composition of this picture creates  a negative tension. It reminds me of a child''s messy room. I am unsure of the intent of Donald lying down - too much candy, perhaps? The framing makes me uncomfortable. I am unsure of the intended focal point or what movement the artist is trying to create.', '2004-11-13 01:06:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008899, 119397, 93, '<td valign="top">This photograph, to me, is far too "cool toned" for it''s connection to "August".  Looking at it, I feel a chill, and I had thought of a month like October, or March.. before August (I didn''t see the title first, which is why I''m commenting).<br/> <br/>A warmer tone, perhaps a duotone in the sepia/golden range, and you would have had a much higher score from me.</td>', 'This photograph, to me, is far too "cool toned" for it''s connection to "August".  Looking at it, I feel a chill, and I had thought of a month like October, or March.. before August (I didn''t see the title first, which is why I''m commenting). A warmer tone, perhaps a duotone in the sepia/golden range, and you would have had a much higher score from me.', '2004-11-13 01:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008900, 118043, 22384, '<td valign="top">Nice values. Other than the trees, especially the one in the foreground, everything else seems so still. Interesting contrast of all the strong vertical images and then the movement of the trees. It works nicely for me.</td>', 'Nice values. Other than the trees, especially the one in the foreground, everything else seems so still. Interesting contrast of all the strong vertical images and then the movement of the trees. It works nicely for me.', '2004-11-13 01:09:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008906, 119061, 93, '<td valign="top">While this is a fantastic piece of art..  I don''t feel it''s a great photo.</td>', 'While this is a fantastic piece of art..  I don''t feel it''s a great photo.', '2004-11-13 01:13:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008907, 119107, 22384, '<td valign="top">This image appeals to me, but I would like to see the subject looking the other way since it is for the month of April and I tend to think of spring months as getting ready for what lies ahead. Great hint of pinks/maroons in the skintone of your subject picking up the color of the fabric and the lips. The dappled light through the umbrella also hints of spring since is is muted and not shining with the intensity of summer. Beautiful photo.</td>', 'This image appeals to me, but I would like to see the subject looking the other way since it is for the month of April and I tend to think of spring months as getting ready for what lies ahead. Great hint of pinks/maroons in the skintone of your subject picking up the color of the fabric and the lips. The dappled light through the umbrella also hints of spring since is is muted and not shining with the intensity of summer. Beautiful photo.', '2004-11-13 01:13:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008911, 119243, 22384, '<td valign="top">I like the idea and the angle of this photo. I would like the main headstone to take up more of the frame - what an interesting name. I would like all the rest of the headstone engravings to be out of focus. The far background colors distract. I would crop them out. I like the grays and greens.</td>', 'I like the idea and the angle of this photo. I would like the main headstone to take up more of the frame - what an interesting name. I would like all the rest of the headstone engravings to be out of focus. The far background colors distract. I would crop them out. I like the grays and greens.', '2004-11-13 01:15:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008918, 118990, 22384, '<td valign="top">Stunning photo! I would desaturate the colors of the background; they distract from the main image. Everything else is perfect. The weathered wood and the muted colors of the bird are splendid. Very nice!</td>', 'Stunning photo! I would desaturate the colors of the background; they distract from the main image. Everything else is perfect. The weathered wood and the muted colors of the bird are splendid. Very nice!', '2004-11-13 01:21:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008920, 118043, 23478, '<td valign="top">A vey compelling figure, the B&amp;W works good for this. 7.</td>', 'A vey compelling figure, the B&W works good for this. 7.', '2004-11-13 01:23:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008921, 118859, 22384, '<td valign="top">Great idea and motif of the heart images. The framing with all the white space to one side does not work for me. I do like the concept and the colors.</td>', 'Great idea and motif of the heart images. The framing with all the white space to one side does not work for me. I do like the concept and the colors.', '2004-11-13 01:23:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008926, 118855, 22384, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful photo. Great contrast of light and dark, especially having the dark in the foreground. The color in the water, reflecting the color of the lighting in the trees is brilliant. Excellent photo.</td>', 'This is a beautiful photo. Great contrast of light and dark, especially having the dark in the foreground. The color in the water, reflecting the color of the lighting in the trees is brilliant. Excellent photo.', '2004-11-13 01:25:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008927, 118794, 23478, '<td valign="top">A better background would have made this more interesting.</td>', 'A better background would have made this more interesting.', '2004-11-13 01:25:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008928, 118562, 22384, '<td valign="top">The angle of the shot and the simplicity of the image work very well. I would crop up from the bottom left corner a bit. Nice job.</td>', 'The angle of the shot and the simplicity of the image work very well. I would crop up from the bottom left corner a bit. Nice job.', '2004-11-13 01:26:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008930, 118792, 23478, '<td valign="top">Ummm, what month is that?</td>', 'Ummm, what month is that?', '2004-11-13 01:27:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008931, 119486, 22384, '<td valign="top">I like the road. I would crop the sky down a bit. Having so much sky minimizes the mountains for me. Nice lighting - light in the foreground and background with the midranges darker adds an interesing twist.</td>', 'I like the road. I would crop the sky down a bit. Having so much sky minimizes the mountains for me. Nice lighting - light in the foreground and background with the midranges darker adds an interesing twist.', '2004-11-13 01:29:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008938, 119287, 22384, '<td valign="top">Interesting photo. The reflection make it look like two bulbs suspended in the air. I like the editing. Nice job.</td>', 'Interesting photo. The reflection make it look like two bulbs suspended in the air. I like the editing. Nice job.', '2004-11-13 01:31:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008940, 119122, 23478, '<td valign="top">Excellent focus, great lighting.  Maybe crop it tighter on the left and  leave a bit more of the top of his head.</td>', 'Excellent focus, great lighting.  Maybe crop it tighter on the left and  leave a bit more of the top of his head.', '2004-11-13 01:32:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008942, 118714, 22384, '<td valign="top">Great color. The composition is too symentrical for me. I want to reach out and move the King over in front of the pawn a bit more. I would more the rook and frosted pawn over toward the right edge and back.</td>', 'Great color. The composition is too symentrical for me. I want to reach out and move the King over in front of the pawn a bit more. I would more the rook and frosted pawn over toward the right edge and back.', '2004-11-13 01:33:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008950, 119489, 22384, '<td valign="top">Stunning color and light - if the artist was going for warm and serene, he or she succeeded. I would crop up from the bottom cutting off the lower part of the container. I might even move th tree over to the right of the frame a bit more. This is a beautiful image. The background compliments the focal point well. Nice job!</td>', 'Stunning color and light - if the artist was going for warm and serene, he or she succeeded. I would crop up from the bottom cutting off the lower part of the container. I might even move th tree over to the right of the frame a bit more. This is a beautiful image. The background compliments the focal point well. Nice job!', '2004-11-13 01:36:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008952, 119332, 22384, '<td valign="top">The angle, color, and crisp image in the foreground with the soft background work very well. Interesting photo. Excellent work,</td>', 'The angle, color, and crisp image in the foreground with the soft background work very well. Interesting photo. Excellent work,', '2004-11-13 01:38:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008996, 118316, 28742, '<td valign="top">Looks more like December  ;-)  Nice shot!</td>', 'Looks more like December  ;-)  Nice shot!', '2004-11-13 03:16:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008999, 119436, 28742, '<td valign="top">Oh, August. I get it.  ...no I don''t.  Nice photo though. :-)</td>', 'Oh, August. I get it.  ...no I don''t.  Nice photo though. :-)', '2004-11-13 03:17:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1009000, 119122, 28742, '<td valign="top">Just a tad dark for my taste, but love the dof and the composition. Nice job.</td>', 'Just a tad dark for my taste, but love the dof and the composition. Nice job.', '2004-11-13 03:18:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1009002, 118872, 28742, '<td valign="top">Lighting seems a bit harsh (brights too bright, darks too dark) and the striped pattern matches the theme, but just doesn''t sit well with me.</td>', 'Lighting seems a bit harsh (brights too bright, darks too dark) and the striped pattern matches the theme, but just doesn''t sit well with me.', '2004-11-13 03:20:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1009003, 119524, 28742, '<td valign="top">Like the colors, but something about the focus or dof seems off just a little.</td>', 'Like the colors, but something about the focus or dof seems off just a little.', '2004-11-13 03:23:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1009004, 119520, 28742, '<td valign="top">I wonder if you could have used some different lighting technique to get rid of the shadows - otherwise a nice shot.</td>', 'I wonder if you could have used some different lighting technique to get rid of the shadows - otherwise a nice shot.', '2004-11-13 03:24:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1009005, 117726, 28742, '<td valign="top">Focus seems to be on the tree in between the riders.</td>', 'Focus seems to be on the tree in between the riders.', '2004-11-13 03:25:34.000000', NULL, 1),
