(1009812, 118939, 25150, '<td valign="top">what a great expression! If you stand your model a little further from the white background, it helps to diffuse the shadows. She could also use a sof light as fill on her lower back.</td>', 'what a great expression! If you stand your model a little further from the white background, it helps to diffuse the shadows. She could also use a sof light as fill on her lower back.', '2004-11-13 20:11:03.000000', NULL, 1),
