(1009814, 119107, 25150, '<td valign="top">even though (IMO) it''s been lightened too much (especially the hair) I really like it. Maybe a touch darker in the hair and thats it? Good shot, and nice feel.</td>', 'even though (IMO) it''s been lightened too much (especially the hair) I really like it. Maybe a touch darker in the hair and thats it? Good shot, and nice feel.', '2004-11-13 20:13:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1009815, 118740, 6999, '<td valign="top">This looks like Gordon Whyte''s trick with NI - most specifically in the resultant texture of those leaves. I can go with the kind of soft/non-soft feel of it for a calendar shot, but I''m not great fan of it photographically, I''m afraid. It''ll garner a 6 though, for aptness, at least.</td>', 'This looks like Gordon Whyte''s trick with NI - most specifically in the resultant texture of those leaves. I can go with the kind of soft/non-soft feel of it for a calendar shot, but I''m not great fan of it photographically, I''m afraid. It''ll garner a 6 though, for aptness, at least.', '2004-11-13 20:14:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1009816, 119520, 25150, '<td valign="top">when shooting with a white background, you should move the subject away from it. basically, take a white sheet, and put the flower in a vase. Make sur ethe subject and background are far enough away from each other so you don''t get a shadow. :) Keep shooting, this is not meant to be a bad comment, only a little tip!<br/>E</td>', 'when shooting with a white background, you should move the subject away from it. basically, take a white sheet, and put the flower in a vase. Make sur ethe subject and background are far enough away from each other so you don''t get a shadow. :) Keep shooting, this is not meant to be a bad comment, only a little tip!E', '2004-11-13 20:16:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1009817, 119395, 25150, '<td valign="top">thats nice.<br/>has a good feel to it. makes my eyes jump around</td>', 'thats nice.has a good feel to it. makes my eyes jump around', '2004-11-13 20:17:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1009818, 119486, 6999, '<td valign="top">Lacks the punhc, the highly orthodox standard photographic approach to landscape that I''d expect of a calendar. A good enough scene, in itself, and in your chosen composition (although I think a more draatic cloudscape would be effective), but the light is not great - no sense of shape to the mountains, no warmth, and a sense of the image being cropped too high. You''ve done well howeever, to place the horizon strongly in frame, and to find those parallele shapes of tree-line and hills. Close - but it needs to be more imposing, to my eye.</td>', 'Lacks the punhc, the highly orthodox standard photographic approach to landscape that I''d expect of a calendar. A good enough scene, in itself, and in your chosen composition (although I think a more draatic cloudscape would be effective), but the light is not great - no sense of shape to the mountains, no warmth, and a sense of the image being cropped too high. You''ve done well howeever, to place the horizon strongly in frame, and to find those parallele shapes of tree-line and hills. Close - but it needs to be more imposing, to my eye.', '2004-11-13 20:18:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1009819, 118990, 25150, '<td valign="top">it''s a nice shot, but it''s really noisy. a lower ISO would have done the trick to reduce the noise (but it''s not always possible to shoot with a lower ISO huh?)<br/>E</td>', 'it''s a nice shot, but it''s really noisy. a lower ISO would have done the trick to reduce the noise (but it''s not always possible to shoot with a lower ISO huh?)E', '2004-11-13 20:18:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1009820, 118740, 25150, '<td valign="top">it;''s a neat effect, but it just looks to "fake" I like the style, but maybe not so much with this image. keep it up!</td>', 'it;''s a neat effect, but it just looks to "fake" I like the style, but maybe not so much with this image. keep it up!', '2004-11-13 20:20:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1009821, 118974, 93, '<td valign="top">Too dark for me. I don''t know if a longer exposure would have helped, or if metering in a darker area would have helped for in-camera.. possibly both.<br/> <br/>The train just fades into the background too much, taking away the focal point. Also, there just seems to be too much space around it as well, to my view.</td>', 'Too dark for me. I don''t know if a longer exposure would have helped, or if metering in a darker area would have helped for in-camera.. possibly both. The train just fades into the background too much, taking away the focal point. Also, there just seems to be too much space around it as well, to my view.', '2004-11-13 20:24:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1009822, 119453, 25150, '<td valign="top">so sweet....<br/>I love this shot. <br/>You ever heard this saying? "Never work with kids or animals. If you do, charge triple"<br/>I did a job for a "Doggy Day Spa" (some people have too much money) and I can verify the latter "Charge triple if you work with animals!" <br/> <br/>Kids on the other hand, no problem :)<br/> <br/>Anyways, I ramble sometimes. This is a very good shot. nuff said.</td>', 'so sweet....I love this shot. You ever heard this saying? "Never work with kids or animals. If you do, charge triple"I did a job for a "Doggy Day Spa" (some people have too much money) and I can verify the latter "Charge triple if you work with animals!"  Kids on the other hand, no problem :) Anyways, I ramble sometimes. This is a very good shot. nuff said.', '2004-11-13 20:25:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1009823, 119338, 93, '<td valign="top">There doesn''t seem to be enough contrast here, with the highlights being really faded, and the shadows being a little too bright.   This makes the focus seem to be even *more* out than it probably is.</td>', 'There doesn''t seem to be enough contrast here, with the highlights being really faded, and the shadows being a little too bright.   This makes the focus seem to be even *more* out than it probably is.', '2004-11-13 20:25:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1009825, 119220, 25150, '<td valign="top">oh,<br/>that is nice. I wish I took more photos like this.<br/>Good job :P<br/>E</td>', 'oh,that is nice. I wish I took more photos like this.Good job :PE', '2004-11-13 20:26:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1009826, 118981, 93, '<td valign="top">A lack of focal point really gives this shot a certain mediocrity to me.  The colors seem a little muted, and it''s slightly tilted.  I just find that I don''t know exactly what I''m supposed to be looking at.</td>', 'A lack of focal point really gives this shot a certain mediocrity to me.  The colors seem a little muted, and it''s slightly tilted.  I just find that I don''t know exactly what I''m supposed to be looking at.', '2004-11-13 20:27:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1009829, 119060, 93, '<td valign="top">A nice stop-motion capture, but the crop seems to be a little too loose, with too much free space at the edges. Especially the right edge, at least to me.  A tighter crop would have given the focal point on the pelicans a much more dynamic center.</td>', 'A nice stop-motion capture, but the crop seems to be a little too loose, with too much free space at the edges. Especially the right edge, at least to me.  A tighter crop would have given the focal point on the pelicans a much more dynamic center.', '2004-11-13 20:28:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1009834, 118963, 93, '<td valign="top">Your color balance could use some tweaking, as I see a lot of reds in the skin tones.  The focus isn''t on your subject quite enough, and could have benefitted from a tighter crop.. (not much, but getting rid of that W in the corner would have helped a lot.  <br/>Not being American, I could also question the tie-in to the month, but luckily I know that November is the usual election month, so I wonder if you might be suffering there as well.</td>', 'Your color balance could use some tweaking, as I see a lot of reds in the skin tones.  The focus isn''t on your subject quite enough, and could have benefitted from a tighter crop.. (not much, but getting rid of that W in the corner would have helped a lot.  Not being American, I could also question the tie-in to the month, but luckily I know that November is the usual election month, so I wonder if you might be suffering there as well.', '2004-11-13 20:31:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1009836, 119399, 29161, '<td valign="top">The color in this is amazing!!</td>', 'The color in this is amazing!!', '2004-11-13 20:31:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1009837, 118758, 93, '<td valign="top">I just don''t get the connection with the boots.  Sorry.</td>', 'I just don''t get the connection with the boots.  Sorry.', '2004-11-13 20:31:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1009843, 119328, 93, '<td valign="top">There''s a general lack of a focal point here, and a lack of focus as well.  I like the colors, but the scene is just a little too chaotic for me.   The path there seems to be just an afterthough, but you may have been able to use it to give the photograph some strength, to lead the viewer into the scene.  Instead, I just see it as a non-entity that helps to clutter.</td>', 'There''s a general lack of a focal point here, and a lack of focus as well.  I like the colors, but the scene is just a little too chaotic for me.   The path there seems to be just an afterthough, but you may have been able to use it to give the photograph some strength, to lead the viewer into the scene.  Instead, I just see it as a non-entity that helps to clutter.', '2004-11-13 20:33:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1009849, 117914, 93, '<td valign="top">This image is a nice idea, but suffers from a couple of points for me.  <br/> <br/>1. Size.  I''d have liked to have seen this larger.<br/> <br/>2. Focus. This might be an issue with your camera and a lack of a good macro setting, but the crispness isn''t there.  (one reason why you may have chosen a smaller file size.<br/> <br/>3. colors and contrast.  The image seems faded, and the darks and lights just aren''t dark and light enough for me.  Added contrast would have given this image a much stronger feel.</td>', 'This image is a nice idea, but suffers from a couple of points for me.   1. Size.  I''d have liked to have seen this larger. 2. Focus. This might be an issue with your camera and a lack of a good macro setting, but the crispness isn''t there.  (one reason why you may have chosen a smaller file size. 3. colors and contrast.  The image seems faded, and the darks and lights just aren''t dark and light enough for me.  Added contrast would have given this image a much stronger feel.', '2004-11-13 20:36:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1009854, 119220, 93, '<td valign="top">This is a nicely done sillhoutte, but it just doesn''t say anything to me.  I can''t even make anything out in the "Rorschach" effect.<br/>Fortunately, these are my own failings.  A good photo. Just not to my taste.</td>', 'This is a nicely done sillhoutte, but it just doesn''t say anything to me.  I can''t even make anything out in the "Rorschach" effect.Fortunately, these are my own failings.  A good photo. Just not to my taste.', '2004-11-13 20:39:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1009857, 119050, 93, '<td valign="top">I find the ligthing to be a little harsh in this photo.  The blue-ish is nice for the December tie in, but there isn''t enough "white" to balance it.   There''s something about your composition that I''m not keen on either.  Perhaps a lower perspective on the house, shot from nearer the ground?</td>', 'I find the ligthing to be a little harsh in this photo.  The blue-ish is nice for the December tie in, but there isn''t enough "white" to balance it.   There''s something about your composition that I''m not keen on either.  Perhaps a lower perspective on the house, shot from nearer the ground?', '2004-11-13 20:41:41.000000', NULL, 1),
