(1010059, 118335, 19437, '<td valign="top">There is way too much sky and is very uninteresting.  The colors are way too blown out.</td>', 'There is way too much sky and is very uninteresting.  The colors are way too blown out.', '2004-11-13 23:43:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1010074, 119576, 10170, '<td valign="top">Very sensually done, though I think it may be a little too risque for many people here, though personally I love it.</td>', 'Very sensually done, though I think it may be a little too risque for many people here, though personally I love it.', '2004-11-14 00:20:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1010075, 118949, 10170, '<td valign="top">Sensational colours, and love the composition.</td>', 'Sensational colours, and love the composition.', '2004-11-14 00:20:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1010076, 118370, 10170, '<td valign="top">Absolutely beautiful, both the model and the phot in general. 10</td>', 'Absolutely beautiful, both the model and the phot in general. 10', '2004-11-14 00:27:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1010077, 119336, 10170, '<td valign="top">Great timing, excellent photo, especially the dof.</td>', 'Great timing, excellent photo, especially the dof.', '2004-11-14 00:28:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1010080, 119079, 10170, '<td valign="top">Clever and very effective indeed.</td>', 'Clever and very effective indeed.', '2004-11-14 00:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1010082, 119190, 16046, '<td valign="top">Excellent burn job, very cool</td>', 'Excellent burn job, very cool', '2004-11-14 00:41:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1010084, 119578, 13091, '<td valign="top">Does not say december to me...</td>', 'Does not say december to me...', '2004-11-14 00:45:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1010085, 118990, 13091, '<td valign="top">Good composition but I don''t like the noise in the background</td>', 'Good composition but I don''t like the noise in the background', '2004-11-14 00:46:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1010090, 118954, 8891, '<td valign="top">Really Like the colors in the foreground, the very nice composition and all the great textures you have here.</td>', 'Really Like the colors in the foreground, the very nice composition and all the great textures you have here.', '2004-11-14 00:57:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1010111, 118772, 1031, '<td valign="top">That''s some perfectly-popped corn ... a pretty healthy snack too.</td>', 'That''s some perfectly-popped corn ... a pretty healthy snack too.', '2004-11-14 01:38:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1010114, 118672, 1031, '<td valign="top">That''s a very pretty picture, with nice detail in the shadows, although it doesn''t seem that characteristic of any particular month to me.</td>', 'That''s a very pretty picture, with nice detail in the shadows, although it doesn''t seem that characteristic of any particular month to me.', '2004-11-14 01:40:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1010116, 119397, 1031, '<td valign="top">I like the composition and contrasting textures. The coloring makes it look kind of cold (though dry); where I live August is supposed to be hot. I wonder how this would look duotoned with a warm/hot color....</td>', 'I like the composition and contrasting textures. The coloring makes it look kind of cold (though dry); where I live August is supposed to be hot. I wonder how this would look duotoned with a warm/hot color....', '2004-11-14 01:44:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1010119, 118682, 1031, '<td valign="top">I like pictures with fog/mist in them -- excellent tone range/exposure with what looks like difficult lighting conditions!</td>', 'I like pictures with fog/mist in them -- excellent tone range/exposure with what looks like difficult lighting conditions!', '2004-11-14 01:47:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1010122, 119337, 4226, '<td valign="top">is it selective blur ? doesn''t look natural to me</td>', 'is it selective blur ? doesn''t look natural to me', '2004-11-14 02:00:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1010123, 119375, 4226, '<td valign="top">too noisy,  can''t see focus here</td>', 'too noisy,  can''t see focus here', '2004-11-14 02:02:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1010179, 119295, 9668, '<td valign="top">It is kind of funny, but the lighting isn''t too good, and a deeper DOF would have helped as well.  Different idea than the normal though, and that''s good.</td>', 'It is kind of funny, but the lighting isn''t too good, and a deeper DOF would have helped as well.  Different idea than the normal though, and that''s good.', '2004-11-14 04:39:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1010180, 119525, 9668, '<td valign="top">I like the perspective, but you may have also tryed a lower perspective (like right next to the water). I think the lighting is a bit harsh as well, but I don''t know what time of day you were able to shoot this (or how often). IIdeally, for me, it would be a slow exposure shot right down next to the water with sunset glinting off the snow and water. But of course, I shouldn''t judge the image by what it could be, but by what it is. I do like it though, well done =). 6</td>', 'I like the perspective, but you may have also tryed a lower perspective (like right next to the water). I think the lighting is a bit harsh as well, but I don''t know what time of day you were able to shoot this (or how often). IIdeally, for me, it would be a slow exposure shot right down next to the water with sunset glinting off the snow and water. But of course, I shouldn''t judge the image by what it could be, but by what it is. I do like it though, well done =). 6', '2004-11-14 04:43:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1010182, 118971, 9668, '<td valign="top">This shot is a bit of a mystery to me. Composition is ok, but could be better. Seems a little to set up for me. The leaves on the ground looked placed there rather than being naturally there. I get the idea of metallic plants sprouting, but it doesn''t really appeal to me. Background is a bit distracting. Lighting isn''t interesting. I think the butterfly is really cool.</td>', 'This shot is a bit of a mystery to me. Composition is ok, but could be better. Seems a little to set up for me. The leaves on the ground looked placed there rather than being naturally there. I get the idea of metallic plants sprouting, but it doesn''t really appeal to me. Background is a bit distracting. Lighting isn''t interesting. I think the butterfly is really cool.', '2004-11-14 04:46:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1010185, 119534, 9668, '<td valign="top">Cool waterfall shot. Composition works, lighting is nice, theme is right on.  I can''t immediatly think of anything that would improve this shot.</td>', 'Cool waterfall shot. Composition works, lighting is nice, theme is right on.  I can''t immediatly think of anything that would improve this shot.', '2004-11-14 04:50:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1010186, 118094, 9668, '<td valign="top">Love the colors in this one. DOF is interesting, but it tis different and that''s cool. Excellent composition.</td>', 'Love the colors in this one. DOF is interesting, but it tis different and that''s cool. Excellent composition.', '2004-11-14 04:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1010187, 119336, 9668, '<td valign="top">Lighting seems like it could be a little better (flash might be a little harsh). <br/> <br/>I''m sorry to have offended the people of DPC (and Randy) with my doubts. Although I doubted the method at which this was achieved, I still voted this at a 7. <br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-11-15 20:16:33.</i></td>', 'Lighting seems like it could be a little better (flash might be a little harsh).  I''m sorry to have offended the people of DPC (and Randy) with my doubts. Although I doubted the method at which this was achieved, I still voted this at a 7. ', '2004-11-14 04:54:22.000000', '2004-11-15 20:16:33.000000', 1),
(1010188, 119302, 9668, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, lovely old house (but not to live in). Cool shot, I can imagine it in a calendar.</td>', 'Nice composition, lovely old house (but not to live in). Cool shot, I can imagine it in a calendar.', '2004-11-14 04:55:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1010189, 119299, 9668, '<td valign="top">Looks NeatImaged. Lovely balance, I wish the tree was a little brighter.</td>', 'Looks NeatImaged. Lovely balance, I wish the tree was a little brighter.', '2004-11-14 04:56:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1010191, 118963, 9668, '<td valign="top">Good shot. Can''t really imagine it in a calendar. Lighting is good, focus is a little off (or to much motion). Cool that you got a shot of the man himself though. 5</td>', 'Good shot. Can''t really imagine it in a calendar. Lighting is good, focus is a little off (or to much motion). Cool that you got a shot of the man himself though. 5', '2004-11-14 04:58:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1010199, 119079, 9668, '<td valign="top">Beautiful! I love dead leaves, and this is just great =). I''m not quite sure I could see it in a calendar, but I guess I could.</td>', 'Beautiful! I love dead leaves, and this is just great =). I''m not quite sure I could see it in a calendar, but I guess I could.', '2004-11-14 05:18:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1010201, 119526, 9668, '<td valign="top">Beautiful scene. I would like to see this in the morning or evening (light seems a little harsh in this one). You''ve got a good composition, and an excellent scene. This shoud do well.</td>', 'Beautiful scene. I would like to see this in the morning or evening (light seems a little harsh in this one). You''ve got a good composition, and an excellent scene. This shoud do well.', '2004-11-14 05:20:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1010202, 118312, 9668, '<td valign="top">I like the deeper thought: "come in like a lion..." Well done, nice job filling the frame.</td>', 'I like the deeper thought: "come in like a lion..." Well done, nice job filling the frame.', '2004-11-14 05:21:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1010203, 119220, 25355, '<td valign="top">Sorry, can''t give you 11. I hope 10 will suffice.</td>', 'Sorry, can''t give you 11. I hope 10 will suffice.', '2004-11-14 05:22:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1010206, 119336, 25355, '<td valign="top">I''m not a great fan of dog pics, but I like this one. I imagine the dog is running around chasing falling leaves. Great DoF too. 10</td>', 'I''m not a great fan of dog pics, but I like this one. I imagine the dog is running around chasing falling leaves. Great DoF too. 10', '2004-11-14 05:25:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1010207, 119377, 25355, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting. I presume it''s one of those dark room/torchlight painting ones? This would definitely look good in a bonsai calendar. 10<br/> <br/>edit; typo<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-11-15 06:49:05.</i></td>', 'I like the lighting. I presume it''s one of those dark room/torchlight painting ones? This would definitely look good in a bonsai calendar. 10 edit; typo', '2004-11-14 05:27:09.000000', '2004-11-15 06:49:05.000000', 1),
(1010209, 119190, 25355, '<td valign="top">A great atmospheric shot, but a little grainy. 10, nonetheless.</td>', 'A great atmospheric shot, but a little grainy. 10, nonetheless.', '2004-11-14 05:27:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1010211, 118813, 25355, '<td valign="top">Stunning. Beautiful colours. 10</td>', 'Stunning. Beautiful colours. 10', '2004-11-14 05:28:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1010212, 119569, 25355, '<td valign="top">Nice but the horizon is crooked. 7</td>', 'Nice but the horizon is crooked. 7', '2004-11-14 05:29:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1010215, 119291, 25355, '<td valign="top">Background too distracting, and would Audobon publish photos with a wire cage?  Beautiful bird, though. 5</td>', 'Background too distracting, and would Audobon publish photos with a wire cage?  Beautiful bird, though. 5', '2004-11-14 05:36:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1010217, 118758, 25355, '<td valign="top">Shoe fetishist calendar?</td>', 'Shoe fetishist calendar?', '2004-11-14 05:37:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1010257, 118380, 8891, '<td valign="top">Not sure about the sepia looking sky, but I very much like the rest of it.</td>', 'Not sure about the sepia looking sky, but I very much like the rest of it.', '2004-11-14 08:36:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1010266, 119396, 11756, '<td valign="top">nice</td>', 'nice', '2004-11-14 09:09:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1010267, 119155, 11756, '<td valign="top">wow. powerful image. great contrast</td>', 'wow. powerful image. great contrast', '2004-11-14 09:09:48.000000', NULL, 1),
