(1010275, 119399, 11756, '<td valign="top">oh this is very nice.</td>', 'oh this is very nice.', '2004-11-14 09:16:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1010284, 118962, 16493, '<td valign="top">very cute and very good.</td>', 'very cute and very good.', '2004-11-14 09:32:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1010285, 119489, 16493, '<td valign="top">gives a good mood</td>', 'gives a good mood', '2004-11-14 09:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1010287, 118370, 16493, '<td valign="top">Like it. will probaly do well.</td>', 'Like it. will probaly do well.', '2004-11-14 09:33:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1010340, 118525, 29423, '<td valign="top">Appropriate to the time of the year (november)</td>', 'Appropriate to the time of the year (november)', '2004-11-14 11:09:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1010341, 118954, 29423, '<td valign="top">Autumn mood...</td>', 'Autumn mood...', '2004-11-14 11:12:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1010342, 118426, 29423, '<td valign="top">Fall is there....</td>', 'Fall is there....', '2004-11-14 11:14:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1010350, 119576, 10818, '<td valign="top">Wow, thats different for calendar.<br/> <br/>Works for me.</td>', 'Wow, thats different for calendar. Works for me.', '2004-11-14 11:20:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1010353, 118939, 10818, '<td valign="top">The red colors really work well.   Pretty girl, nice smile, well done portrait.</td>', 'The red colors really work well.   Pretty girl, nice smile, well done portrait.', '2004-11-14 11:24:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1010365, 119190, 23478, '<td valign="top">Stunning photo, the sun creates a powerful image shining through the break in the clouds.</td>', 'Stunning photo, the sun creates a powerful image shining through the break in the clouds.', '2004-11-14 11:54:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1010377, 118987, 25486, '<td valign="top">Nicely framed, nothing wasted around the edges.  Technically very well done, just the right shuffer speed I think.  Good viewpoint, the stream leads you into the shot well.  If anything the leaves look a little over sharpened.  Well done a seven from me.</td>', 'Nicely framed, nothing wasted around the edges.  Technically very well done, just the right shuffer speed I think.  Good viewpoint, the stream leads you into the shot well.  If anything the leaves look a little over sharpened.  Well done a seven from me.', '2004-11-14 12:28:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1010381, 119519, 25486, '<td valign="top">Striking image, the colour of the rock is amazing, as is the colour of the sky.  If anything I''d say there is a bit too much sky.  Also the foreground is very dark, I realise its in shadow and is suposed to be dark but because its not dark beyond recognition it distracts me from the main subject.  Well done though, six from me.</td>', 'Striking image, the colour of the rock is amazing, as is the colour of the sky.  If anything I''d say there is a bit too much sky.  Also the foreground is very dark, I realise its in shadow and is suposed to be dark but because its not dark beyond recognition it distracts me from the main subject.  Well done though, six from me.', '2004-11-14 12:31:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1010383, 118312, 10047, '<td valign="top">Nice fill the frame photo. Clarity and lighting are excellent.</td>', 'Nice fill the frame photo. Clarity and lighting are excellent.', '2004-11-14 12:34:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1010386, 118974, 10047, '<td valign="top">I might have tried cropping it down to just the engine, and then tried lighting it up a bit.</td>', 'I might have tried cropping it down to just the engine, and then tried lighting it up a bit.', '2004-11-14 12:36:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1010387, 118974, 25486, '<td valign="top">A nice idea,s elective de-sat?  The leaves have also lost their colour and therefore their punch which leaves the whole thing looking a bit flat.  A change of veiwpoint would improve the shot, in my opinion.  Tighter in to loose the footpath, lower down to emphasize the train and slightly left to loose some of the distrcting background.  When composing a shot like this where you have plenty of time, use it and have a good look around the veiwfinder and make sure only the things you want in the shot can be seen.  Well done though, a six from me.</td>', 'A nice idea,s elective de-sat?  The leaves have also lost their colour and therefore their punch which leaves the whole thing looking a bit flat.  A change of veiwpoint would improve the shot, in my opinion.  Tighter in to loose the footpath, lower down to emphasize the train and slightly left to loose some of the distrcting background.  When composing a shot like this where you have plenty of time, use it and have a good look around the veiwfinder and make sure only the things you want in the shot can be seen.  Well done though, a six from me.', '2004-11-14 12:37:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1010389, 118990, 10047, '<td valign="top">Seems a bit grainy in the background. Good capture with the wings out.</td>', 'Seems a bit grainy in the background. Good capture with the wings out.', '2004-11-14 12:40:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1010393, 119132, 25486, '<td valign="top">A very nice view, quite well composed.  The tree is well placed against the mountains and the lake.  The picnic table on the rise is a bit small a larger object like a building would have been better, (I know there''s nothing you could do about that).  It seems a bit hazy and it looks as though you''ve tried to remedy that by sharpening and it may be overdone slightly.  If so, a polerising filter may help.  Very well done, a six from me.</td>', 'A very nice view, quite well composed.  The tree is well placed against the mountains and the lake.  The picnic table on the rise is a bit small a larger object like a building would have been better, (I know there''s nothing you could do about that).  It seems a bit hazy and it looks as though you''ve tried to remedy that by sharpening and it may be overdone slightly.  If so, a polerising filter may help.  Very well done, a six from me.', '2004-11-14 12:42:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1010395, 119341, 25486, '<td valign="top">Wonderful image.  All those streams and waterfalls lead the eye up to the sumit, just visible through the mist and the colours are superb.  If anything it seems a bit over sharpened.  Well done, a six from me.</td>', 'Wonderful image.  All those streams and waterfalls lead the eye up to the sumit, just visible through the mist and the colours are superb.  If anything it seems a bit over sharpened.  Well done, a six from me.', '2004-11-14 12:44:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1010396, 117726, 10047, '<td valign="top">Needs a tad more sharpness.</td>', 'Needs a tad more sharpness.', '2004-11-14 12:46:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1010397, 119524, 10047, '<td valign="top">I might have tried cropping out the light on the left to see the effect.</td>', 'I might have tried cropping out the light on the left to see the effect.', '2004-11-14 12:48:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1010398, 119487, 25486, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colours, both the trees and the sky.  Plus a reflection as well.  Only one thing and that is that its very lefty, I mean the eye is lead out to the right by the lake and the reeds and then...there''s nothing out there to look at.  Perhaps a different viewpoint further along to the right may have been better? (If possible?)  Well done anyway and a six from me.</td>', 'Beautiful colours, both the trees and the sky.  Plus a reflection as well.  Only one thing and that is that its very lefty, I mean the eye is lead out to the right by the lake and the reeds and then...there''s nothing out there to look at.  Perhaps a different viewpoint further along to the right may have been better? (If possible?)  Well done anyway and a six from me.', '2004-11-14 12:49:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1010399, 118872, 2170, '<td valign="top">lighting is not very even</td>', 'lighting is not very even', '2004-11-14 12:50:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1010400, 118910, 10047, '<td valign="top">Would have liked to see the this with the sun at different angle bringing out some of the statues features.</td>', 'Would have liked to see the this with the sun at different angle bringing out some of the statues features.', '2004-11-14 12:50:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1010402, 118910, 2170, '<td valign="top">photo seems quite fuzzy.</td>', 'photo seems quite fuzzy.', '2004-11-14 12:51:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1010403, 119453, 25486, '<td valign="top">Perfect pose, a well trained dog.  Good focussing, I can almose see your reflection in the eyes.  Wonderful lighting, lovely colour, a six from me.</td>', 'Perfect pose, a well trained dog.  Good focussing, I can almose see your reflection in the eyes.  Wonderful lighting, lovely colour, a six from me.', '2004-11-14 12:51:14.000000', NULL, 1),
