(1010408, 118556, 25486, '<td valign="top">Great colours, nicely framed, wonderful lighting.  I normally shy away from having people in my shots but in this case I think a figure in a bright red coat walking away, about two thirds of the way down the line of trees would have made this even better, in my opinion.  Well done a six from me.</td>', 'Great colours, nicely framed, wonderful lighting.  I normally shy away from having people in my shots but in this case I think a figure in a bright red coat walking away, about two thirds of the way down the line of trees would have made this even better, in my opinion.  Well done a six from me.', '2004-11-14 12:53:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1010409, 118714, 2170, '<td valign="top">i don''t understand how this represents january?</td>', 'i don''t understand how this represents january?', '2004-11-14 12:53:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1010410, 118682, 10047, '<td valign="top">Took me a minute to recognize what I think it a tobacco barn. I might a have tried a larger crop.</td>', 'Took me a minute to recognize what I think it a tobacco barn. I might a have tried a larger crop.', '2004-11-14 12:54:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1010411, 119476, 2170, '<td valign="top">nice area.  i wish the shadow of the tree wasn''t smackdab in the middle of the building</td>', 'nice area.  i wish the shadow of the tree wasn''t smackdab in the middle of the building', '2004-11-14 12:54:23.000000', NULL, 1),
