(1010413, 118094, 2170, '<td valign="top">i think i would have the dof more in the foreground, but nice shot</td>', 'i think i would have the dof more in the foreground, but nice shot', '2004-11-14 12:55:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1010414, 119336, 10047, '<td valign="top">The pooch really POPS out from the leafy background. Very well done. Nice capture on the expression also.</td>', 'The pooch really POPS out from the leafy background. Very well done. Nice capture on the expression also.', '2004-11-14 12:57:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1010415, 118958, 25486, '<td valign="top">I have a thing about horizons, look at other comments I''ve made and you''ll see.  It may be an illusion but, the horizon seems to dip to the right to me?  Apart from that the colours are great and are wonderfully reflected in the pool.  The grasses are nicely silhouetted, there''s some sky detail but I can''t help feeling there should be something on the right to balance it a bit?  Very nice shot all the same, a six from me.</td>', 'I have a thing about horizons, look at other comments I''ve made and you''ll see.  It may be an illusion but, the horizon seems to dip to the right to me?  Apart from that the colours are great and are wonderfully reflected in the pool.  The grasses are nicely silhouetted, there''s some sky detail but I can''t help feeling there should be something on the right to balance it a bit?  Very nice shot all the same, a six from me.', '2004-11-14 12:57:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1010417, 119190, 10047, '<td valign="top">Nice and moody. The colors and tones are excellent. I wonder if a narrower vertical crop on the left side wold have much impact.</td>', 'Nice and moody. The colors and tones are excellent. I wonder if a narrower vertical crop on the left side wold have much impact.', '2004-11-14 12:59:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1010418, 119564, 10047, '<td valign="top">Wonderful colors and lighting. Good sense of depth also.</td>', 'Wonderful colors and lighting. Good sense of depth also.', '2004-11-14 13:00:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1010419, 117888, 25486, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, no doubt.  I think I would have cropped just a little more from the bottom.  The reflection is good but the sky is where its at and the horizon is almost across the middle.  Well exposed under tricky lighting conditions, well done, a six from me.</td>', 'Beautiful, no doubt.  I think I would have cropped just a little more from the bottom.  The reflection is good but the sky is where its at and the horizon is almost across the middle.  Well exposed under tricky lighting conditions, well done, a six from me.', '2004-11-14 13:00:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1010420, 119356, 25486, '<td valign="top">An unusual subject, given interest by the snow lying on it.  The buildings in background are a bit distracting, the mountain is ok but the light is a bit flat from this angle.  I don''t know what was around to the left but it seems that the warm light is being reflected from the other side of the art work and that would have produced a better shot.  As I said I don''t know what was in the background but that''s where the light is.  Well done though, a six from me.</td>', 'An unusual subject, given interest by the snow lying on it.  The buildings in background are a bit distracting, the mountain is ok but the light is a bit flat from this angle.  I don''t know what was around to the left but it seems that the warm light is being reflected from the other side of the art work and that would have produced a better shot.  As I said I don''t know what was in the background but that''s where the light is.  Well done though, a six from me.', '2004-11-14 13:05:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1010422, 119078, 1031, '<td valign="top">The pattern they''re in almost resembles Arabic script -- I wonder what they''re "saying."</td>', 'The pattern they''re in almost resembles Arabic script -- I wonder what they''re "saying."', '2004-11-14 13:10:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1010423, 119374, 25486, '<td valign="top">Beautiful scene.  The first thing I noticed, (when looking for things that could be improved), is the deep black shadows under the trees, nothing wrong with black shadows but, because there''s not a lot happening over to the right of the shot, just some nice sky and some distant background, the trees and the deep shadows make the shot a bit un balanced, in my opinion.  If possible I would have moved to the right some way and tried to keep the reflection and rocks in the foreground, bringing the mountain more central to try to balance things up a bit more.  Well done though for some stunning scenery, a six from me.</td>', 'Beautiful scene.  The first thing I noticed, (when looking for things that could be improved), is the deep black shadows under the trees, nothing wrong with black shadows but, because there''s not a lot happening over to the right of the shot, just some nice sky and some distant background, the trees and the deep shadows make the shot a bit un balanced, in my opinion.  If possible I would have moved to the right some way and tried to keep the reflection and rocks in the foreground, bringing the mountain more central to try to balance things up a bit more.  Well done though for some stunning scenery, a six from me.', '2004-11-14 13:10:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1010425, 118945, 25486, '<td valign="top">Studio flower shots are not normally my thing but, I like this for its simplicity and high contrast.  The colours are great, nice composition.  I think the border is great, using a colour from the scene, just to balance those anti border comments.  Well done a six from me.</td>', 'Studio flower shots are not normally my thing but, I like this for its simplicity and high contrast.  The colours are great, nice composition.  I think the border is great, using a colour from the scene, just to balance those anti border comments.  Well done a six from me.', '2004-11-14 13:13:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1010426, 119376, 25486, '<td valign="top">Not sure about having a scene from a cemetery on a calendar?  But that aside its well done.  Quite well balanced, very good.  The colours are wonderful in the sky but look a little strange on the stones and the grass?  What''s with the wavy border along the bottom of the shot?  <br/> <br/>Well done a six from me.</td>', 'Not sure about having a scene from a cemetery on a calendar?  But that aside its well done.  Quite well balanced, very good.  The colours are wonderful in the sky but look a little strange on the stones and the grass?  What''s with the wavy border along the bottom of the shot?   Well done a six from me.', '2004-11-14 13:17:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1010429, 119340, 25486, '<td valign="top">Nicely captured.  Good sillouhette.  Some noise in the stern of the boat but there is very high contrast there.  Not sure about the composition though?  There seems to be an awful lot of empty space at the bottom of the shot, I know there are reflections but it still seems a bit much to me?  Well done anyway, a six from me.</td>', 'Nicely captured.  Good sillouhette.  Some noise in the stern of the boat but there is very high contrast there.  Not sure about the composition though?  There seems to be an awful lot of empty space at the bottom of the shot, I know there are reflections but it still seems a bit much to me?  Well done anyway, a six from me.', '2004-11-14 13:21:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1010434, 119303, 25486, '<td valign="top">Not sure why I''d want this as a picture in my calendar, I''d like my calendar to be uplifting and this seems to portray destruction, not letting that affect my voting though.  I think this scene would work well if more post processing were applied, which of course isn''t allowed in the challenge.  Its kind of halfway between a pretty rural cottages scene and an urban abandonment scene.  The image and therefore me the veiwer can''t decide.  Good effort keep shotting and submitting, a five from me.</td>', 'Not sure why I''d want this as a picture in my calendar, I''d like my calendar to be uplifting and this seems to portray destruction, not letting that affect my voting though.  I think this scene would work well if more post processing were applied, which of course isn''t allowed in the challenge.  Its kind of halfway between a pretty rural cottages scene and an urban abandonment scene.  The image and therefore me the veiwer can''t decide.  Good effort keep shotting and submitting, a five from me.', '2004-11-14 13:26:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1010436, 119435, 25486, '<td valign="top">Good veiwpoint for the Paris, would make a nice calendar picture.  Would remind me of my holiday!  Well lit, gives some texture to the buildings, even though they are a bit small.  I might have just concentrated on the tower and the main building?  Well done though, a five from me.</td>', 'Good veiwpoint for the Paris, would make a nice calendar picture.  Would remind me of my holiday!  Well lit, gives some texture to the buildings, even though they are a bit small.  I might have just concentrated on the tower and the main building?  Well done though, a five from me.', '2004-11-14 13:30:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1010437, 118778, 25486, '<td valign="top">I just love the colours in this shot.  Well done for spotting this opportunity and giving us an urban calendar shot.  A five from me.</td>', 'I just love the colours in this shot.  Well done for spotting this opportunity and giving us an urban calendar shot.  A five from me.', '2004-11-14 13:32:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1010439, 119521, 25486, '<td valign="top">The colours are what atracted me to this shot and they are great.  The worst thing for me is that its just a bit ordinary in its content.  With an "ordinary" scene like this you need to find a dramatic viewpoint and / or have some extraordinary lighting.  The lighting here is a bit flat, there are hardly any shadows being cast.  How about being right up against the wall or right down at ground level, don''t be afraid to experiment with the veiw ans look at it through the camera to see what it sees, things can look very diferent from our own eyes.  Well done though, a five from me.</td>', 'The colours are what atracted me to this shot and they are great.  The worst thing for me is that its just a bit ordinary in its content.  With an "ordinary" scene like this you need to find a dramatic viewpoint and / or have some extraordinary lighting.  The lighting here is a bit flat, there are hardly any shadows being cast.  How about being right up against the wall or right down at ground level, don''t be afraid to experiment with the veiw ans look at it through the camera to see what it sees, things can look very diferent from our own eyes.  Well done though, a five from me.', '2004-11-14 13:38:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1010440, 119107, 25486, '<td valign="top">Nice light feel to this shot, I like the softness and glowing effect.  The desaturated colours add to the effect well.  However I thing the pose is a little off, looking towards the camera would have been better for me. A five from me, well done.</td>', 'Nice light feel to this shot, I like the softness and glowing effect.  The desaturated colours add to the effect well.  However I thing the pose is a little off, looking towards the camera would have been better for me. A five from me, well done.', '2004-11-14 13:41:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1010442, 118946, 25486, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, good viewpoint, but and its a big but in a seascape, the horizon is not level, its slightly down at the right.  I said good viewpoint but I think it could have been better if we could see more of the curve of the bridge / jetty / pier?  Also it leads the eye out there and then there''s nothing to see, no focal point in the distance, because the bridge / jetty / pier is not the focal point out there.  Nice colours and textures on the rocks, well done a five from me.</td>', 'Nice shot, good viewpoint, but and its a big but in a seascape, the horizon is not level, its slightly down at the right.  I said good viewpoint but I think it could have been better if we could see more of the curve of the bridge / jetty / pier?  Also it leads the eye out there and then there''s nothing to see, no focal point in the distance, because the bridge / jetty / pier is not the focal point out there.  Nice colours and textures on the rocks, well done a five from me.', '2004-11-14 13:48:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1010443, 119582, 25486, '<td valign="top">Hmmm, the pose seems a little awkward? I think its because she is standing on her tiptoes?  I like the angle at which its shot and the scene is interesting, almost detracts from the beautiful girl a bit too much?  Also the shot seems to have too much of the warm colour cast.  Good work, a five from me.</td>', 'Hmmm, the pose seems a little awkward? I think its because she is standing on her tiptoes?  I like the angle at which its shot and the scene is interesting, almost detracts from the beautiful girl a bit too much?  Also the shot seems to have too much of the warm colour cast.  Good work, a five from me.', '2004-11-14 13:51:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1010445, 118607, 25486, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, good to get the birds in like that.  Seems a bit over sharpened.  Is that building work still going on on the bridge?  The light is a bit disapointing, seems a bit flat, (not within your control I know).  Unfortunately a well photographed location of which there are many excellent examples and you are bound to get comparisons.  Well done anyway, a five from me.</td>', 'Nice shot, good to get the birds in like that.  Seems a bit over sharpened.  Is that building work still going on on the bridge?  The light is a bit disapointing, seems a bit flat, (not within your control I know).  Unfortunately a well photographed location of which there are many excellent examples and you are bound to get comparisons.  Well done anyway, a five from me.', '2004-11-14 13:55:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1010448, 119436, 25486, '<td valign="top">An interesting high key shot.  Not sure I''d choose it for a calendar but that won''t affect my scoring at all.  The focussing seems a bit off, that may be the high key effect or just the surface of the material, the lid of the back lefthand box and the ball in the open box for instance?  The lighting is a bit harsh for my taste.  The overall effect doesn''t give any impression of texture in my opinion.  Its a very nice idea which may have worked better with softer lighting and a duotone effect?  Good work, a five from me.</td>', 'An interesting high key shot.  Not sure I''d choose it for a calendar but that won''t affect my scoring at all.  The focussing seems a bit off, that may be the high key effect or just the surface of the material, the lid of the back lefthand box and the ball in the open box for instance?  The lighting is a bit harsh for my taste.  The overall effect doesn''t give any impression of texture in my opinion.  Its a very nice idea which may have worked better with softer lighting and a duotone effect?  Good work, a five from me.', '2004-11-14 14:00:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1010449, 118479, 25486, '<td valign="top">Good effort but the focusssing is a bit off, the little girl just isn''t sharp and she needs to be in my opinion.  The background is well blurred but th pose looks forced, (I know she''s only a child not a professional model), a beautiful child at that, well done, a five from me.</td>', 'Good effort but the focusssing is a bit off, the little girl just isn''t sharp and she needs to be in my opinion.  The background is well blurred but th pose looks forced, (I know she''s only a child not a professional model), a beautiful child at that, well done, a five from me.', '2004-11-14 14:03:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1010450, 118963, 25486, '<td valign="top">Give us a break, I''m sick of seeing these shots, even in the UK, so I don''t know how you must feel over there?  OK, its focussed and he looks like he''s making a point but the background is far too distracting and a calendar?  You''re joking right?</td>', 'Give us a break, I''m sick of seeing these shots, even in the UK, so I don''t know how you must feel over there?  OK, its focussed and he looks like he''s making a point but the background is far too distracting and a calendar?  You''re joking right?', '2004-11-14 14:06:47.000000', NULL, 1),
