(1010470, 119132, 1031, '<td valign="top">Pretty landscape and good use of portrait orientation -- coveys the "chill" despite the bright sunshine.<br/> <br/>I wouldn''t have objected had you chosen to "remove" the picnic tables and whatnot.</td>', 'Pretty landscape and good use of portrait orientation -- coveys the "chill" despite the bright sunshine. I wouldn''t have objected had you chosen to "remove" the picnic tables and whatnot.', '2004-11-14 14:47:14.000000', NULL, 1),
