(1010478, 118963, 1031, '<td valign="top">Excellent capture -- a lot of expressiveness without too much "action" and just the right amount of tonal difference between fore- and background figures. Actually, it''s probably one of the most flattering pictures I''ve seen this election season.<br/> <br/>The clever crop to keep just the "W" is an bonus.</td>', 'Excellent capture -- a lot of expressiveness without too much "action" and just the right amount of tonal difference between fore- and background figures. Actually, it''s probably one of the most flattering pictures I''ve seen this election season. The clever crop to keep just the "W" is an bonus.', '2004-11-14 15:01:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1010488, 119041, 26799, '<td valign="top">Something isn''t warm and fuzzy with the black background but kittens are always cute. Good job.</td>', 'Something isn''t warm and fuzzy with the black background but kittens are always cute. Good job.', '2004-11-14 15:14:59.000000', NULL, 1),
