(1010696, 119102, 26679, '<td valign="top">The neat image used here gives a silk like finish on the pumpkins which I feel adds greatly to this image. I would query the use of a ikonic image of 31st October - in the form of a pumpkin, as a shot for November. It would not be my obvious choice. I still love the image though.<br/></td>', 'The neat image used here gives a silk like finish on the pumpkins which I feel adds greatly to this image. I would query the use of a ikonic image of 31st October - in the form of a pumpkin, as a shot for November. It would not be my obvious choice. I still love the image though.', '2004-11-14 17:49:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1010697, 119304, 26679, '<td valign="top">Colouring, and composition. Simple and effective, one of my favorites.<br/> <br/>edited for spelling<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-11-15 03:32:57.</i></td>', 'Colouring, and composition. Simple and effective, one of my favorites. edited for spelling', '2004-11-14 17:52:17.000000', '2004-11-15 03:32:57.000000', 1),
(1010700, 118895, 26679, '<td valign="top">This shot encapsulates january for me. The composition is strong, with the eyes being drawn to the centre. The colours chosen here support the composition, and the shallow depth of field assists in drawing the eye from the back to the front. - I like this.</td>', 'This shot encapsulates january for me. The composition is strong, with the eyes being drawn to the centre. The colours chosen here support the composition, and the shallow depth of field assists in drawing the eye from the back to the front. - I like this.', '2004-11-14 17:55:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1010719, 118556, 8860, '<td valign="top">Very pretty - definitely calendar-quality material. The branch on the right mid-ground is a little untidy (worth cloning out really), but it''s a lovely viewpoint and good accentuation of portrait format.</td>', 'Very pretty - definitely calendar-quality material. The branch on the right mid-ground is a little untidy (worth cloning out really), but it''s a lovely viewpoint and good accentuation of portrait format.', '2004-11-14 18:37:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1010721, 119397, 8860, '<td valign="top">Not much of interest or seasonal relevance here for me. Ordinarily the month would be depicted by something that denotes a flavour of that time, but this actually looks quite barren and devoid of features.</td>', 'Not much of interest or seasonal relevance here for me. Ordinarily the month would be depicted by something that denotes a flavour of that time, but this actually looks quite barren and devoid of features.', '2004-11-14 18:41:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1010723, 119181, 8860, '<td valign="top">I''m not really sure that this would be calendar material. Who would buy it and what theme would it convey? I''d think this kind of image is too personal for someone to hang on their wall for a month!<br/> <br/>It''s a good shot and naturally posed, though a bit lacking in depth of contrast.</td>', 'I''m not really sure that this would be calendar material. Who would buy it and what theme would it convey? I''d think this kind of image is too personal for someone to hang on their wall for a month! It''s a good shot and naturally posed, though a bit lacking in depth of contrast.', '2004-11-14 18:44:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1010725, 119453, 8860, '<td valign="top">Yup - this is the kind of calendar shot that typifies the genre. Not my kind of calendar, mind! <br/> <br/>Very well shot and excellently modelled - a bit too low &amp; tight in the frame though.</td>', 'Yup - this is the kind of calendar shot that typifies the genre. Not my kind of calendar, mind!  Very well shot and excellently modelled - a bit too low & tight in the frame though.', '2004-11-14 18:48:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1010730, 118772, 8860, '<td valign="top">Very little here to keep this out of the 1s I''m afraid.<br/> <br/>It''s poorly lit, blurred and you''ve got a very confusing and uninteresting subject. This is harsh I know but I''m saying what many people will be thinking. I would have chosen a less flat lighting arrangement, used a tripod and presented an unusual viewpoint that enthusiasts for your subject may not be familiar with. <br/> <br/>Perhaps a macro shot of a portion of the popcorn, or a shot of the popcorn with a hand buried in it. Maybe even an action shot of some popping. <br/> <br/>... Or you could have shot a miniature cinema with a popcorn on each seat, each with a box of miniature people waiting to be eaten!</td>', 'Very little here to keep this out of the 1s I''m afraid. It''s poorly lit, blurred and you''ve got a very confusing and uninteresting subject. This is harsh I know but I''m saying what many people will be thinking. I would have chosen a less flat lighting arrangement, used a tripod and presented an unusual viewpoint that enthusiasts for your subject may not be familiar with.  Perhaps a macro shot of a portion of the popcorn, or a shot of the popcorn with a hand buried in it. Maybe even an action shot of some popping.  ... Or you could have shot a miniature cinema with a popcorn on each seat, each with a box of miniature people waiting to be eaten!', '2004-11-14 18:56:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1010732, 119336, 8860, '<td valign="top">This is superbly caught, very crisp and with some lovely detail in the face. Not my kind of calendar but I bet dog lovers would really go for this.</td>', 'This is superbly caught, very crisp and with some lovely detail in the face. Not my kind of calendar but I bet dog lovers would really go for this.', '2004-11-14 19:06:40.000000', NULL, 1),
