(1010945, 119291, 6870, '<td valign="top">This is kinda funny, since this is a starling--the most hated bird of the Audubon Society! They escaped from captivity in the late 1800s and have been weed-birds ever since! Oh well, the photo is great, by the way. Clarity and focus are spot on and interesting. 8</td>', 'This is kinda funny, since this is a starling--the most hated bird of the Audubon Society! They escaped from captivity in the late 1800s and have been weed-birds ever since! Oh well, the photo is great, by the way. Clarity and focus are spot on and interesting. 8', '2004-11-14 23:53:39.000000', NULL, 1),
