(1011101, 119304, 5112, '<td valign="top">Red and gold on red!  Wow.  The colours are quite beatiful here, and the image is so clear.  I like it - it''s such a contrast to many of your other pictures, this almost looks like an advertisement.  Very interesting.<br/> <br/>Edit (added): actually, it''s not that much of a contrast, you have quite a few images that are very graphic in nature.  I like your photos very much.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-11-15 00:53:39.</i></td>', 'Red and gold on red!  Wow.  The colours are quite beatiful here, and the image is so clear.  I like it - it''s such a contrast to many of your other pictures, this almost looks like an advertisement.  Very interesting. Edit (added): actually, it''s not that much of a contrast, you have quite a few images that are very graphic in nature.  I like your photos very much.', '2004-11-15 00:52:23.000000', '2004-11-15 00:53:39.000000', 0),
