(1558079, 118626, 37893, '<td valign="top">I agree that this phot has a very "snapshot" feel. The reason is due to the way the image was cropped. One thing that bothers me though is the way the apex of the pyramid lines up with the tower in the rear. the power of the triangle is somewhat lost when this happens. DOF is good. Lastly, that railing towards the bottom of the image is quite distracting as well. Other than that, it''s a great capture of one of I.M. Pei''s iconic buildings.</td>', 'I agree that this phot has a very "snapshot" feel. The reason is due to the way the image was cropped. One thing that bothers me though is the way the apex of the pyramid lines up with the tower in the rear. the power of the triangle is somewhat lost when this happens. DOF is good. Lastly, that railing towards the bottom of the image is quite distracting as well. Other than that, it''s a great capture of one of I.M. Pei''s iconic buildings.', '2005-07-24 00:16:21.000000', NULL, 0),
