(2707705, 119061, 51538, '<td valign="top">Looking out over Lancing College, I think.  Unless I am mistaken, it was from the downs you were standing on when taking this shot - or a nearby location - that hang gliding took off (so-to-speak) when it first came in to fashion.  I lived in that area and did everything I could to get away after growing up - on to Cornwall, London, Greece, China, Taiwan, and the USA where my catharsis of travel got constipated.  Looking at your great shots of the local area makes me wonder why on earth I never saw how lovely and exotic it is.  "The other man''s grass..." or whatever the saying is.</td>', 'Looking out over Lancing College, I think.  Unless I am mistaken, it was from the downs you were standing on when taking this shot - or a nearby location - that hang gliding took off (so-to-speak) when it first came in to fashion.  I lived in that area and did everything I could to get away after growing up - on to Cornwall, London, Greece, China, Taiwan, and the USA where my catharsis of travel got constipated.  Looking at your great shots of the local area makes me wonder why on earth I never saw how lovely and exotic it is.  "The other man''s grass..." or whatever the saying is.', '2006-08-08 22:08:31.000000', NULL, 0),
